(1051201, 126285, 6532, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2004-12-08 00:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051202, 126349, 17507, '<td valign="top">nice model</td>', 'nice model', '2004-12-08 00:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051206, 126450, 15811, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo -- I normally don''t like dark, ''in-the-shadow'' photos like this, but this one works for me. <br/> <br/>The only thing that will probably hurt your score is that the yellow lemons are a really dull yellow in color -- if that yellow was boosted, or better lit, I think your entry would get a much higher overall vote.</td>', 'This is a great photo -- I normally don''t like dark, ''in-the-shadow'' photos like this, but this one works for me.  The only thing that will probably hurt your score is that the yellow lemons are a really dull yellow in color -- if that yellow was boosted, or better lit, I think your entry would get a much higher overall vote.', '2004-12-08 00:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051207, 125278, 27842, '<td valign="top">Image is too small and underexposed.</td>', 'Image is too small and underexposed.', '2004-12-08 00:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051208, 125311, 6532, '<td valign="top">Sorry but this hurts my eyes - and I generally like impressionist.</td>', 'Sorry but this hurts my eyes - and I generally like impressionist.', '2004-12-08 00:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051211, 126728, 21202, '<td valign="top">Some highlit text would add here.  The light  needs to be more diffused to eliminate glare.    Also, the composition is problematic as is the slightly our of focus text.  A 5.</td>', 'Some highlit text would add here.  The light  needs to be more diffused to eliminate glare.    Also, the composition is problematic as is the slightly our of focus text.  A 5.', '2004-12-08 00:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051212, 125977, 27842, '<td valign="top">Nice artistic composition</td>', 'Nice artistic composition', '2004-12-08 00:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051216, 126807, 29945, '<td valign="top">This would have been a terrific shot if you had not blocked the front door of the house witht he tree and lost the shadow in the lower right of the building. Go left still keeping in the perspective of the path  so you could have gotten the front door to show. If it was your home to do so, I would have also opened it a crack..it would naturally invite the eye to peek in. Keeping the perspective of the path I would have lowered the shot..or laid down on the ground to get it..that way the yellow house  would really have jumped off a blue sky. Go retake it I bet you will see the resulting composition will thrill you.</td>', 'This would have been a terrific shot if you had not blocked the front door of the house witht he tree and lost the shadow in the lower right of the building. Go left still keeping in the perspective of the path  so you could have gotten the front door to show. If it was your home to do so, I would have also opened it a crack..it would naturally invite the eye to peek in. Keeping the perspective of the path I would have lowered the shot..or laid down on the ground to get it..that way the yellow house  would really have jumped off a blue sky. Go retake it I bet you will see the resulting composition will thrill you.', '2004-12-08 00:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051217, 126874, 22384, '<td valign="top">I like the message of this photo. The direction of the needle, up and to the right, with the bracelet in the upper half of the frame shows hope. The use of yellow against the black is stunning. I love this image. Powerful image with a lot of thought. Nice work!</td>', 'I like the message of this photo. The direction of the needle, up and to the right, with the bracelet in the upper half of the frame shows hope. The use of yellow against the black is stunning. I love this image. Powerful image with a lot of thought. Nice work!', '2004-12-08 00:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051218, 126771, 1717, '<td valign="top">simple...beautiful.  has a zen-like (albeit a freakin'' COLD zen-like) feel to it.  well done!</td>', 'simple...beautiful.  has a zen-like (albeit a freakin'' COLD zen-like) feel to it.  well done!', '2004-12-08 00:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051219, 126330, 27842, '<td valign="top">What are those, fruits? Nuts?  Nice detail and light.</td>', 'What are those, fruits? Nuts?  Nice detail and light.', '2004-12-08 00:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051220, 125977, 6532, '<td valign="top">A bit too bright.</td>', 'A bit too bright.', '2004-12-08 00:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051222, 126667, 21202, '<td valign="top">A very adorable child.  The yellow overpowers her.  A 6</td>', 'A very adorable child.  The yellow overpowers her.  A 6', '2004-12-08 00:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051223, 126349, 15811, '<td valign="top">hrmm...Your focus seems a bit off here.  The lighting is a bit harsh on the front left quarter panel.  Possibly a different background and some better lighting would have done you more justice such as in a parking lot with some other cars out of focus in the background.</td>', 'hrmm...Your focus seems a bit off here.  The lighting is a bit harsh on the front left quarter panel.  Possibly a different background and some better lighting would have done you more justice such as in a parking lot with some other cars out of focus in the background.', '2004-12-08 00:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051228, 126599, 6532, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2004-12-08 00:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051229, 126198, 15811, '<td valign="top">Looks interesting.   Your photo will probably not score all that high because there just isn''t enough yellow for the average voter to consider it the impact of the photo.</td>', 'Looks interesting.   Your photo will probably not score all that high because there just isn''t enough yellow for the average voter to consider it the impact of the photo.', '2004-12-08 00:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051230, 126645, 21202, '<td valign="top">The out of focus is overlit and the infocus is under lit. A 4.<br/></td>', 'The out of focus is overlit and the infocus is under lit. A 4.', '2004-12-08 00:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051231, 125852, 29269, '<td valign="top">My monitor''s calibration probably isn''t the best, but the fish leans towards green. I''ll pretend it''s yellow, though. Very nice photo, indeed. I like the contrast against the purple background. My eyes circle around the image, constantly discovering one interesting spot after another. The only thing that bothers me a little bit is that the yellow fish seems to suck on that corral on the left. I only wish it was a little above or below it. Solid 7.</td>', 'My monitor''s calibration probably isn''t the best, but the fish leans towards green. I''ll pretend it''s yellow, though. Very nice photo, indeed. I like the contrast against the purple background. My eyes circle around the image, constantly discovering one interesting spot after another. The only thing that bothers me a little bit is that the yellow fish seems to suck on that corral on the left. I only wish it was a little above or below it. Solid 7.', '2004-12-08 00:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051233, 125879, 27842, '<td valign="top">Nice work</td>', 'Nice work', '2004-12-08 00:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051236, 126706, 22384, '<td valign="top">Interesting framing. Lemons lacks creativity and the background is distracting. I admire your use of image within the frame and the use of the knife to point the eye, like and arrow, toward your focal point. The juice is also a nice touch.</td>', 'Interesting framing. Lemons lacks creativity and the background is distracting. I admire your use of image within the frame and the use of the knife to point the eye, like and arrow, toward your focal point. The juice is also a nice touch.', '2004-12-08 00:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051238, 126824, 27842, '<td valign="top">Cool effect.</td>', 'Cool effect.', '2004-12-08 00:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051241, 126747, 29945, '<td valign="top">Outstanding composition and the texture on that gouard works great with the steel.<br/>I gave you a big fat 10!</td>', 'Outstanding composition and the texture on that gouard works great with the steel.I gave you a big fat 10!', '2004-12-08 00:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051242, 126138, 22384, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea. Very creative. I think that the smeared ink of the text is a nice touch. Using the black and white page to get the yellow is smart. Good job.</td>', 'This is a good idea. Very creative. I think that the smeared ink of the text is a nice touch. Using the black and white page to get the yellow is smart. Good job.', '2004-12-08 00:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051244, 125891, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. The gold reflections off the roofs  really help.  A little fill flash would have helped the near towers.   The sky is a little mottled.  Did you use Neat Image?  A 7.</td>', 'Very pretty. The gold reflections off the roofs  really help.  A little fill flash would have helped the near towers.   The sky is a little mottled.  Did you use Neat Image?  A 7.', '2004-12-08 00:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
