(1051389, 126267, 22384, '<td valign="top">Fun title. The blur on the inside pedals bothers me. I want to see every wrinkle of this flower''s death throes. Great idea. Also, nice touch with the positioning of having the flower face to the left (the past). Whether intentional or not, it is nice to see the use of artistic/symbolic elements in photos. The blue is stunning. There are many good things about this shot. Nice job.</td>', 'Fun title. The blur on the inside pedals bothers me. I want to see every wrinkle of this flower''s death throes. Great idea. Also, nice touch with the positioning of having the flower face to the left (the past). Whether intentional or not, it is nice to see the use of artistic/symbolic elements in photos. The blue is stunning. There are many good things about this shot. Nice job.', '2004-12-08 01:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051390, 126689, 29557, '<td valign="top">amazing photo</td>', 'amazing photo', '2004-12-08 01:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
