(1051406, 126742, 21202, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty difficult subject.  The hottest lava has about exhausted the variation in yellow, and the crevices don''t allow light..  There are some interesting variations in texture and the composition is good.   A 6.<br/> <br/></td>', 'This is a pretty difficult subject.  The hottest lava has about exhausted the variation in yellow, and the crevices don''t allow light..  There are some interesting variations in texture and the composition is good.   A 6. ', '2004-12-08 01:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051411, 125651, 22384, '<td valign="top">Stunning monochormatic image. Great composition. My only criticism is that I think the entire image would transcend to the highest level is it were all in crisp and tight focus. Given your careful composition, I am fairly certain that the soft focus on the wheat was a choice,  not an accident. My desire to have it all in focus is really a matter of taste, and, given the initial impact of this stunning image, probably a bit petty. Nice shot. High impact image.</td>', 'Stunning monochormatic image. Great composition. My only criticism is that I think the entire image would transcend to the highest level is it were all in crisp and tight focus. Given your careful composition, I am fairly certain that the soft focus on the wheat was a choice,  not an accident. My desire to have it all in focus is really a matter of taste, and, given the initial impact of this stunning image, probably a bit petty. Nice shot. High impact image.', '2004-12-08 01:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1051412, 126125, 21202, '<td valign="top">A lower wattage light bulb with a longer exposure might have helped.  The wall is interesting.  A 5.</td>', 'A lower wattage light bulb with a longer exposure might have helped.  The wall is interesting.  A 5.', '2004-12-08 01:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
