(1051421, 126772, 21202, '<td valign="top">A nice point of view.  I like how far you can see the stripes under the cat.  I like this better when I crop off the buildings on the left.  A 7.</td>', 'A nice point of view.  I like how far you can see the stripes under the cat.  I like this better when I crop off the buildings on the left.  A 7.', '2004-12-08 01:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
