(1051602, 125898, 7252, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea but the color is very flat and dull. A slight adjustment of Hue/Saturation (increase yellow saturation and lightness) and Selective color (increase yellow and decrease black) makes the yellows pop and overall improves the photo.</td>', 'Interesting idea but the color is very flat and dull. A slight adjustment of Hue/Saturation (increase yellow saturation and lightness) and Selective color (increase yellow and decrease black) makes the yellows pop and overall improves the photo.', '2004-12-08 04:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
