(1052080, 125852, 12108, '<td valign="top">Aquarium shots acan be very difficult, and you pulled it off very well. only thing I see that needs improvement would be the crispness of the photo. (7)</td>', 'Aquarium shots acan be very difficult, and you pulled it off very well. only thing I see that needs improvement would be the crispness of the photo. (7)', '2004-12-08 11:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
