(1052092, 126341, 26756, '<td valign="top">Great model, great color, beautiful pose.  But for me, a bit too hot in too many places.  I think this would have been incredible with much softer diffused light.</td>', 'Great model, great color, beautiful pose.  But for me, a bit too hot in too many places.  I think this would have been incredible with much softer diffused light.', '2004-12-08 11:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
