(1052467, 126695, 12733, '<td valign="top">Quite a tour de force, but this type of shot is becoming almost a cliche on this site. This is well done, though; I especially like the highlights on the glass and droplets.</td>', 'Quite a tour de force, but this type of shot is becoming almost a cliche on this site. This is well done, though; I especially like the highlights on the glass and droplets.', '2004-12-08 14:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
