(1052485, 125898, 12733, '<td valign="top">Kind of a reversal of the challenge; the yellow is the background. Yes, I know the cat''s eyes are yellow, which helps to meet the challenge. I find the wide-angle distortion excessive, it makes the cat''s head look all out of proportion to its body.</td>', 'Kind of a reversal of the challenge; the yellow is the background. Yes, I know the cat''s eyes are yellow, which helps to meet the challenge. I find the wide-angle distortion excessive, it makes the cat''s head look all out of proportion to its body.', '2004-12-08 14:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
