(1052489, 125566, 12733, '<td valign="top">That''s a yellow to knock your eye out! I think a more off-white background would work better, but the pepper itself is super sharp and very yellow. Nice composition, too.</td>', 'That''s a yellow to knock your eye out! I think a more off-white background would work better, but the pepper itself is super sharp and very yellow. Nice composition, too.', '2004-12-08 14:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
