(1052845, 126806, 21202, '<td valign="top">This appears to have been desaturated almost to grey scale without desaturating the yellow liquid infusion.  I don''t know how you achieved this, but congratulations, and I look forward to reading  any comments you are willing to offer as to what you did to achieve this effect.  One thing is obvious. You took the picture very quickly after the infusion commenced.  Love the backdrop and glass.  The ice did not fare so well.  A 10.</td>', 'This appears to have been desaturated almost to grey scale without desaturating the yellow liquid infusion.  I don''t know how you achieved this, but congratulations, and I look forward to reading  any comments you are willing to offer as to what you did to achieve this effect.  One thing is obvious. You took the picture very quickly after the infusion commenced.  Love the backdrop and glass.  The ice did not fare so well.  A 10.', '2004-12-08 18:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
