(1052888, 126668, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice pose.  Great models and costumes.  Love the colors.   A 10.</td>', 'Very nice pose.  Great models and costumes.  Love the colors.   A 10.', '2004-12-08 18:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052889, 126256, 21714, '<td valign="top">Very nice colours and interesting compositon. I like it a lot.</td>', 'Very nice colours and interesting compositon. I like it a lot.', '2004-12-08 18:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052891, 126754, 29440, '<td valign="top">Nice scenic photo, but where is the yellow?  I guess you must be considering the foreground tree has yellow leafs.</td>', 'Nice scenic photo, but where is the yellow?  I guess you must be considering the foreground tree has yellow leafs.', '2004-12-08 18:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052892, 126078, 26756, '<td valign="top">Even though this subject has been done a lot, the framing and the water droplets make it well above average.</td>', 'Even though this subject has been done a lot, the framing and the water droplets make it well above average.', '2004-12-08 18:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052897, 126417, 21202, '<td valign="top">How wonderful.  A 10 and that is lower than this deserves.  Where did you find such a wonderful teddy bear?</td>', 'How wonderful.  A 10 and that is lower than this deserves.  Where did you find such a wonderful teddy bear?', '2004-12-08 18:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052898, 126001, 24841, '<td valign="top">I love this, reminds me of the Caribbean. Good composition.</td>', 'I love this, reminds me of the Caribbean. Good composition.', '2004-12-08 18:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052900, 125642, 25754, '<td valign="top">Nicely setup, I could picture this shot in a magazine.</td>', 'Nicely setup, I could picture this shot in a magazine.', '2004-12-08 18:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052901, 126467, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  A 9.</td>', 'Very nice.  A 9.', '2004-12-08 18:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052903, 126141, 24841, '<td valign="top">Simplicity is always best, just lovely!</td>', 'Simplicity is always best, just lovely!', '2004-12-08 18:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052904, 126138, 21202, '<td valign="top">Now this is how highlighting should be illustrated.  A 10.  Great sense of depth, excellent choices all around.  A 10.</td>', 'Now this is how highlighting should be illustrated.  A 10.  Great sense of depth, excellent choices all around.  A 10.', '2004-12-08 18:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052906, 126198, 21202, '<td valign="top">You did an excellent job photographing the flames and keeping the water and black dome in focus.  An 8.</td>', 'You did an excellent job photographing the flames and keeping the water and black dome in focus.  An 8.', '2004-12-08 18:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052911, 125683, 24841, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful! I don''t think it meets the challenge, just can''t see yellow, but I can''t help myself I give it a 10 anyway!</td>', 'This is so beautiful! I don''t think it meets the challenge, just can''t see yellow, but I can''t help myself I give it a 10 anyway!', '2004-12-08 18:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052914, 126249, 24841, '<td valign="top">Love the contrasting sky.  Would look gold without the lovely blue sky, makes it yellow.  Nice job!</td>', 'Love the contrasting sky.  Would look gold without the lovely blue sky, makes it yellow.  Nice job!', '2004-12-08 18:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052916, 126799, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice fireplug and shadow.  This is a great way of showing a complete form.  The yellow border verges on being overkill for the yellow theme.  A 9.</td>', 'Very nice fireplug and shadow.  This is a great way of showing a complete form.  The yellow border verges on being overkill for the yellow theme.  A 9.', '2004-12-08 18:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052918, 125858, 21202, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  I don''t know that I would want to drink this, but the forms are very pretty.  A 7.</td>', 'Lovely.  I don''t know that I would want to drink this, but the forms are very pretty.  A 7.', '2004-12-08 18:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052922, 126823, 21202, '<td valign="top">At last a rubber ducky that  is not over exposed.  The water effect is really interesting. How did you achieve it?  A 10.</td>', 'At last a rubber ducky that  is not over exposed.  The water effect is really interesting. How did you achieve it?  A 10.', '2004-12-08 18:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052923, 126341, 21714, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Beautiful image. Best of luck.</td>', 'Nicely done. Beautiful image. Best of luck.', '2004-12-08 18:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052924, 126023, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice carving nice lighting and setting.  A 10.</td>', 'Nice carving nice lighting and setting.  A 10.', '2004-12-08 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052925, 126158, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice shapes colors and composition.  A 10.</td>', 'Very nice shapes colors and composition.  A 10.', '2004-12-08 18:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052926, 126603, 21202, '<td valign="top">Outrageously beautiful. A 10</td>', 'Outrageously beautiful. A 10', '2004-12-08 18:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052927, 125650, 21202, '<td valign="top">Adorable.  A 10.  I hope you explain the lighiting.  We are expecting a grandchild next summer.  I would love to be able to take shots like this.</td>', 'Adorable.  A 10.  I hope you explain the lighiting.  We are expecting a grandchild next summer.  I would love to be able to take shots like this.', '2004-12-08 18:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052934, 125949, 21202, '<td valign="top">The seamless transition that some people achieve in their tabletop studios from surface to backdrop seems a little preferable to this.  The reflective surface is also problematic.  I appreciate your wanting to go beyond lemons and yellow peppers, I just am not so pleased with the direction you took.  A 6.</td>', 'The seamless transition that some people achieve in their tabletop studios from surface to backdrop seems a little preferable to this.  The reflective surface is also problematic.  I appreciate your wanting to go beyond lemons and yellow peppers, I just am not so pleased with the direction you took.  A 6.', '2004-12-08 18:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052936, 126648, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice back drop.  The cropping on the right side seems unnecessarily tight.  A 9.</td>', 'Nice back drop.  The cropping on the right side seems unnecessarily tight.  A 9.', '2004-12-08 18:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052937, 126217, 22734, '<td valign="top">More like something that should hang on the wall of the Museum of Mmodern Art.<br/>The traditional on the right and its abstract child on the left. Cool Bumping high..</td>', 'More like something that should hang on the wall of the Museum of Mmodern Art.The traditional on the right and its abstract child on the left. Cool Bumping high..', '2004-12-08 18:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052943, 126224, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrai, lighting, model''s expression, and backdrop.  I like your border as well.  You obviously can make a living in portraiture.  A 10.</td>', 'Very nice portrai, lighting, model''s expression, and backdrop.  I like your border as well.  You obviously can make a living in portraiture.  A 10.', '2004-12-08 18:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052944, 126565, 21202, '<td valign="top">What a nice display of appreciation.  Great photo as well .   A 9.</td>', 'What a nice display of appreciation.  Great photo as well .   A 9.', '2004-12-08 18:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052945, 126805, 21714, '<td valign="top">Very creative capture. Definitely not the way we''re used to seeing bananas. Love the way you have combined it all to create a very pleasing image.  Great job.</td>', 'Very creative capture. Definitely not the way we''re used to seeing bananas. Love the way you have combined it all to create a very pleasing image.  Great job.', '2004-12-08 18:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052947, 126020, 25754, '<td valign="top">beautiful!</td>', 'beautiful!', '2004-12-08 19:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052949, 125649, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice display of motion.  The fixed sign is definitely fixed.  It is neat how close the bottom of the sign comes to the top of the engine.  I love the composition except fot the vines or whatever covering the railroad crossing sign on the right side.  A 9.</td>', 'Very nice display of motion.  The fixed sign is definitely fixed.  It is neat how close the bottom of the sign comes to the top of the engine.  I love the composition except fot the vines or whatever covering the railroad crossing sign on the right side.  A 9.', '2004-12-08 19:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052953, 126767, 21202, '<td valign="top">This looks like coffee burned inside a glass pot which is backlit thru a clean spot and lit from the front as well.  The textures are very interesting.  An 8.</td>', 'This looks like coffee burned inside a glass pot which is backlit thru a clean spot and lit from the front as well.  The textures are very interesting.  An 8.', '2004-12-08 19:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052959, 126461, 21202, '<td valign="top">It just goes to show that splash pictures can always be improved on.  I love the blue and gold with the white of the splash.  Nice borders as well.  A 10.</td>', 'It just goes to show that splash pictures can always be improved on.  I love the blue and gold with the white of the splash.  Nice borders as well.  A 10.', '2004-12-08 19:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052965, 125930, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice choices of setting and models.  I love the border as well.  Good table top set  up, with just the right amount of sparkle on bug''s side, leg and tail.  A 10.</td>', 'Nice choices of setting and models.  I love the border as well.  Good table top set  up, with just the right amount of sparkle on bug''s side, leg and tail.  A 10.', '2004-12-08 19:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052970, 125999, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect.   I would like this better if the light were more diffused.  An 8.</td>', 'Very nice effect.   I would like this better if the light were more diffused.  An 8.', '2004-12-08 19:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052971, 125685, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  A 10.</td>', 'Very nice.  A 10.', '2004-12-08 19:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052976, 126841, 21202, '<td valign="top">You need a slide rule and a manual typewriter to keep this from being anachronistic.  Other than the top left corner, I do like this picture for its colors, focus, and composition.  It seems a little underlit.  A 6.</td>', 'You need a slide rule and a manual typewriter to keep this from being anachronistic.  Other than the top left corner, I do like this picture for its colors, focus, and composition.  It seems a little underlit.  A 6.', '2004-12-08 19:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052982, 126726, 21202, '<td valign="top">Well done.  Overexposure or fuzziness would have been real easy here, and you avoided both.  It however, is not the most compelling of images.  A 7.</td>', 'Well done.  Overexposure or fuzziness would have been real easy here, and you avoided both.  It however, is not the most compelling of images.  A 7.', '2004-12-08 19:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052986, 126732, 21202, '<td valign="top">Did you try this at different exposures?  I have a sense that it would be even nicer with less exposure. Glad I did not use that title.  I do like the overall feeling of this picture very much. A 9.</td>', 'Did you try this at different exposures?  I have a sense that it would be even nicer with less exposure. Glad I did not use that title.  I do like the overall feeling of this picture very much. A 9.', '2004-12-08 19:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052993, 126882, 21202, '<td valign="top">What a nice clean imachine and image thereof.  A 9.  I would have cropped off the bike on the right, although I can see that it gives some balance  to the picture.  Without it, though, the main subject really stands out.</td>', 'What a nice clean imachine and image thereof.  A 9.  I would have cropped off the bike on the right, although I can see that it gives some balance  to the picture.  Without it, though, the main subject really stands out.', '2004-12-08 19:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052997, 126718, 21202, '<td valign="top">Wonderful arrangement, textures, and colors. How could you have imagined these were squash? A silly imagination indeed.  A10.</td>', 'Wonderful arrangement, textures, and colors. How could you have imagined these were squash? A silly imagination indeed.  A10.', '2004-12-08 19:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053003, 125616, 21202, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the pole is.  The composition is nice, the picture is a little dim even with the bright colored fireplug.  A 7.</td>', 'Not sure what the pole is.  The composition is nice, the picture is a little dim even with the bright colored fireplug.  A 7.', '2004-12-08 19:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053014, 125730, 21202, '<td valign="top">Point taken by yellow cup.  An 8.  I love the colors and composition.  The shadow across the handle is a little harsh even though yellow cups probably deserve such treatment.</td>', 'Point taken by yellow cup.  An 8.  I love the colors and composition.  The shadow across the handle is a little harsh even though yellow cups probably deserve such treatment.', '2004-12-08 19:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053018, 126693, 21202, '<td valign="top">Yum.  I wondered when I would get to a picture of butter.  The light spot on the top right really helps brighten this picture up  A 7, mainly I think the lighting and composition could be improved.  The lighting with more diffused light, and the composition by eliminating black object on left and rearranging the biscuits.  I like the crumbs though.</td>', 'Yum.  I wondered when I would get to a picture of butter.  The light spot on the top right really helps brighten this picture up  A 7, mainly I think the lighting and composition could be improved.  The lighting with more diffused light, and the composition by eliminating black object on left and rearranging the biscuits.  I like the crumbs though.', '2004-12-08 19:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053019, 125583, 30301, '<td valign="top">love it, love the shadowing...could have been used for the wind challenge.</td>', 'love it, love the shadowing...could have been used for the wind challenge.', '2004-12-08 19:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053022, 126771, 30301, '<td valign="top">classic contrast</td>', 'classic contrast', '2004-12-08 19:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053023, 126796, 30301, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2004-12-08 19:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053026, 125642, 30301, '<td valign="top">nice idea &amp; solid execution</td>', 'nice idea & solid execution', '2004-12-08 19:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053027, 126749, 21202, '<td valign="top">This looks like selective sampling  to prop up a hypothesis.  Seriously, though this picture would be very much enhanced by being taken using the diffused lighting techniques used for product marketing.  There is a lot of unnecessary glare and shadow.  I am curious though as to Diophantane Geometry and Analysis.  A 7.</td>', 'This looks like selective sampling  to prop up a hypothesis.  Seriously, though this picture would be very much enhanced by being taken using the diffused lighting techniques used for product marketing.  There is a lot of unnecessary glare and shadow.  I am curious though as to Diophantane Geometry and Analysis.  A 7.', '2004-12-08 19:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053028, 125900, 30301, '<td valign="top">near perfect</td>', 'near perfect', '2004-12-08 19:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053029, 125592, 19066, '<td valign="top">gorgeous shot!</td>', 'gorgeous shot!', '2004-12-08 19:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053030, 126197, 30301, '<td valign="top">nice photo</td>', 'nice photo', '2004-12-08 19:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053032, 125706, 30301, '<td valign="top">amazing shot..great texture</td>', 'amazing shot..great texture', '2004-12-08 19:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053035, 126125, 19066, '<td valign="top">if only the power cord was gone...</td>', 'if only the power cord was gone...', '2004-12-08 19:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053037, 126805, 30301, '<td valign="top">very interesting</td>', 'very interesting', '2004-12-08 19:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053038, 126826, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice yellow.  The chain and soil  are also quite well rendered.  A9.</td>', 'Very nice yellow.  The chain and soil  are also quite well rendered.  A9.', '2004-12-08 19:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053039, 126148, 30301, '<td valign="top">unusual subject choice- well done</td>', 'unusual subject choice- well done', '2004-12-08 19:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053040, 125601, 19066, '<td valign="top">nice concept -- perhaps if the flower was larger or more striking it would be more powerful.</td>', 'nice concept -- perhaps if the flower was larger or more striking it would be more powerful.', '2004-12-08 19:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053042, 126158, 19066, '<td valign="top">i don''t wanna grow up, i''m a toys''r''us kid...  sorry -- had to do it :)  nice shot.</td>', 'i don''t wanna grow up, i''m a toys''r''us kid...  sorry -- had to do it :)  nice shot.', '2004-12-08 19:47:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1053043, 126532, 19066, '<td valign="top">i like the concept.  perhaps it would be more striking against a black background?</td>', 'i like the concept.  perhaps it would be more striking against a black background?', '2004-12-08 19:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053045, 125900, 19066, '<td valign="top">great shot, but the yellow border detracts.</td>', 'great shot, but the yellow border detracts.', '2004-12-08 19:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053050, 126788, 29177, '<td valign="top">I will be very interested to see how you did this! Very interesting!</td>', 'I will be very interested to see how you did this! Very interesting!', '2004-12-08 19:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053053, 126689, 19066, '<td valign="top">if the brake handle was a muted color this image would be perfect.  very nice.</td>', 'if the brake handle was a muted color this image would be perfect.  very nice.', '2004-12-08 19:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053056, 126727, 19066, '<td valign="top">sweeeeeet ride.</td>', 'sweeeeeet ride.', '2004-12-08 19:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053067, 126788, 28742, '<td valign="top">Ok - I''m wondering how this was done...</td>', 'Ok - I''m wondering how this was done...', '2004-12-08 20:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053068, 126461, 14763, '<td valign="top">Nicely Done!!!! Great Job<br/></td>', 'Nicely Done!!!! Great Job', '2004-12-08 20:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053069, 126165, 28742, '<td valign="top">mmmmm Pie...<br/>I like it. Maybe a little brighter, but still looks good.</td>', 'mmmmm Pie...I like it. Maybe a little brighter, but still looks good.', '2004-12-08 20:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053076, 126539, 28742, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but it seems odd that he doesn''t have a shirt on.</td>', 'Nice shot, but it seems odd that he doesn''t have a shirt on.', '2004-12-08 20:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053077, 126728, 28742, '<td valign="top">Just one would''ve been better I think</td>', 'Just one would''ve been better I think', '2004-12-08 20:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053078, 125999, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting helps this picture stand out.</td>', 'Interesting lighting helps this picture stand out.', '2004-12-08 20:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053080, 126674, 28742, '<td valign="top">I like this - the setup the desat, the comp. But the apple is not yellow enough. a bright lemon would''ve had more contrast &amp; impact. Still a good score from me.</td>', 'I like this - the setup the desat, the comp. But the apple is not yellow enough. a bright lemon would''ve had more contrast & impact. Still a good score from me.', '2004-12-08 20:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053081, 126098, 28742, '<td valign="top">I''m dizzy.</td>', 'I''m dizzy.', '2004-12-08 20:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053084, 126806, 28742, '<td valign="top">Cool. But can you write your name in the snow?  ;-)<br/>Glass is a little fuzzy and maybe see some jpg artifacts, but pretty good.</td>', 'Cool. But can you write your name in the snow?  ;-)Glass is a little fuzzy and maybe see some jpg artifacts, but pretty good.', '2004-12-08 20:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053087, 126752, 28742, '<td valign="top">Not liking the angle or the shadows or the glare spot. On a positive note - it''s very yellow!  :-)</td>', 'Not liking the angle or the shadows or the glare spot. On a positive note - it''s very yellow!  :-)', '2004-12-08 20:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053090, 126027, 28742, '<td valign="top">Good color, but maybe not sharp enough?</td>', 'Good color, but maybe not sharp enough?', '2004-12-08 20:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053091, 126839, 28742, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of good aspects to this shot - if I had to suggest one change it would be to have some text being highlighted since it is a highlighter. Maybe a famous quote or something - would tie it to the title. Ok, one more thing - a little sharper. Good job though.</td>', 'There is a lot of good aspects to this shot - if I had to suggest one change it would be to have some text being highlighted since it is a highlighter. Maybe a famous quote or something - would tie it to the title. Ok, one more thing - a little sharper. Good job though.', '2004-12-08 20:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053095, 126654, 28742, '<td valign="top">A little brighter or more sat woulda raised you a point. I like it though.</td>', 'A little brighter or more sat woulda raised you a point. I like it though.', '2004-12-08 20:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053097, 126656, 19978, '<td valign="top">Yellow, I''m not sure, but WOW.</td>', 'Yellow, I''m not sure, but WOW.', '2004-12-08 20:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053098, 125949, 28742, '<td valign="top">Ah, the Lemon Stalker. Cute, clever! A little brighter maybe. Is that his stem or is he just happy to see them?  :-)</td>', 'Ah, the Lemon Stalker. Cute, clever! A little brighter maybe. Is that his stem or is he just happy to see them?  :-)', '2004-12-08 20:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053099, 126755, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice image, the lighting, of course, makes it.  Is that steam I see ever so barely? The highlight on the edge of the rind in a great touch. This works well for me.</td>', 'Nice image, the lighting, of course, makes it.  Is that steam I see ever so barely? The highlight on the edge of the rind in a great touch. This works well for me.', '2004-12-08 20:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053102, 126306, 28742, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I can''t not like it, but seems like it could be a little better - ...maybe more saturated yellow?  Nicely done though.</td>', 'Very nice. I can''t not like it, but seems like it could be a little better - ...maybe more saturated yellow?  Nicely done though.', '2004-12-08 20:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053104, 126651, 30444, '<td valign="top">Very unique.</td>', 'Very unique.', '2004-12-08 20:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053105, 126707, 28742, '<td valign="top">Very intersting. Very Yellow. Hard to see the focal point though, but overall I like it.</td>', 'Very intersting. Very Yellow. Hard to see the focal point though, but overall I like it.', '2004-12-08 20:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053109, 125937, 22384, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I am not sure what it is, not that I have to know what something is to like it, but. It looks like leaves, but part of one leaf looks like the fin of a fish. Fascinating and risky. I like your daring...8</td>', 'I like this, but I am not sure what it is, not that I have to know what something is to like it, but. It looks like leaves, but part of one leaf looks like the fin of a fish. Fascinating and risky. I like your daring...8', '2004-12-08 20:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053111, 126565, 24065, '<td valign="top">The focus is very clear and the colors are wonderful.  I''m afraid the artificial flowers might hurt your score.  And I think the composition might be improved, but I don''t know enough about what I''m doing to be more specific :(  It looks like you have a great camera and know how to use it well.  Hope these comments are helpful :)</td>', 'The focus is very clear and the colors are wonderful.  I''m afraid the artificial flowers might hurt your score.  And I think the composition might be improved, but I don''t know enough about what I''m doing to be more specific :(  It looks like you have a great camera and know how to use it well.  Hope these comments are helpful :)', '2004-12-08 20:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053113, 125601, 28742, '<td valign="top">Brighter yellow and tighter crop (remove corners) and I''d have given it a point higher.   :-)</td>', 'Brighter yellow and tighter crop (remove corners) and I''d have given it a point higher.   :-)', '2004-12-08 20:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053116, 126117, 23913, '<td valign="top">a polirizing filter would have been of use to u for the shot as it would have cut down on the reflection of the other car.(just something for future).<br/> <br/>this is a great eye grabing shot with nothing elece really wrong tech. or otherwise so i like it.-thanks for not just doing a boring shot of the whole car.<br/>GL</td>', 'a polirizing filter would have been of use to u for the shot as it would have cut down on the reflection of the other car.(just something for future). this is a great eye grabing shot with nothing elece really wrong tech. or otherwise so i like it.-thanks for not just doing a boring shot of the whole car.GL', '2004-12-08 20:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053117, 126286, 24065, '<td valign="top">The colors are beautiful and the focus is great.  It appears that you used direct rather diffused light -- I think that might hurt your score a little.  It might also have helped to put the fish on the rule of thirds -- I know it''s a guideline, but I think it would have helped the composition here.  :)</td>', 'The colors are beautiful and the focus is great.  It appears that you used direct rather diffused light -- I think that might hurt your score a little.  It might also have helped to put the fish on the rule of thirds -- I know it''s a guideline, but I think it would have helped the composition here.  :)', '2004-12-08 20:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053119, 126885, 28742, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what "dlr" is or how it relates to the photo, but I like the image - very interesting.</td>', 'I don''t know what "dlr" is or how it relates to the photo, but I like the image - very interesting.', '2004-12-08 20:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053120, 125375, 22384, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this except the cropping. The flowers facing left symbolize the past or looking back, and having them come out of the right side of the frame gives me the feeling of moving away from something. The color and water drops as very nice. I would crop this image tighter from the left, ease it in further from the right, or flip it so that it faces right, to the future because these flowers are so fresh and the color is so brilliant and hopeful. Beautiful flowers...7</td>', 'I like everything about this except the cropping. The flowers facing left symbolize the past or looking back, and having them come out of the right side of the frame gives me the feeling of moving away from something. The color and water drops as very nice. I would crop this image tighter from the left, ease it in further from the right, or flip it so that it faces right, to the future because these flowers are so fresh and the color is so brilliant and hopeful. Beautiful flowers...7', '2004-12-08 20:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053121, 126249, 24715, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of Ukranian Catholic church in East Baltimore. Those golden domes are quite nice. They really stand out in your photo against dark blue sky.</td>', 'Nice shot of Ukranian Catholic church in East Baltimore. Those golden domes are quite nice. They really stand out in your photo against dark blue sky.', '2004-12-08 20:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053122, 126383, 24065, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the abstract feel of this photograph.  I''m sure it will end up being one of my favorites in the challenge.  BOL</td>', 'I love the colors and the abstract feel of this photograph.  I''m sure it will end up being one of my favorites in the challenge.  BOL', '2004-12-08 20:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
