(1053127, 126841, 24065, '<td valign="top">This is a clever idea and your focus is very good.  I know there are many who disagree with me (as proven by many past ribbon-winners), but I think a photograph should be able to stand on its own merit apart from the challenge.  I would say this photo is a little weak in that area.  Hope this is helpful :)</td>', 'This is a clever idea and your focus is very good.  I know there are many who disagree with me (as proven by many past ribbon-winners), but I think a photograph should be able to stand on its own merit apart from the challenge.  I would say this photo is a little weak in that area.  Hope this is helpful :)', '2004-12-08 20:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
