(1053132, 126877, 22384, '<td valign="top">This is too scattered for me. I would like a direction or a focal point. Image could be crisper. Make the obscured toy your focal point, or the yellow giraffe since this the yellow challenge, maybe, and the other toys around it, drawing attention to it, or away from it... The yellow cloth strap is distracting. Give me as your view a way to go with this.</td>', 'This is too scattered for me. I would like a direction or a focal point. Image could be crisper. Make the obscured toy your focal point, or the yellow giraffe since this the yellow challenge, maybe, and the other toys around it, drawing attention to it, or away from it... The yellow cloth strap is distracting. Give me as your view a way to go with this.', '2004-12-08 20:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053133, 126668, 24065, '<td valign="top">Beautiful focus and color.  I think a centered composition works well here.  One of the best in the challenge in my opinion.  :)  BOL</td>', 'Beautiful focus and color.  I think a centered composition works well here.  One of the best in the challenge in my opinion.  :)  BOL', '2004-12-08 20:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
