(1053135, 125345, 24065, '<td valign="top">How wise to use the complementary color as a background and add a little touch of humor, too.  Good focus and composition.  It does lack some of the interest for me that a few of the other entries have, but you have a technically sound photograph here, IMO  :)  BOL</td>', 'How wise to use the complementary color as a background and add a little touch of humor, too.  Good focus and composition.  It does lack some of the interest for me that a few of the other entries have, but you have a technically sound photograph here, IMO  :)  BOL', '2004-12-08 20:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
