(1053150, 126459, 22384, '<td valign="top">Actually, I love this idea. Take the ordinary and give it a disorienting twist. The cropping doesn''t work for me, and that is the only thing I would change. Great thinking. I like the creative brain behind this shot. When you take an icon and turn it on its ear it gives a nice iconoclastic shove to your viewers'' perception of the world. Bravo to a thinking photographer...8</td>', 'Actually, I love this idea. Take the ordinary and give it a disorienting twist. The cropping doesn''t work for me, and that is the only thing I would change. Great thinking. I like the creative brain behind this shot. When you take an icon and turn it on its ear it gives a nice iconoclastic shove to your viewers'' perception of the world. Bravo to a thinking photographer...8', '2004-12-08 20:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
