(1053185, 126224, 22384, '<td valign="top">As a blonde, I really hate having my hair called yellow. Just a personal quirk. I like the soft, buttery, yellow shirt, and, I have to admit, I like the yellow of her hair. The only thing I would change is the color of the background. It doesn''t complement or showcase your subject. Creative take on the subject. (Actually, I have three blonde daughters,  two blonde -okay they are yellow- dogs, and one bald husband ; ) so I actually contemplated something like this.  7</td>', 'As a blonde, I really hate having my hair called yellow. Just a personal quirk. I like the soft, buttery, yellow shirt, and, I have to admit, I like the yellow of her hair. The only thing I would change is the color of the background. It doesn''t complement or showcase your subject. Creative take on the subject. (Actually, I have three blonde daughters,  two blonde -okay they are yellow- dogs, and one bald husband ; ) so I actually contemplated something like this.  7', '2004-12-08 20:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
