(1053395, 126217, 25787, '<td valign="top">This might win!  Very cool.  Very sharp.  You didn''t need to rotate it, well maybe it makes it better.  good luck with this one.</td>', 'This might win!  Very cool.  Very sharp.  You didn''t need to rotate it, well maybe it makes it better.  good luck with this one.', '2004-12-08 22:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
