(1053441, 126769, 8624, '<td valign="top">I find this interesting, but I have to admit that it kind of creeps me out. It has the feel, to me, of a combination of a hostage picture and a terrorist. I would call this photo a success, despite some technical weaknesses, because it provoked a reaction from me. nice job.</td>', 'I find this interesting, but I have to admit that it kind of creeps me out. It has the feel, to me, of a combination of a hostage picture and a terrorist. I would call this photo a success, despite some technical weaknesses, because it provoked a reaction from me. nice job.', '2004-12-08 22:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053443, 125992, 8624, '<td valign="top">I think this is a rather mundane shot. there is nothing that particularly draws me in and the colors are rather bland. a willow, though attractive from afar, is a fairly cluttered subject up close.</td>', 'I think this is a rather mundane shot. there is nothing that particularly draws me in and the colors are rather bland. a willow, though attractive from afar, is a fairly cluttered subject up close.', '2004-12-08 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053444, 126823, 17507, '<td valign="top">technically excellent. i love the break in surface tension around the ducky''s base.</td>', 'technically excellent. i love the break in surface tension around the ducky''s base.', '2004-12-08 23:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053445, 126773, 8624, '<td valign="top">Max looks very cute and i''m sure he loves his toy. I think you could take a more compelling and flattering picture of him by getting down low to his level and comosing him straight on to catch more of his personality. Use a less cluttered room as well to focus on Max and his toy without the added distractions</td>', 'Max looks very cute and i''m sure he loves his toy. I think you could take a more compelling and flattering picture of him by getting down low to his level and comosing him straight on to catch more of his personality. Use a less cluttered room as well to focus on Max and his toy without the added distractions', '2004-12-08 23:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053446, 126689, 17507, '<td valign="top">this is an awesome picture... not sure that it''s within the bounds of basic editing, tho.</td>', 'this is an awesome picture... not sure that it''s within the bounds of basic editing, tho.', '2004-12-08 23:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053447, 126256, 8624, '<td valign="top">I love rust and old machinery shots. I am always drawn to mechanical imagery. In this case, I think you have an exposure challenge with the dark shadows and bright snowy areas. The snow on the hood is pretty blown out. perhaps a polarizer or dialing down the exposure a stop or two.</td>', 'I love rust and old machinery shots. I am always drawn to mechanical imagery. In this case, I think you have an exposure challenge with the dark shadows and bright snowy areas. The snow on the hood is pretty blown out. perhaps a polarizer or dialing down the exposure a stop or two.', '2004-12-08 23:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053448, 126886, 29513, '<td valign="top">On subject and technically perfect.</td>', 'On subject and technically perfect.', '2004-12-08 23:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053451, 126603, 25183, '<td valign="top">"The color yellow must lead to the impact of the photo."  I really feel that the blue lends more of an impact to the photo than the yellow.  5</td>', '"The color yellow must lead to the impact of the photo."  I really feel that the blue lends more of an impact to the photo than the yellow.  5', '2004-12-08 23:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
