(1053796, 126868, 22384, '<td valign="top">It took a second, but I got it. The shadow creates the stripes mimicking bumble bees. Very clever. Great use of spheres and lines, especially clever because your lines curve as the shadows fall across the apples. So very nice...  an easy 9</td>', 'It took a second, but I got it. The shadow creates the stripes mimicking bumble bees. Very clever. Great use of spheres and lines, especially clever because your lines curve as the shadows fall across the apples. So very nice...  an easy 9', '2004-12-09 02:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053798, 126630, 22384, '<td valign="top">Fun range of color,  and flipping the image creates a startling moment of disorientation. The blown out whites distract a bit. Did you need to do that to enhance the reflection to get the effect your were looking for? Interesting shot.</td>', 'Fun range of color,  and flipping the image creates a startling moment of disorientation. The blown out whites distract a bit. Did you need to do that to enhance the reflection to get the effect your were looking for? Interesting shot.', '2004-12-09 02:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053803, 126883, 22384, '<td valign="top">I like your choice to do something different with this flower. The light source and the floating effect enhance so that they add to,  rather than distract from, this image. Nice shot. Normally, I would think that the background so close in hue to the subject wouldn''t work to showcase the flower, but you make it work very well. Stunning shot.</td>', 'I like your choice to do something different with this flower. The light source and the floating effect enhance so that they add to,  rather than distract from, this image. Nice shot. Normally, I would think that the background so close in hue to the subject wouldn''t work to showcase the flower, but you make it work very well. Stunning shot.', '2004-12-09 03:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053804, 125944, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, the light is just a little too harsh. The shining effect you were going for is a great concept: highlighting the saxaphone and having the player in partial shadow. It does work to focus the eye where you want it, but it is just a little too heavy-handed.</td>', 'Nice idea, the light is just a little too harsh. The shining effect you were going for is a great concept: highlighting the saxaphone and having the player in partial shadow. It does work to focus the eye where you want it, but it is just a little too heavy-handed.', '2004-12-09 03:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053806, 126680, 16241, '<td valign="top">very clever.  so hard to vote, so many good ones this time round :)</td>', 'very clever.  so hard to vote, so many good ones this time round :)', '2004-12-09 03:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053808, 126651, 22384, '<td valign="top">It took a while. I thought at first that these were the starting gates at a horse track -(when you think about it, it actually is a good parallel.) Nice use of line and motif. The repeated curves punctuated by the black circles and showcased by the little bit of snow gives some punch to this image. What store has yellow shopping carts?</td>', 'It took a while. I thought at first that these were the starting gates at a horse track -(when you think about it, it actually is a good parallel.) Nice use of line and motif. The repeated curves punctuated by the black circles and showcased by the little bit of snow gives some punch to this image. What store has yellow shopping carts?', '2004-12-09 03:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053810, 126306, 22384, '<td valign="top">There are just so many lemons in this challenge that it is hard to get excited by another lemon shot. I would encourage you to punch it up: try something daring and different. Some traditionalist may not like it, but hey, at least you''ll get their attention. This image just sort of fades in with the masses. You have great technical skills, now push the edge a bit. I dare you :-)<br/></td>', 'There are just so many lemons in this challenge that it is hard to get excited by another lemon shot. I would encourage you to punch it up: try something daring and different. Some traditionalist may not like it, but hey, at least you''ll get their attention. This image just sort of fades in with the masses. You have great technical skills, now push the edge a bit. I dare you :-)', '2004-12-09 03:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053813, 126815, 22384, '<td valign="top">Masterful. You create a desaturated look without desaturating. And, on top of that, the subtle browns in the bark make this image trascend beyond simple desaturation. So very nice... an 8 from me.</td>', 'Masterful. You create a desaturated look without desaturating. And, on top of that, the subtle browns in the bark make this image trascend beyond simple desaturation. So very nice... an 8 from me.', '2004-12-09 03:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053815, 125671, 22384, '<td valign="top">Hey...wait...is this the humor challenge? No? Not only is this shot captivating and fun,  but you also capture emotion and a sense of michief in the eyes of your subject. Too cool... an 8...easy.</td>', 'Hey...wait...is this the humor challenge? No? Not only is this shot captivating and fun,  but you also capture emotion and a sense of michief in the eyes of your subject. Too cool... an 8...easy.', '2004-12-09 03:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053819, 126678, 22384, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t nature just give us the most captivating curves and swirls in fire and water? Nice idea and well executed. The fact that the flame exits the flame to the left evokes the sense of the past for me. Nice touch...7</td>', 'Doesn''t nature just give us the most captivating curves and swirls in fire and water? Nice idea and well executed. The fact that the flame exits the flame to the left evokes the sense of the past for me. Nice touch...7', '2004-12-09 03:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053823, 126694, 22384, '<td valign="top">Good shot. I think it would transcend if the subject were showing either elation or frustration in reaction to the play on the field. That is what makes crowd shots at sports events rise above the mundane. There is so much power in human emotion. Technically very nice.</td>', 'Good shot. I think it would transcend if the subject were showing either elation or frustration in reaction to the play on the field. That is what makes crowd shots at sports events rise above the mundane. There is so much power in human emotion. Technically very nice.', '2004-12-09 03:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053825, 126061, 16241, '<td valign="top">oh my, and everyone is wearing yellow!<br/>nice capture</td>', 'oh my, and everyone is wearing yellow!nice capture', '2004-12-09 03:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053826, 126888, 22384, '<td valign="top">Lemons and roses. It is hard for one shot of either subject to rise above the others. I like this image, and it is elegant and technically very nice; however, I would encourage you to take a risk next time. You have the skills, now step a bit closer to the edge. Grab us and get our attention with your daring.</td>', 'Lemons and roses. It is hard for one shot of either subject to rise above the others. I like this image, and it is elegant and technically very nice; however, I would encourage you to take a risk next time. You have the skills, now step a bit closer to the edge. Grab us and get our attention with your daring.', '2004-12-09 03:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053831, 126807, 22384, '<td valign="top">Oh, I like this. The dramatic light and shadow work well for me. I want the image to be tipped closer to square. With the extreme light and shadow, the house being slightly askew makes it a bit too disorientating and distracts rather than enhances. Brilliant colors.</td>', 'Oh, I like this. The dramatic light and shadow work well for me. I want the image to be tipped closer to square. With the extreme light and shadow, the house being slightly askew makes it a bit too disorientating and distracts rather than enhances. Brilliant colors.', '2004-12-09 03:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053833, 126696, 17507, '<td valign="top">great lines. cool focal point. i wish the image were a bit sharper.</td>', 'great lines. cool focal point. i wish the image were a bit sharper.', '2004-12-09 03:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
