(1053964, 125584, 25355, '<td valign="top">Nice touch of humour. A bit of extra work, but perhaps you could have changed one or more of the index of 10Books-in-1. e.g. "How to do better than BradP", "Shooting for the Masses" <br/> <br/>"Create eye-catching images for print or no score less than 7"</td>', 'Nice touch of humour. A bit of extra work, but perhaps you could have changed one or more of the index of 10Books-in-1. e.g. "How to do better than BradP", "Shooting for the Masses"  "Create eye-catching images for print or no score less than 7"', '2004-12-09 06:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
