(1053969, 126678, 15497, '<td valign="top">I would have done a different angel, and not "cropped" the flame. I would have added more contrast and leveld down the black. I also would have added a frame.<br/></td>', 'I would have done a different angel, and not "cropped" the flame. I would have added more contrast and leveld down the black. I also would have added a frame.', '2004-12-09 06:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
