(1053971, 126023, 15497, '<td valign="top">Excellent light setup, I really like the warm tones in this one. I fancy your composition. Allaround a GREAT image in my book. Good luck</td>', 'Excellent light setup, I really like the warm tones in this one. I fancy your composition. Allaround a GREAT image in my book. Good luck', '2004-12-09 06:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053972, 126656, 15497, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t get any better then this. I can''t tell you one bit to improve except lose the top. 10</td>', 'It doesn''t get any better then this. I can''t tell you one bit to improve except lose the top. 10', '2004-12-09 06:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053973, 126886, 15497, '<td valign="top">Nicely done here! What''s up with the yellow lookish skin tones on his knuckles?</td>', 'Nicely done here! What''s up with the yellow lookish skin tones on his knuckles?', '2004-12-09 06:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053974, 126001, 3306, '<td valign="top">This picture has potential. A little too much clutter in the backround. The brick floor looks interesting. I wonder how it would look if you moved the chairs more on to the brick and took the picture from directly overhead.</td>', 'This picture has potential. A little too much clutter in the backround. The brick floor looks interesting. I wonder how it would look if you moved the chairs more on to the brick and took the picture from directly overhead.', '2004-12-09 06:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053975, 126078, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nice Macro.</td>', 'Nice Macro.', '2004-12-09 06:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053976, 126877, 15497, '<td valign="top">In my humble opinion, I think there are quite a few places to improve this shot. <br/>1.) It''s soft/unsharp, you can see a thin layer of blur in the image. Try to hold the camera more steady, or use tripod/table/object to steady the camera more.<br/>2.) Also try to sharpen the image using photoshop or paint shop pro, sharpen or USM will make it look much more sharp and detailed.<br/>3.) I can see a lot of the background but the objects are cut. Try to find a different angel that will bring forward the subjects you''re trying to photography.<br/>4.) Add more saturation and contrast will make it more inviting and exciting. <br/> <br/>Hope this helps! Giving you a 5 for the try, good luck.</td>', 'In my humble opinion, I think there are quite a few places to improve this shot. 1.) It''s soft/unsharp, you can see a thin layer of blur in the image. Try to hold the camera more steady, or use tripod/table/object to steady the camera more.2.) Also try to sharpen the image using photoshop or paint shop pro, sharpen or USM will make it look much more sharp and detailed.3.) I can see a lot of the background but the objects are cut. Try to find a different angel that will bring forward the subjects you''re trying to photography.4.) Add more saturation and contrast will make it more inviting and exciting.  Hope this helps! Giving you a 5 for the try, good luck.', '2004-12-09 06:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053977, 125798, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting pattern on this pansy. The backround distracts from the subject. Too bad you couldn''t get in closer.</td>', 'Interesting pattern on this pansy. The backround distracts from the subject. Too bad you couldn''t get in closer.', '2004-12-09 06:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053979, 126727, 15497, '<td valign="top">First eye sight I like this, composition and de-saturation works well. But the more I look, the lower my score goes. It''s clearly over sharpen and over neatimaged. What score did I give you? It''s 4 points higher then 10 in binary. Good luck</td>', 'First eye sight I like this, composition and de-saturation works well. But the more I look, the lower my score goes. It''s clearly over sharpen and over neatimaged. What score did I give you? It''s 4 points higher then 10 in binary. Good luck', '2004-12-09 06:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053980, 126622, 3306, '<td valign="top">This has potential. The flash creates a glare which is distracting and the picture is a little oversaturated. A greater DOF would also have enhanced the quality of your picture.</td>', 'This has potential. The flash creates a glare which is distracting and the picture is a little oversaturated. A greater DOF would also have enhanced the quality of your picture.', '2004-12-09 06:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053981, 126791, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting pattern. Is that a slinky? You might get knocked down because they look a little more green than yellow, but this is a creative idea.</td>', 'Interesting pattern. Is that a slinky? You might get knocked down because they look a little more green than yellow, but this is a creative idea.', '2004-12-09 06:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053983, 126626, 3306, '<td valign="top">This picture has potential. I like the way you used a shallow DOF to accent your subject. Maybe could have been a little lighter.</td>', 'This picture has potential. I like the way you used a shallow DOF to accent your subject. Maybe could have been a little lighter.', '2004-12-09 06:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053985, 126777, 3306, '<td valign="top">That is definitely yellow. No bugs are going near that bulb!</td>', 'That is definitely yellow. No bugs are going near that bulb!', '2004-12-09 06:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053987, 125929, 3306, '<td valign="top">This picture has potential. I think you would have increased the photographic interest my putting the subject off center, maybe lower left to eliminate the distracting pink are in the brick at the bottom of the picture. You may get knocked down because the cat looks more orange than yellow.</td>', 'This picture has potential. I think you would have increased the photographic interest my putting the subject off center, maybe lower left to eliminate the distracting pink are in the brick at the bottom of the picture. You may get knocked down because the cat looks more orange than yellow.', '2004-12-09 06:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053988, 125642, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I wonder how it would have looked if you could have cropped out the lower right side of the picture. For me the end of the table sort of distracts me from the beautiful arrangement you have set up. Maybe zooming in a little and cutting off some of the pasta to the lower left portion of the picture would draw the viewer more into the picture.</td>', 'Nice composition. I wonder how it would have looked if you could have cropped out the lower right side of the picture. For me the end of the table sort of distracts me from the beautiful arrangement you have set up. Maybe zooming in a little and cutting off some of the pasta to the lower left portion of the picture would draw the viewer more into the picture.', '2004-12-09 06:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053990, 126743, 24195, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, one of my favorites! Congrats!</td>', 'Nice concept, one of my favorites! Congrats!', '2004-12-09 06:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053991, 125687, 3306, '<td valign="top">No offense but there just isn''t anything special about this picture. To add interest I would have cropped in more to eliminate the void to the left of the books. Is there some relavance to the yellow book other than it is yellow? Maybe if all the other black books were by one author and the yellow one was by a different author. Or maybe you could have done something with the titles of the books chosen which would have added interest as opposed to just sticking a yellow book amongst black ones. I hope you find this constructive as that is the way it is intended.</td>', 'No offense but there just isn''t anything special about this picture. To add interest I would have cropped in more to eliminate the void to the left of the books. Is there some relavance to the yellow book other than it is yellow? Maybe if all the other black books were by one author and the yellow one was by a different author. Or maybe you could have done something with the titles of the books chosen which would have added interest as opposed to just sticking a yellow book amongst black ones. I hope you find this constructive as that is the way it is intended.', '2004-12-09 06:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053992, 126389, 23458, '<td valign="top">Sorry but the impact of this photo is the dog, not the yellow. Now that is a tremendously cute dog, but the image as a whole has a bit of a snapshot feel to it, next time I''d try and get a little closer to the dog. I''m not a huge fan of animal shots, but you''ve definately got yourself a good subject here if you are that way inclined.</td>', 'Sorry but the impact of this photo is the dog, not the yellow. Now that is a tremendously cute dog, but the image as a whole has a bit of a snapshot feel to it, next time I''d try and get a little closer to the dog. I''m not a huge fan of animal shots, but you''ve definately got yourself a good subject here if you are that way inclined.', '2004-12-09 06:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053993, 126689, 24195, '<td valign="top">Great Image! Congrats!</td>', 'Great Image! Congrats!', '2004-12-09 06:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053994, 126683, 3306, '<td valign="top">Somehow I knew McDonalds would show up in this contest!</td>', 'Somehow I knew McDonalds would show up in this contest!', '2004-12-09 06:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053995, 126377, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting pattern. A picture with potential. I would have played with the DOF. Maybe making the foreground in focus and the backround blurry to diffuse the distracting lower right side.</td>', 'Interesting pattern. A picture with potential. I would have played with the DOF. Maybe making the foreground in focus and the backround blurry to diffuse the distracting lower right side.', '2004-12-09 07:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053996, 126618, 3306, '<td valign="top">I had to look at this for a little while before I figured out what it was. I like that. Gives interest and makes the viewer think.</td>', 'I had to look at this for a little while before I figured out what it was. I like that. Gives interest and makes the viewer think.', '2004-12-09 07:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053997, 126863, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting backround. I like the way some of it is in focus and some blurred, But since the daisy is somewhat blurred it makes me wonder what you were intending as the subject.</td>', 'Interesting backround. I like the way some of it is in focus and some blurred, But since the daisy is somewhat blurred it makes me wonder what you were intending as the subject.', '2004-12-09 07:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053998, 126709, 3306, '<td valign="top">Yup, thats yellow.</td>', 'Yup, thats yellow.', '2004-12-09 07:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053999, 126539, 29339, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, certainly nothing wrong with it from that aspect.  The exposure is good, whites are white.  I''m not an expert on portraits but the lighting appears well done for the subject matter.<br/> <br/>Unfortunately, the hat appears gold instead of yellow to me and I feel I have to dock some points for that for this particular challenge.  Sorry.</td>', 'Very nice picture, certainly nothing wrong with it from that aspect.  The exposure is good, whites are white.  I''m not an expert on portraits but the lighting appears well done for the subject matter. Unfortunately, the hat appears gold instead of yellow to me and I feel I have to dock some points for that for this particular challenge.  Sorry.', '2004-12-09 07:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054000, 125708, 3306, '<td valign="top">There is some very interesting patterns going on here. I would have loved to play around with closing in on some of them from different angles and filling the frame with yellows and reds.</td>', 'There is some very interesting patterns going on here. I would have loved to play around with closing in on some of them from different angles and filling the frame with yellows and reds.', '2004-12-09 07:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054001, 126710, 29513, '<td valign="top">I like the yellow o n blue.  I like the contrasting colors.</td>', 'I like the yellow o n blue.  I like the contrasting colors.', '2004-12-09 07:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054002, 126231, 29513, '<td valign="top">Very playful.  I like that.</td>', 'Very playful.  I like that.', '2004-12-09 07:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054003, 126389, 3306, '<td valign="top">Cute dog. Definitely yellow but lighting seems a little bland. Maybe cropping in more on the subjects face would have eliminated some of the backround distraction and added interest.</td>', 'Cute dog. Definitely yellow but lighting seems a little bland. Maybe cropping in more on the subjects face would have eliminated some of the backround distraction and added interest.', '2004-12-09 07:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
