(1054021, 125843, 29339, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, well exposed, good lighting, good contrast.  Generally interesting shot.<br/> <br/>I like the narrow depth of field except that I personally don''t like the front bead out of focus.  Doesn''t feel right.  One wonders why it is the second bead it is the second bead that is the focus of the picture.  It ends up feeling more like a mis-focus to me.  If the ''subject'' is the beads coming out of the funnel, then I believe the picture may have been better with the front bead in focus.</td>', 'Nice picture, well exposed, good lighting, good contrast.  Generally interesting shot. I like the narrow depth of field except that I personally don''t like the front bead out of focus.  Doesn''t feel right.  One wonders why it is the second bead it is the second bead that is the focus of the picture.  It ends up feeling more like a mis-focus to me.  If the ''subject'' is the beads coming out of the funnel, then I believe the picture may have been better with the front bead in focus.', '2004-12-09 07:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054022, 126861, 29513, '<td valign="top">I really like the dark background.  If I were going to change anything, I would experiment with trying to balance the upper right darkness with something in the lower left, but that is a bit of a stretch.</td>', 'I really like the dark background.  If I were going to change anything, I would experiment with trying to balance the upper right darkness with something in the lower left, but that is a bit of a stretch.', '2004-12-09 07:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
