(1054136, 126754, 24913, '<td valign="top">Not quite enough yellow in my opinion, nice shot for a different challenge, or maybe and orange challenge.</td>', 'Not quite enough yellow in my opinion, nice shot for a different challenge, or maybe and orange challenge.', '2004-12-09 09:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054139, 126217, 7628, '<td valign="top">The best thing about this picture is the color!  And not just the yellow - green, blue, red.  I also like the balance of the compositionn - rotating it makes one forget about the physiscs and pay attention to the shapes and forms - chaos on the left and simplicity on the right.  That is what makes the yellow standout.  Tops for this challenge. 10</td>', 'The best thing about this picture is the color!  And not just the yellow - green, blue, red.  I also like the balance of the compositionn - rotating it makes one forget about the physiscs and pay attention to the shapes and forms - chaos on the left and simplicity on the right.  That is what makes the yellow standout.  Tops for this challenge. 10', '2004-12-09 09:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054141, 125683, 24613, '<td valign="top">This person is a good sport for sure!!  The photo is a little "artsy" for my taste (which isn''t a bad thing).  I tend to see more orange than yellow (but I am shade blind!!).  Very creative take on the challenge - top notch potography! 9</td>', 'This person is a good sport for sure!!  The photo is a little "artsy" for my taste (which isn''t a bad thing).  I tend to see more orange than yellow (but I am shade blind!!).  Very creative take on the challenge - top notch potography! 9', '2004-12-09 09:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054142, 126762, 28801, '<td valign="top">This is really beautiful. The idea of a yellow light reflected in the corkscrew really brings out the beauty of the shape. Well done</td>', 'This is really beautiful. The idea of a yellow light reflected in the corkscrew really brings out the beauty of the shape. Well done', '2004-12-09 09:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054143, 126823, 7628, '<td valign="top">Of all the ducky photos this one really "popped" out at me.  I like the smoothness of the water and its desaturation.  The anlge of the duck works well with the ripples on the water.  Somehow you''ve gotten the duck''s expression to look "poignant."  Lovely. 9</td>', 'Of all the ducky photos this one really "popped" out at me.  I like the smoothness of the water and its desaturation.  The anlge of the duck works well with the ripples on the water.  Somehow you''ve gotten the duck''s expression to look "poignant."  Lovely. 9', '2004-12-09 09:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054144, 126695, 24613, '<td valign="top">I really like the action going on here.  The frame is great and the color is superb.  Wonderful focus - the glass stem looks like I can reach into my monitor and pick it up!  Great work! 9</td>', 'I really like the action going on here.  The frame is great and the color is superb.  Wonderful focus - the glass stem looks like I can reach into my monitor and pick it up!  Great work! 9', '2004-12-09 09:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054146, 126387, 7628, '<td valign="top">Simple composition, great yellow color, great lighting.  I like the little smilie face touch!   8</td>', 'Simple composition, great yellow color, great lighting.  I like the little smilie face touch!   8', '2004-12-09 09:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054148, 126190, 24613, '<td valign="top">Haven''t see much selective desaturation in this challenge yet.  This is really nicely done. 8</td>', 'Haven''t see much selective desaturation in this challenge yet.  This is really nicely done. 8', '2004-12-09 09:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054149, 126752, 30464, '<td valign="top">The lines are perfect, the lighting, the shadows, the hue, the balance.  Simply perfect.</td>', 'The lines are perfect, the lighting, the shadows, the hue, the balance.  Simply perfect.', '2004-12-09 09:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054150, 125390, 24913, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t quite meet the challenge</td>', 'Doesn''t quite meet the challenge', '2004-12-09 09:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054151, 126759, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice desaturation - the bright yellow umbrella on a gray day - and everything but the umbrella IS gray.  I wish there were more splashing in the puddle and the umbrella were a little sharper. I like the composition with the umbrella filling the upper right corner. 6</td>', 'Nice desaturation - the bright yellow umbrella on a gray day - and everything but the umbrella IS gray.  I wish there were more splashing in the puddle and the umbrella were a little sharper. I like the composition with the umbrella filling the upper right corner. 6', '2004-12-09 09:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054153, 125593, 24613, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot - nice frame.  It may have been better if the item in the lower left was in focus (it tends to draw the eye), but that may not be possible.  Still, a very beautiful piece of work. 9</td>', 'Very pretty shot - nice frame.  It may have been better if the item in the lower left was in focus (it tends to draw the eye), but that may not be possible.  Still, a very beautiful piece of work. 9', '2004-12-09 09:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054156, 126826, 7628, '<td valign="top">I truely like this idea - the bright yellow of the swing seat transports our eyes the way it transports you to "this wonderful place" up in the air.  Ilike the chain coming don from the top corner adn the swing seat from the bottom, meeting right on that thirds line.  I think it would work much better if the chain stood out better from the background.  Right now it blends in so that you eye has to fight to see it.  You could try to light the woodchips to brighten them - or photoshop a selection afterward.</td>', 'I truely like this idea - the bright yellow of the swing seat transports our eyes the way it transports you to "this wonderful place" up in the air.  Ilike the chain coming don from the top corner adn the swing seat from the bottom, meeting right on that thirds line.  I think it would work much better if the chain stood out better from the background.  Right now it blends in so that you eye has to fight to see it.  You could try to light the woodchips to brighten them - or photoshop a selection afterward.', '2004-12-09 09:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054158, 126727, 24613, '<td valign="top">The car company might want to use this in a magazine add!  Very professionally done.  I think it could benifit if the frame was yellow, but that''s nit pickin''.  Very cool shot and top notch work. 9</td>', 'The car company might want to use this in a magazine add!  Very professionally done.  I think it could benifit if the frame was yellow, but that''s nit pickin''.  Very cool shot and top notch work. 9', '2004-12-09 09:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054160, 125655, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus - makes the bears seem even softer.  I think a dark, even black background would work better - make the bear stand out.  And as this is a "yellow" competition you could play wioth hue or saturation to make the bears a bit more yellow.</td>', 'I like the soft focus - makes the bears seem even softer.  I think a dark, even black background would work better - make the bear stand out.  And as this is a "yellow" competition you could play wioth hue or saturation to make the bears a bit more yellow.', '2004-12-09 09:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054173, 126689, 24715, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. The yellow just stands out. Handle bar with the brake is a nice touch! Lighting, texture are quite nice, too.  I used the band in Hope challenge.</td>', 'Very nice photo. The yellow just stands out. Handle bar with the brake is a nice touch! Lighting, texture are quite nice, too.  I used the band in Hope challenge.', '2004-12-09 09:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054175, 126690, 28801, '<td valign="top">imaginative</td>', 'imaginative', '2004-12-09 09:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054188, 126313, 24613, '<td valign="top">Very classy!  Lot''s of emotion here (the "I miss my guy" sort of thing). Very creative take on the challenge done in good taste. 9<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-12-15 00:16:20.</i></td>', 'Very classy!  Lot''s of emotion here (the "I miss my guy" sort of thing). Very creative take on the challenge done in good taste. 9', '2004-12-09 10:01:44.000000', '2004-12-15 00:16:20.000000', 1),
