(1054195, 126622, 4226, '<td valign="top">the lighting is very harsh.. try to diffuse the light falling on the subject....no no you don''t always need a softbox. you can just use any piece of white cloth to cover your lamp and get a good diffused light. I have used it on $5 lamps and it works</td>', 'the lighting is very harsh.. try to diffuse the light falling on the subject....no no you don''t always need a softbox. you can just use any piece of white cloth to cover your lamp and get a good diffused light. I have used it on $5 lamps and it works', '2004-12-09 10:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054198, 126010, 18796, '<td valign="top">hahaah</td>', 'hahaah', '2004-12-09 10:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054199, 126612, 24613, '<td valign="top">IMO a wider crop and a nice frame would make this perfect (that doen''t effect my vote though!).  The colors are stunning and you are drawn to the yellow the second you look at the photo.  Excellent work and an excellent example of being right on the money meeting the challange! 9</td>', 'IMO a wider crop and a nice frame would make this perfect (that doen''t effect my vote though!).  The colors are stunning and you are drawn to the yellow the second you look at the photo.  Excellent work and an excellent example of being right on the money meeting the challange! 9', '2004-12-09 10:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
