(1054285, 126393, 24613, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  Great cropping, beautiful frame.  I''m ready to hear some music!! 9  Back to jinx you!  I think this is the best of the challenge.  Bumping to 10.</td>', 'Excellent!  Great cropping, beautiful frame.  I''m ready to hear some music!! 9  Back to jinx you!  I think this is the best of the challenge.  Bumping to 10.', '2004-12-09 11:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
