(1054290, 126266, 24065, '<td valign="top">Good colors and focus.  While the floor is an appropriate background I think it makes the shot less professional-looking.  I''m afraid the mundanity of the subject matter may cost you votes, too.</td>', 'Good colors and focus.  While the floor is an appropriate background I think it makes the shot less professional-looking.  I''m afraid the mundanity of the subject matter may cost you votes, too.', '2004-12-09 11:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
