(1054292, 125683, 17103, '<td valign="top">Weird but pretty good; you almost got her to blend into the wall in the background.  However, this doesn''t say "yellow" to me...... red/orange/rust, but not yellow.</td>', 'Weird but pretty good; you almost got her to blend into the wall in the background.  However, this doesn''t say "yellow" to me...... red/orange/rust, but not yellow.', '2004-12-09 11:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054294, 126053, 24065, '<td valign="top">Interesting photograph.  The focus and colors are great, the composition is good.  I think perhaps photos with more yellow will score better in the challenge, tho.  BOL :)</td>', 'Interesting photograph.  The focus and colors are great, the composition is good.  I think perhaps photos with more yellow will score better in the challenge, tho.  BOL :)', '2004-12-09 11:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054298, 125706, 24065, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this photograph about 5-6 times before finally voting and commenting.  I like it and think it meets the challenge.  And I know that white is a color, too.  But it does appear too blown-out here.  It detracts from an otherwise wonderful photograph.  Hope this is helpful.  :)</td>', 'I''ve looked at this photograph about 5-6 times before finally voting and commenting.  I like it and think it meets the challenge.  And I know that white is a color, too.  But it does appear too blown-out here.  It detracts from an otherwise wonderful photograph.  Hope this is helpful.  :)', '2004-12-09 11:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054308, 126387, 10768, '<td valign="top">This is terrific.  I''m sure it will ribbon.  I love the little smiley face.  It adds interest to this photo.  Bet that white dot drove you crazy, but at least you followed the rules!</td>', 'This is terrific.  I''m sure it will ribbon.  I love the little smiley face.  It adds interest to this photo.  Bet that white dot drove you crazy, but at least you followed the rules!', '2004-12-09 11:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054316, 126061, 17103, '<td valign="top">This would be one of my favorites if it weren''t for the fact that the faces of the three people in the background look yellow, too.  Otherwise, this is a very cool shot!</td>', 'This would be one of my favorites if it weren''t for the fact that the faces of the three people in the background look yellow, too.  Otherwise, this is a very cool shot!', '2004-12-09 11:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054318, 126545, 24065, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky!  I like your composition, too.  Perhaps the pole could have been straightened a little and the unsharp mask used to sharpen the poles and lights.</td>', 'Beautiful sky!  I like your composition, too.  Perhaps the pole could have been straightened a little and the unsharp mask used to sharpen the poles and lights.', '2004-12-09 11:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054349, 125823, 24413, '<td valign="top">Perfect!</td>', 'Perfect!', '2004-12-09 12:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
