(1054389, 126874, 25347, '<td valign="top">I used one of these too.  I would''ve like to see maybe more of the Live Strong in the photo (though, admittedly, I''m not practicing what I preach :) ) Maybe would be better with more of the letters in the field of focus, and the end of the needle more visible.  Still, a very good shot, good luck! :o)</td>', 'I used one of these too.  I would''ve like to see maybe more of the Live Strong in the photo (though, admittedly, I''m not practicing what I preach :) ) Maybe would be better with more of the letters in the field of focus, and the end of the needle more visible.  Still, a very good shot, good luck! :o)', '2004-12-09 13:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054392, 126310, 25347, '<td valign="top">haha, first picture in this challenge to make me laugh.  Good job.</td>', 'haha, first picture in this challenge to make me laugh.  Good job.', '2004-12-09 13:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
