(1054394, 126689, 25347, '<td valign="top">I used one of these too.  I don''t know exactly what I''m looking at here, but besides that, it''s a good shot.  Plus, you got the whole band in the frame, which I failed to do :o)</td>', 'I used one of these too.  I don''t know exactly what I''m looking at here, but besides that, it''s a good shot.  Plus, you got the whole band in the frame, which I failed to do :o)', '2004-12-09 13:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
