(1054449, 126753, 24065, '<td valign="top">I like this.  It''s a very clever idea and it meets the challenge.  The focus is good and the colors are rich.  You have taken a mundane subject and added interest.  BOL</td>', 'I like this.  It''s a very clever idea and it meets the challenge.  The focus is good and the colors are rich.  You have taken a mundane subject and added interest.  BOL', '2004-12-09 13:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
