(1054499, 126822, 29535, '<td valign="top">Eeesh... you just upped the yellows in Pshop and now it looks... well horrible.  Would''ve been a good pic otherwise, and maybe a little bigger.</td>', 'Eeesh... you just upped the yellows in Pshop and now it looks... well horrible.  Would''ve been a good pic otherwise, and maybe a little bigger.', '2004-12-09 14:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054516, 126713, 3032, '<td valign="top">Cool all those shades of yellow. Technically very good. Because of the positioning at an angle and being off-centre it grabs the attention very well.<br/></td>', 'Cool all those shades of yellow. Technically very good. Because of the positioning at an angle and being off-centre it grabs the attention very well.', '2004-12-09 14:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054520, 125592, 22305, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2004-12-09 14:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054522, 125683, 3032, '<td valign="top">It looks more like shades of orange and not yellow, <br/>but despite that: what an awesome shot!<br/>I also think that the person having the eyes closed makes the composition relaxed, the colors and the warmth of the light enhances that. The random structure of the blobs makes it all look very natural, classic and human as opposed to hard, tech and modern.<br/> <br/></td>', 'It looks more like shades of orange and not yellow, but despite that: what an awesome shot!I also think that the person having the eyes closed makes the composition relaxed, the colors and the warmth of the light enhances that. The random structure of the blobs makes it all look very natural, classic and human as opposed to hard, tech and modern. ', '2004-12-09 14:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054525, 126349, 22305, '<td valign="top">This looks out of focus.</td>', 'This looks out of focus.', '2004-12-09 14:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
