(1054540, 126249, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great contrast because of the clear ''golden'' gold and good deep dark blue sky. I''d like to know how it was done, is this the effect from a polarizer filter or does it depend more on the time of day? The reflection is still very low so my guess is that it is early in the morning.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Great contrast because of the clear ''golden'' gold and good deep dark blue sky. I''d like to know how it was done, is this the effect from a polarizer filter or does it depend more on the time of day? The reflection is still very low so my guess is that it is early in the morning. ', '2004-12-09 14:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
