(1054722, 126759, 21202, '<td valign="top">I read about desaturating by color and all makes sense now.    I think I was quite harsh in rating this picture.  It does not make a lot of sense as it is not raining, but I should be  rating photography and processing.  From that point of view, I would suggest less sharpening.  The effect of this shows up on left sides of shirt. .  I am raising my rating to a 6.<br/></td>', 'I read about desaturating by color and all makes sense now.    I think I was quite harsh in rating this picture.  It does not make a lot of sense as it is not raining, but I should be  rating photography and processing.  From that point of view, I would suggest less sharpening.  The effect of this shows up on left sides of shirt. .  I am raising my rating to a 6.', '2004-12-09 16:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
