(1054738, 126540, 23296, '<td valign="top">good one. nice colors and light. the tire part on the right hand side looks odd.</td>', 'good one. nice colors and light. the tire part on the right hand side looks odd.', '2004-12-09 16:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054741, 126453, 21202, '<td valign="top">It is really difficult to retain definition in highly glossy petals.  I have a number of bright red flowers which seem nearly impossible to photograph in natural light so that I retain definition.  Here though, you have brought forth highly saturated red, yellow, and blue  in a very nice composition which relies to some degree on bright lighting.  The question is can this be achieved under diffuse lighting?  I really like the blue and yellow.  A 9.</td>', 'It is really difficult to retain definition in highly glossy petals.  I have a number of bright red flowers which seem nearly impossible to photograph in natural light so that I retain definition.  Here though, you have brought forth highly saturated red, yellow, and blue  in a very nice composition which relies to some degree on bright lighting.  The question is can this be achieved under diffuse lighting?  I really like the blue and yellow.  A 9.', '2004-12-09 16:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054747, 126820, 23296, '<td valign="top">beautiful. nice background and details. Good focus.</td>', 'beautiful. nice background and details. Good focus.', '2004-12-09 16:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054748, 126368, 9478, '<td valign="top">Good composition!</td>', 'Good composition!', '2004-12-09 16:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054750, 125916, 21202, '<td valign="top">This appears a tinge overexposed.  Lovely idea though.  I especially like the composition with center in the lower left corner and the seed and rind in view.  Thanks for the title, it did not take long to orient myself to the subject.  A 9.</td>', 'This appears a tinge overexposed.  Lovely idea though.  I especially like the composition with center in the lower left corner and the seed and rind in view.  Thanks for the title, it did not take long to orient myself to the subject.  A 9.', '2004-12-09 16:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
