(1054755, 126076, 21202, '<td valign="top">The green created as the yellow ducky hits the blue water is great.  I wish Ii could give you a twenty.  Ten for not overexposing the rubber ducky and ten for a splash shot that is perfectly timed.  A 10 however.</td>', 'The green created as the yellow ducky hits the blue water is great.  I wish Ii could give you a twenty.  Ten for not overexposing the rubber ducky and ten for a splash shot that is perfectly timed.  A 10 however.', '2004-12-09 17:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
