(1054820, 126454, 21202, '<td valign="top">You are off to a good start.  A few ideas for you to consider.  Reflect some light into shadow under chin.  Shoot at several exposures especially when you have something as reflective as the highlighter.  Move the backdrop further back and iron it.  She really is a great model.  A 7.</td>', 'You are off to a good start.  A few ideas for you to consider.  Reflect some light into shadow under chin.  Shoot at several exposures especially when you have something as reflective as the highlighter.  Move the backdrop further back and iron it.  She really is a great model.  A 7.', '2004-12-09 17:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054822, 125930, 23296, '<td valign="top">nice theme. light is distracting</td>', 'nice theme. light is distracting', '2004-12-09 17:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054823, 126623, 20679, '<td valign="top">nice textures in the sand but the light is a little flat. If possible, seeing a little of the little boy''s profile would have added more interest to the shot, but it is very nice.</td>', 'nice textures in the sand but the light is a little flat. If possible, seeing a little of the little boy''s profile would have added more interest to the shot, but it is very nice.', '2004-12-09 17:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054827, 126601, 20679, '<td valign="top">whoa! That is a mess and I''m guessing you didn''t get too many shots at this. A tighter crop and a little more contrast would have added to the impact I think.</td>', 'whoa! That is a mess and I''m guessing you didn''t get too many shots at this. A tighter crop and a little more contrast would have added to the impact I think.', '2004-12-09 17:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054828, 125929, 20679, '<td valign="top">a bit of a stretch perhaps - pretty cat though</td>', 'a bit of a stretch perhaps - pretty cat though', '2004-12-09 17:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054831, 126387, 23296, '<td valign="top">awesome. nice lighting</td>', 'awesome. nice lighting', '2004-12-09 17:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054835, 126788, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect.  Look forward to reading about your setup.  Aesthetically, the composition is very pleasing but the burnt out pixels in the center and the fuzziness of the light traces  trouble me somewhat.  It is also cropped a little tight especially for framing.  An 8.</td>', 'Very nice effect.  Look forward to reading about your setup.  Aesthetically, the composition is very pleasing but the burnt out pixels in the center and the fuzziness of the light traces  trouble me somewhat.  It is also cropped a little tight especially for framing.  An 8.', '2004-12-09 17:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054837, 126694, 23394, '<td valign="top">i guess you didn''t have the opportunity to wait for a little more emotion out of this guy.  i mean, it''s a good picture, and he does seem to be intently following the game, but, all the same, a grimace, wince, laugh, any expression could have brought this to life.  love the dof.</td>', 'i guess you didn''t have the opportunity to wait for a little more emotion out of this guy.  i mean, it''s a good picture, and he does seem to be intently following the game, but, all the same, a grimace, wince, laugh, any expression could have brought this to life.  love the dof.', '2004-12-09 17:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054842, 126772, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea.  too bad the yellow doesn''t really "pop".  also, it feels a little too centered.  looks a little soft; maybe could have gone out another stop or two.</td>', 'nice idea.  too bad the yellow doesn''t really "pop".  also, it feels a little too centered.  looks a little soft; maybe could have gone out another stop or two.', '2004-12-09 17:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054844, 126817, 21202, '<td valign="top">What a fortuitous pudlle.  I like the contrast of bright yellow on the car and dark yellow in the reflection..  If you have a raw copy of this, you might want to see if you could bring out more of the detail in the shadows and lighten the overall image without getting glare off the rear view and the tail pipes.  Very nice.  A 9,</td>', 'What a fortuitous pudlle.  I like the contrast of bright yellow on the car and dark yellow in the reflection..  If you have a raw copy of this, you might want to see if you could bring out more of the detail in the shadows and lighten the overall image without getting glare off the rear view and the tail pipes.  Very nice.  A 9,', '2004-12-09 17:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054854, 126197, 21202, '<td valign="top">What a great lens.  Nice angle too.  The  basic editing rules prevent singling out the sky for noise reduction, and the sharpening artifacts are just slightly noticible on the upper bill.  From the point of view of yellow, I like the light yellow of the the eye and the dark yellow of the band between the eyes.  Was he in the alert position, almost completely vertical,  that Egrets take when disturbed?  A 10.</td>', 'What a great lens.  Nice angle too.  The  basic editing rules prevent singling out the sky for noise reduction, and the sharpening artifacts are just slightly noticible on the upper bill.  From the point of view of yellow, I like the light yellow of the the eye and the dark yellow of the band between the eyes.  Was he in the alert position, almost completely vertical,  that Egrets take when disturbed?  A 10.', '2004-12-09 17:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054856, 126452, 21202, '<td valign="top">I  think a wider angled lens would help with depth of field.  There is not enough detail present in the two front cheerios to justify the lack of focus on the back two.  The yellow and the frame are nice.  A 6.</td>', 'I  think a wider angled lens would help with depth of field.  There is not enough detail present in the two front cheerios to justify the lack of focus on the back two.  The yellow and the frame are nice.  A 6.', '2004-12-09 17:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054863, 126158, 28256, '<td valign="top">Toys ''r us</td>', 'Toys ''r us', '2004-12-09 17:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054870, 125898, 23394, '<td valign="top">if this was the ''rage'' challenge, i''d give you grief for not meeting the challenge and trying to use the title just to have an entry.  looks like you dodged that bullet.  nice image.</td>', 'if this was the ''rage'' challenge, i''d give you grief for not meeting the challenge and trying to use the title just to have an entry.  looks like you dodged that bullet.  nice image.', '2004-12-09 18:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054872, 126865, 23394, '<td valign="top">how lucky were you to be right there right then!  nice capture.</td>', 'how lucky were you to be right there right then!  nice capture.', '2004-12-09 18:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054873, 126454, 28256, '<td valign="top">She''s so cute !</td>', 'She''s so cute !', '2004-12-09 18:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054874, 126007, 21202, '<td valign="top">This is a little on the dim side and lacks some oomph.  I copied it over to Photo Shop, went into levels and adjusted the green channel to 32, 1.00, 255 and got what I believe is a really outstanding effect, while retaining, I believe, your artistic intent.  A 9.</td>', 'This is a little on the dim side and lacks some oomph.  I copied it over to Photo Shop, went into levels and adjusted the green channel to 32, 1.00, 255 and got what I believe is a really outstanding effect, while retaining, I believe, your artistic intent.  A 9.', '2004-12-09 18:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054880, 126308, 21202, '<td valign="top">Too much glare for these tiny guys.  A sheet of something translucent  to diffuse the light is called for.  A 5.<br/></td>', 'Too much glare for these tiny guys.  A sheet of something translucent  to diffuse the light is called for.  A 5.', '2004-12-09 18:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054884, 126673, 21202, '<td valign="top">Excellent lemon slice and water surface, as well as drain. Lights and shadows perfection.   I would have liked a faster shutter to stop the falling water just a hair more.  Overall, a 10.</td>', 'Excellent lemon slice and water surface, as well as drain. Lights and shadows perfection.   I would have liked a faster shutter to stop the falling water just a hair more.  Overall, a 10.', '2004-12-09 18:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054889, 126601, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice explosive effect, also great work highlighting the yellow and providing an interesting background.  Unfortunately, a  mess is not the most appealing of sights.  An 8.</td>', 'Nice explosive effect, also great work highlighting the yellow and providing an interesting background.  Unfortunately, a  mess is not the most appealing of sights.  An 8.', '2004-12-09 18:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054896, 125798, 21202, '<td valign="top">The light is a little strong and I would have removed, before shooting or after by cropping,  the leaf with the hole in it.  I haven''t tried this yet, but I am seriously considering getting a large sheet to hang between the sun and the flower in order to diffuse the light as they are doing with the tabletop photos.  You have lost the texure of the petals and the center of the flower to direct lighting.  I love the purples in the background.  A 7.</td>', 'The light is a little strong and I would have removed, before shooting or after by cropping,  the leaf with the hole in it.  I haven''t tried this yet, but I am seriously considering getting a large sheet to hang between the sun and the flower in order to diffuse the light as they are doing with the tabletop photos.  You have lost the texure of the petals and the center of the flower to direct lighting.  I love the purples in the background.  A 7.', '2004-12-09 18:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054903, 126613, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice touch throwing in the red paper clip and the darker yellow pencil.  I turned the brightness of my monitor down to 25% and the pen top is still a little too bright.  I would suggest shooting at a number of exposure settings and using levels adjustments to reduce glare, especially for bright yellow.  Even the surface of the lined pad is wiped out by glare in the foreground center.  A 7.</td>', 'Nice touch throwing in the red paper clip and the darker yellow pencil.  I turned the brightness of my monitor down to 25% and the pen top is still a little too bright.  I would suggest shooting at a number of exposure settings and using levels adjustments to reduce glare, especially for bright yellow.  Even the surface of the lined pad is wiped out by glare in the foreground center.  A 7.', '2004-12-09 18:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054912, 126849, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  As sodium vapor causes a number of changes, I think green to red and vice versa, it would be interesting to include things of recognizable color such as apples, bananas, lettuce, in such a picture and to attempt to process the picture without changing the colors as seen.  I like the yellow jacket and the light in the trees.  The exposure, depth of field, and focus are very good.  Also, a very good model, especially if he had to hold still for long.  A 9.</td>', 'Very interesting.  As sodium vapor causes a number of changes, I think green to red and vice versa, it would be interesting to include things of recognizable color such as apples, bananas, lettuce, in such a picture and to attempt to process the picture without changing the colors as seen.  I like the yellow jacket and the light in the trees.  The exposure, depth of field, and focus are very good.  Also, a very good model, especially if he had to hold still for long.  A 9.', '2004-12-09 18:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054914, 125687, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very well done. Compare math books in this competition.  A 9, as the background requires some consideration.</td>', 'Very well done. Compare math books in this competition.  A 9, as the background requires some consideration.', '2004-12-09 18:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054922, 126683, 21202, '<td valign="top">I like the strength of the colors here, but something stange is going on with the black splotchs on the red and the horizontal tears of black across the yellow of the arch.  Something in processing got overdone.  Very nice composition.  An 8.</td>', 'I like the strength of the colors here, but something stange is going on with the black splotchs on the red and the horizontal tears of black across the yellow of the arch.  Something in processing got overdone.  Very nice composition.  An 8.', '2004-12-09 18:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054925, 125687, 25397, '<td valign="top">All excellent books!!! :O</td>', 'All excellent books!!! :O', '2004-12-09 18:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
