(1054941, 125390, 21202, '<td valign="top">I like this better with a significant reduction in contrast.  It would appeal to me more if photographed under less harsh llight.  The  pose of the head is very nice, but the torso just seems to perpendicularly rise to the top of the frame.  Some twist of the torso or realignment would create interest.  A 6.</td>', 'I like this better with a significant reduction in contrast.  It would appeal to me more if photographed under less harsh llight.  The  pose of the head is very nice, but the torso just seems to perpendicularly rise to the top of the frame.  Some twist of the torso or realignment would create interest.  A 6.', '2004-12-09 18:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054942, 126874, 22479, '<td valign="top">Another Livestrong wristband. Fits theme nicely. 7</td>', 'Another Livestrong wristband. Fits theme nicely. 7', '2004-12-09 18:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054944, 125301, 22479, '<td valign="top">The title suggests cowardice (as well as a clever spin on the brand name). The word blue doesn''t quite connect with your title.</td>', 'The title suggests cowardice (as well as a clever spin on the brand name). The word blue doesn''t quite connect with your title.', '2004-12-09 18:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
