(1054955, 126148, 22479, '<td valign="top">Sure, I think of yellow when I think of corn. Fits theme nicely. This is a nice tight shot which shows adequate detail. DOF is a bit shallow and using a smaller aperture would have helped here. Still, one of the few photos that actually meet the challenge theme. 7</td>', 'Sure, I think of yellow when I think of corn. Fits theme nicely. This is a nice tight shot which shows adequate detail. DOF is a bit shallow and using a smaller aperture would have helped here. Still, one of the few photos that actually meet the challenge theme. 7', '2004-12-09 19:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054956, 125870, 21202, '<td valign="top">Good job strewing the Ginko leaves.  I just took an envelope and cropped off the top shadowed area  which I find a little distracting.  The nose and chin are  just a little overexposed.  An 8.</td>', 'Good job strewing the Ginko leaves.  I just took an envelope and cropped off the top shadowed area  which I find a little distracting.  The nose and chin are  just a little overexposed.  An 8.', '2004-12-09 19:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054957, 126771, 22479, '<td valign="top">Stunning and beautiful shot. Daisies are yellow, and thus this fits the challenge theme. It certainly adds impact to this photograph as well. Well done 10</td>', 'Stunning and beautiful shot. Daisies are yellow, and thus this fits the challenge theme. It certainly adds impact to this photograph as well. Well done 10', '2004-12-09 19:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
