(1054961, 126741, 21202, '<td valign="top">A little fill flash would not have hurt.  Most of your subjects end up either over or under exposed.  A 6.</td>', 'A little fill flash would not have hurt.  Most of your subjects end up either over or under exposed.  A 6.', '2004-12-09 19:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054962, 126742, 22479, '<td valign="top">Is this lava? Quite a stunning capture. 8</td>', 'Is this lava? Quite a stunning capture. 8', '2004-12-09 19:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054963, 126754, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nice title. I agree. Photograph has a very autumn feel. I think you captured the essence of fall with this shot. Well done! 8</td>', 'Nice title. I agree. Photograph has a very autumn feel. I think you captured the essence of fall with this shot. Well done! 8', '2004-12-09 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054964, 126117, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  A most beautiful yellow.  the  cars in the reflections hellp the overall  picture.  An 8.</td>', 'Nicely done.  A most beautiful yellow.  the  cars in the reflections hellp the overall  picture.  An 8.', '2004-12-09 19:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054968, 126410, 22479, '<td valign="top">Excellent interpretation of the collor yellow, and much in the spirit of the challenge theme. 10</td>', 'Excellent interpretation of the collor yellow, and much in the spirit of the challenge theme. 10', '2004-12-09 19:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054970, 126865, 21202, '<td valign="top">What a sky.  The yellow on the sun side is just a little overexposed.  All in all, you have a nice distribution of light over the underbody on what is obviously a very bright day.  A 9.</td>', 'What a sky.  The yellow on the sun side is just a little overexposed.  All in all, you have a nice distribution of light over the underbody on what is obviously a very bright day.  A 9.', '2004-12-09 19:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054972, 126861, 19978, '<td valign="top">This image would be totally awesome, but it seems to be a bit soft in some parts (lower left particularly). I also wish it were a bit brighter in the yellows, making it almost pop out of the monitor and assault my eye. As it is, it is a very nice abstract, but it doesn''t blow me away.</td>', 'This image would be totally awesome, but it seems to be a bit soft in some parts (lower left particularly). I also wish it were a bit brighter in the yellows, making it almost pop out of the monitor and assault my eye. As it is, it is a very nice abstract, but it doesn''t blow me away.', '2004-12-09 19:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054978, 126387, 22479, '<td valign="top">One of two personal favorites of the egg yolk shots. This is not quite an interpretation of the color yellow, since it is literally yellow. Excellent lighting and presentation otherwise. 7</td>', 'One of two personal favorites of the egg yolk shots. This is not quite an interpretation of the color yellow, since it is literally yellow. Excellent lighting and presentation otherwise. 7', '2004-12-09 19:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054983, 126756, 21202, '<td valign="top">Reducing this to 640 pixel width really hurts.  I zoomed in on the tape, and can see that it would be easily read in the original.  The sign on the side of the tapeis also a little difficult to read and seems dim at this size.  I think a little more playing with light positions would have helped this picture, especially moving the one on the right forward, and the one on the left nearer.  An 8.</td>', 'Reducing this to 640 pixel width really hurts.  I zoomed in on the tape, and can see that it would be easily read in the original.  The sign on the side of the tapeis also a little difficult to read and seems dim at this size.  I think a little more playing with light positions would have helped this picture, especially moving the one on the right forward, and the one on the left nearer.  An 8.', '2004-12-09 19:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054986, 126844, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very lovely.  A 9.</td>', 'Very lovely.  A 9.', '2004-12-09 19:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
