(1054996, 126231, 21202, '<td valign="top">//images.google.com/images?q=tbn:tv8Jv55M-pIJ:members.shaw.ca/karagana2/psp7/images/kilroy.gif<br/>was how I remembered kilroy in his several appearances in my neighborhood.  The sky is a little noisy.  Have you downloaded neatimage?  The free version will take the noise out of  the sky.  A 5.</td>', '//images.google.com/images?q=tbn:tv8Jv55M-pIJ:members.shaw.ca/karagana2/psp7/images/kilroy.gifwas how I remembered kilroy in his several appearances in my neighborhood.  The sky is a little noisy.  Have you downloaded neatimage?  The free version will take the noise out of  the sky.  A 5.', '2004-12-09 19:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054998, 126883, 21202, '<td valign="top">I love this.  I am going to have to build  a  tabletop studio.  Another light from the front just to illuminate the center of the rose would be nice.  Now was it just a yellow light or a yellow rose?  An 8.<br/></td>', 'I love this.  I am going to have to build  a  tabletop studio.  Another light from the front just to illuminate the center of the rose would be nice.  Now was it just a yellow light or a yellow rose?  An 8.', '2004-12-09 19:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055006, 126564, 20779, '<td valign="top">This is one of those that I wish I could score a 20.</td>', 'This is one of those that I wish I could score a 20.', '2004-12-09 19:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055007, 126674, 20779, '<td valign="top">This takes a studio shot out of the ordinary realm and makes it much more intriguing to me. Great set-up and lighting.</td>', 'This takes a studio shot out of the ordinary realm and makes it much more intriguing to me. Great set-up and lighting.', '2004-12-09 19:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055010, 126410, 20779, '<td valign="top">Probably one of the most artistic and emotive takes on the challenge IMO.</td>', 'Probably one of the most artistic and emotive takes on the challenge IMO.', '2004-12-09 19:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055012, 126341, 20779, '<td valign="top">The lighting and color in this just blew me away. You really know your stuff.</td>', 'The lighting and color in this just blew me away. You really know your stuff.', '2004-12-09 19:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055013, 125898, 20779, '<td valign="top">The perspective and DOF are just great and really make this image.</td>', 'The perspective and DOF are just great and really make this image.', '2004-12-09 19:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055014, 125992, 21202, '<td valign="top">The background is very busy if the focus is to be on the few yellow leaves hanging on a mostly barren tree.  If this were taken later in the afternoon, nearer twilight, the background might be less compelling.  Another way would be to reduce the depth of field, with a wider aperture or longer lens.  A 7.</td>', 'The background is very busy if the focus is to be on the few yellow leaves hanging on a mostly barren tree.  If this were taken later in the afternoon, nearer twilight, the background might be less compelling.  Another way would be to reduce the depth of field, with a wider aperture or longer lens.  A 7.', '2004-12-09 19:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055015, 126285, 20779, '<td valign="top">Ring of Fire came to mind immediately - fantastic interpretation of the challenge and extrememly well done.</td>', 'Ring of Fire came to mind immediately - fantastic interpretation of the challenge and extrememly well done.', '2004-12-09 19:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055018, 125341, 20779, '<td valign="top">There is something about this one, the immediacy, that just keeps pulling me back over and over  again.  It is not "technically perfect", but it has something so much more for me. Sorry I can''t explain this better.</td>', 'There is something about this one, the immediacy, that just keeps pulling me back over and over  again.  It is not "technically perfect", but it has something so much more for me. Sorry I can''t explain this better.', '2004-12-09 19:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055019, 126306, 20779, '<td valign="top">One of my tops in this challenge. It is just so refreshing and clean. Doesn''t hurt that I love the old green glass juicers and the color yellow! Perfect lighting and composition.</td>', 'One of my tops in this challenge. It is just so refreshing and clean. Doesn''t hurt that I love the old green glass juicers and the color yellow! Perfect lighting and composition.', '2004-12-09 19:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055020, 125953, 21202, '<td valign="top">Back lighting the rind and the meat of the frontmost right slice really enhances the appearance of lemon slices.  Placing the subject beetle on the dark side of an unbacklit slice  creates a competition for attention.  A 7.</td>', 'Back lighting the rind and the meat of the frontmost right slice really enhances the appearance of lemon slices.  Placing the subject beetle on the dark side of an unbacklit slice  creates a competition for attention.  A 7.', '2004-12-09 19:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055021, 126692, 20779, '<td valign="top">This shows amazing creativity. One of my favorites.</td>', 'This shows amazing creativity. One of my favorites.', '2004-12-09 19:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
