(1055049, 126835, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful classic shot.</td>', 'Beautiful classic shot.', '2004-12-09 20:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055051, 126599, 20779, '<td valign="top">Exquisite tones, textures and movement in this image. Congrats on a great job.</td>', 'Exquisite tones, textures and movement in this image. Congrats on a great job.', '2004-12-09 20:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055052, 126078, 20779, '<td valign="top">Simply gorgeous take on a classic. Very emotive IMO.</td>', 'Simply gorgeous take on a classic. Very emotive IMO.', '2004-12-09 20:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055055, 126623, 20779, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites and not my usual "taste". So very well done!</td>', 'One of my favorites and not my usual "taste". So very well done!', '2004-12-09 20:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055072, 126001, 20779, '<td valign="top">I really love looking at this photo. Hope you do well with it!!</td>', 'I really love looking at this photo. Hope you do well with it!!', '2004-12-09 20:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055073, 126614, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very, very cool. Extremely well done take on the challenge.</td>', 'Very, very cool. Extremely well done take on the challenge.', '2004-12-09 20:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055076, 125927, 20779, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy the open range of this image and its over all balance and movement. I don''t know that it will score very high, because it isn''t 1) obvious, or 2) polished "DPC" - but I love it, so I hope that there are many like me.</td>', 'I really enjoy the open range of this image and its over all balance and movement. I don''t know that it will score very high, because it isn''t 1) obvious, or 2) polished "DPC" - but I love it, so I hope that there are many like me.', '2004-12-09 20:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055077, 126664, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful filtered light and essence. Very poetic and artistic photography. 9.</td>', 'Beautiful filtered light and essence. Very poetic and artistic photography. 9.', '2004-12-09 20:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055078, 126763, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very creative and abstract treatment that I think is done extrememly well.</td>', 'Very creative and abstract treatment that I think is done extrememly well.', '2004-12-09 20:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055079, 126696, 24065, '<td valign="top">Very abstract and imaginative.  I like it!  BOL</td>', 'Very abstract and imaginative.  I like it!  BOL', '2004-12-09 20:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055080, 126754, 24065, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Rich colors, good composition. BOL</td>', 'Very nice.  Rich colors, good composition. BOL', '2004-12-09 20:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055081, 125739, 20779, '<td valign="top">The glow at the upper-left really adds just the right magic here.</td>', 'The glow at the upper-left really adds just the right magic here.', '2004-12-09 20:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055084, 126754, 20779, '<td valign="top">This gives me a wonderful sensation just looking at it. Great job on this.</td>', 'This gives me a wonderful sensation just looking at it. Great job on this.', '2004-12-09 20:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055086, 126423, 20779, '<td valign="top">Simply exquisite.</td>', 'Simply exquisite.', '2004-12-09 20:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055087, 126875, 20779, '<td valign="top">Simplicity at its best.</td>', 'Simplicity at its best.', '2004-12-09 20:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055088, 125593, 16648, '<td valign="top">A tad more DOF would be nice - the gold flower is out of focus and the front candle is not sharp. The other thing that strikes me is that teh egg nog and candles are the same color - perhaps green candles or red ones, or a slightly different composition.</td>', 'A tad more DOF would be nice - the gold flower is out of focus and the front candle is not sharp. The other thing that strikes me is that teh egg nog and candles are the same color - perhaps green candles or red ones, or a slightly different composition.', '2004-12-09 20:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055090, 126865, 16648, '<td valign="top">Cool.</td>', 'Cool.', '2004-12-09 20:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055091, 125922, 20779, '<td valign="top">Love the tight, close crop and highlight.</td>', 'Love the tight, close crop and highlight.', '2004-12-09 20:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055092, 125929, 24065, '<td valign="top">I am a cat lover, so immediately like your choice of subject.  I don''t even mind the centered composition or background -- they appear very appropriate for the subject.  I do think it would score higher if the focus was sharper and the colors richer.  Hope this information is helpful :)</td>', 'I am a cat lover, so immediately like your choice of subject.  I don''t even mind the centered composition or background -- they appear very appropriate for the subject.  I do think it would score higher if the focus was sharper and the colors richer.  Hope this information is helpful :)', '2004-12-09 20:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055093, 125937, 20779, '<td valign="top">Great image and title. Perfect amount of grainy contrast to create a bold, striking image.</td>', 'Great image and title. Perfect amount of grainy contrast to create a bold, striking image.', '2004-12-09 20:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055095, 125688, 16648, '<td valign="top">Too small. Next time ignore DPI (it is for printing ONLY) and when done editing, resize to 640 pixels on the long side. then do a final USM (150%, .2, 7 or so) and save as JPG and adjust the quality to get the file size under 147k. Even down to 100k is OK.</td>', 'Too small. Next time ignore DPI (it is for printing ONLY) and when done editing, resize to 640 pixels on the long side. then do a final USM (150%, .2, 7 or so) and save as JPG and adjust the quality to get the file size under 147k. Even down to 100k is OK.', '2004-12-09 20:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055096, 126747, 20779, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and contrasts.</td>', 'Excellent composition and contrasts.', '2004-12-09 20:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055097, 126746, 16648, '<td valign="top">A bit noisy, lighting a bit dull. Perhaps hazy...try a shot at USM 30%, radius 60, threshold 1.</td>', 'A bit noisy, lighting a bit dull. Perhaps hazy...try a shot at USM 30%, radius 60, threshold 1.', '2004-12-09 20:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055099, 126540, 20779, '<td valign="top">This one stopped me in my tracks. You did it just right and aptly named it.</td>', 'This one stopped me in my tracks. You did it just right and aptly named it.', '2004-12-09 20:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055100, 126540, 16648, '<td valign="top">Could be an interesting shot - but the composition leaves me cold - i want to see more of this item, or less of it. the big black hole is fighting for my attention, and in the lowest right corner is something... Seems a bit muted too, no ''pop'' to the color.</td>', 'Could be an interesting shot - but the composition leaves me cold - i want to see more of this item, or less of it. the big black hole is fighting for my attention, and in the lowest right corner is something... Seems a bit muted too, no ''pop'' to the color.', '2004-12-09 20:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055101, 126454, 16648, '<td valign="top">Backdrop makes me think this pic was taken in bed under teh sheets. Nice and bright, no shadow on teh backdrop from the model, nice.  the backdrop needs to go...lose the wrinkles, move it back (3 to 5 feet) and get it out of focus or darker or through a colored light on it.</td>', 'Backdrop makes me think this pic was taken in bed under teh sheets. Nice and bright, no shadow on teh backdrop from the model, nice.  the backdrop needs to go...lose the wrinkles, move it back (3 to 5 feet) and get it out of focus or darker or through a colored light on it.', '2004-12-09 20:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055102, 125796, 20779, '<td valign="top">I like the composition in the shot and the colors remind me of pink lemonade - yum! The focus is a bit too soft throughout the photo, and it appears that colors got a little washed out due to flash or over-exposure.</td>', 'I like the composition in the shot and the colors remind me of pink lemonade - yum! The focus is a bit too soft throughout the photo, and it appears that colors got a little washed out due to flash or over-exposure.', '2004-12-09 20:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055103, 126852, 16648, '<td valign="top">WAY too small. Ignore DPI (it is for printing only). When done editing, resize to 640 on the long side, then do a final USM sharpengin and save as JPG using the quality/compression slider/control to get it below 147k Even as low as 100k is fine.  <br/> <br/>It is a bit small to tell for sure, but try running a pass of USM with settings of 35%, 60 radius and t-hold of 1. The rose seems to be hazy and that ''trick'' will brighten it up.<br/> <br/>Nice use of color, the green background. off center comp is working too. too bad it is toooooo smalllllll.</td>', 'WAY too small. Ignore DPI (it is for printing only). When done editing, resize to 640 on the long side, then do a final USM sharpengin and save as JPG using the quality/compression slider/control to get it below 147k Even as low as 100k is fine.   It is a bit small to tell for sure, but try running a pass of USM with settings of 35%, 60 radius and t-hold of 1. The rose seems to be hazy and that ''trick'' will brighten it up. Nice use of color, the green background. off center comp is working too. too bad it is toooooo smalllllll.', '2004-12-09 20:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055104, 126856, 20779, '<td valign="top">Love the title and composition within the frame. For me personally, the brown, textured background is really hurting the overall image, and the fact the the black of the handle in soft focus begins to blend in with the brown.</td>', 'Love the title and composition within the frame. For me personally, the brown, textured background is really hurting the overall image, and the fact the the black of the handle in soft focus begins to blend in with the brown.', '2004-12-09 20:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055105, 126357, 16648, '<td valign="top">Just misses...neeeds some pizzaz. If i had tiome to play in PS tonite I mgiht see if i could help it. More sat? dehaze? more sharpening? Not sure, but i''d start there and see.</td>', 'Just misses...neeeds some pizzaz. If i had tiome to play in PS tonite I mgiht see if i could help it. More sat? dehaze? more sharpening? Not sure, but i''d start there and see.', '2004-12-09 20:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055106, 125852, 16648, '<td valign="top">You MUST tell me how you got a nice aquarium shot! I know salt water ones are MUCH brighter than fresh water, but with the moving fish i cannot get enough light to get the shutter speed to the point the fish are not blurry.  I recently got a slave flash...perhaps i can try that...<br/> <br/>Only ''complaint'' is the yellow fish seems a bit grainy.</td>', 'You MUST tell me how you got a nice aquarium shot! I know salt water ones are MUCH brighter than fresh water, but with the moving fish i cannot get enough light to get the shutter speed to the point the fish are not blurry.  I recently got a slave flash...perhaps i can try that... Only ''complaint'' is the yellow fish seems a bit grainy.', '2004-12-09 20:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055107, 125616, 16648, '<td valign="top">Hmmm....not pretty to look at. The exposure was off (the snow is not white) and it needs some more saturation (to help the hydrant come alive). the tree is too dark too.  Underexpsoed a bit I think. Most of that should have been correctable in editing though.</td>', 'Hmmm....not pretty to look at. The exposure was off (the snow is not white) and it needs some more saturation (to help the hydrant come alive). the tree is too dark too.  Underexpsoed a bit I think. Most of that should have been correctable in editing though.', '2004-12-09 20:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055109, 126667, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful child and expression captured. The focus is a little too soft for my taste, needing a little bump in the light. The photo conveys a "snapshot" feel to me with the candy in hand, necklace falling askew, etc., but not lively enough to be considered a "candid". You did a great job with DOF; the background provides no distraction. I wish it could be in a bit more contrast to her hair, but that doesn''t appear to have been a choice. Her skin and hair appear to glow when positiioned with a lighter, softer color like the yellow.</td>', 'Beautiful child and expression captured. The focus is a little too soft for my taste, needing a little bump in the light. The photo conveys a "snapshot" feel to me with the candy in hand, necklace falling askew, etc., but not lively enough to be considered a "candid". You did a great job with DOF; the background provides no distraction. I wish it could be in a bit more contrast to her hair, but that doesn''t appear to have been a choice. Her skin and hair appear to glow when positiioned with a lighter, softer color like the yellow.', '2004-12-09 20:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055110, 126350, 16648, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, VERY bright, but part of that was the last image i just saw. Too symetrical i think, and I don''t likethe top of the main lemon being cropped so tight. Focus seems a bit soft too.</td>', 'Hmmm, VERY bright, but part of that was the last image i just saw. Too symetrical i think, and I don''t likethe top of the main lemon being cropped so tight. Focus seems a bit soft too.', '2004-12-09 20:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055111, 125930, 16648, '<td valign="top">Nope, not nearly yellow enough. 1<br/> <br/>HAH! Had to give you a comment to crow about later. Odd looking banana spider...</td>', 'Nope, not nearly yellow enough. 1 HAH! Had to give you a comment to crow about later. Odd looking banana spider...', '2004-12-09 20:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055112, 126753, 16648, '<td valign="top">Decent pic, good idea, GREAT interpretation of what yellow means to you.</td>', 'Decent pic, good idea, GREAT interpretation of what yellow means to you.', '2004-12-09 20:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055113, 126788, 16648, '<td valign="top">Cool idea...would like to know how it was done.</td>', 'Cool idea...would like to know how it was done.', '2004-12-09 20:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055114, 126282, 20779, '<td valign="top">On my monitor, the yellow is coming across with a strong green cast, I think possibly due to the blue background. Very nice lighting, but a little flat and out of focus. I like the close, tight emphasis you chose to use.</td>', 'On my monitor, the yellow is coming across with a strong green cast, I think possibly due to the blue background. Very nice lighting, but a little flat and out of focus. I like the close, tight emphasis you chose to use.', '2004-12-09 21:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055116, 125820, 16648, '<td valign="top">Piss on that.<br/> <br/>you were waiting for just that comment, right?</td>', 'Piss on that. you were waiting for just that comment, right?', '2004-12-09 21:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055118, 126654, 16648, '<td valign="top">The lemon needs more power - saw a shot where that was done by using a flashlight to backlight the lemon.</td>', 'The lemon needs more power - saw a shot where that was done by using a flashlight to backlight the lemon.', '2004-12-09 21:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055119, 126545, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very striking, but appears too much as digitalized art for my tastes. The photo has a good use of negative space, but I believe it would be enhanced by either straightening the lamp or tilting it even further to make is more obviously intentional.</td>', 'Very striking, but appears too much as digitalized art for my tastes. The photo has a good use of negative space, but I believe it would be enhanced by either straightening the lamp or tilting it even further to make is more obviously intentional.', '2004-12-09 21:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055120, 126804, 16648, '<td valign="top">Bulb is too bright, tree a tad too dark. more ambient light would have allowed a brighter tree and a shorter exposure to keep the bulb from blowing out.</td>', 'Bulb is too bright, tree a tad too dark. more ambient light would have allowed a brighter tree and a shorter exposure to keep the bulb from blowing out.', '2004-12-09 21:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055123, 126379, 16648, '<td valign="top">Needs more tree trunk or perhaps a kite int eh branches...just the pattern does not carry the pic.</td>', 'Needs more tree trunk or perhaps a kite int eh branches...just the pattern does not carry the pic.', '2004-12-09 21:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055124, 126310, 16648, '<td valign="top">Not very yellow -  even for lemons. cute idea. lots of ways to get the lemons to show more yellow.</td>', 'Not very yellow -  even for lemons. cute idea. lots of ways to get the lemons to show more yellow.', '2004-12-09 21:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055125, 126889, 16648, '<td valign="top">I am a great complainer about poor use of DOF - this is the poster pic for HOW to use it CORRECTLY. +2 on the score for that alone! Oh, hell. 10.</td>', 'I am a great complainer about poor use of DOF - this is the poster pic for HOW to use it CORRECTLY. +2 on the score for that alone! Oh, hell. 10.', '2004-12-09 21:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055129, 125781, 16648, '<td valign="top">A catalog shot. Perhaps on a car, with some reference to troops or peaceniks...something that makes a statement, makes me think or feel something.  What do YOU think when you see these magnets? SHow me THAT in the pic!</td>', 'A catalog shot. Perhaps on a car, with some reference to troops or peaceniks...something that makes a statement, makes me think or feel something.  What do YOU think when you see these magnets? SHow me THAT in the pic!', '2004-12-09 21:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055130, 126796, 23962, '<td valign="top">This might be the first cat pic that I have given a vote above 5! Shallow depth of field and composition are right on.</td>', 'This might be the first cat pic that I have given a vote above 5! Shallow depth of field and composition are right on.', '2004-12-09 21:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055131, 126349, 16648, '<td valign="top">If i had a sub...   On to your pic...lots of issues to work on. Lighting: you need something morethan the direct flash from the camera. the front fender is over exposed and hte background shows, the light falls off on the carpet ....try a table with a tshirt or sheet, or posterboard works well. it can be curved up the back and be a ''floor ''and a wall.   The car hood is very noisy. high iso setting (due to low light) will do this. Check out a program (free) called Neat Image.  Lastly, the front wheel is not in focus. As light drops off you openteh aperture more (to a lower number) and that reduces DOF. So more light will allow a smaller aperture and more DOF...lighting: start there.</td>', 'If i had a sub...   On to your pic...lots of issues to work on. Lighting: you need something morethan the direct flash from the camera. the front fender is over exposed and hte background shows, the light falls off on the carpet ....try a table with a tshirt or sheet, or posterboard works well. it can be curved up the back and be a ''floor ''and a wall.   The car hood is very noisy. high iso setting (due to low light) will do this. Check out a program (free) called Neat Image.  Lastly, the front wheel is not in focus. As light drops off you openteh aperture more (to a lower number) and that reduces DOF. So more light will allow a smaller aperture and more DOF...lighting: start there.', '2004-12-09 21:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055132, 125857, 16648, '<td valign="top">Needs more DOF and some re-composition. My eye is drawn to the in-focus green stem. the item you want me to look at, the flower, is largely out of focus.</td>', 'Needs more DOF and some re-composition. My eye is drawn to the in-focus green stem. the item you want me to look at, the flower, is largely out of focus.', '2004-12-09 21:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055133, 126061, 16648, '<td valign="top">Staged or happenstance? Is yellow a hot color there, fashion wise? all you are missing is a yellow bike!  Lighting is a bit dull though. Not much you could have done about that though.</td>', 'Staged or happenstance? Is yellow a hot color there, fashion wise? all you are missing is a yellow bike!  Lighting is a bit dull though. Not much you could have done about that though.', '2004-12-09 21:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055135, 126581, 23962, '<td valign="top">Holy &amp;^%^%&amp; !! You win. Just added this to my favorites and desktop. Brilliant concept if a might predictable. Lighting, colour, composition, concept, nails the challenge. I haven''t given out a 10 yet but I''m struggling with this one. <br/>Hope you are happy and proud.</td>', 'Holy &^%^%& !! You win. Just added this to my favorites and desktop. Brilliant concept if a might predictable. Lighting, colour, composition, concept, nails the challenge. I haven''t given out a 10 yet but I''m struggling with this one. Hope you are happy and proud.', '2004-12-09 21:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055136, 125990, 16648, '<td valign="top">Yes, a dump truck.  a snapshot of a dumptruck. You need to go in closer and low - like th etruck is going to run me, the viewer over.  <br/> <br/>Technically, the undercarriage is too dark, draws my eye. the excavator in the left should be cropped out - it adds nothing, but does distract.  The sky is dull - a polarizer filter would have helped, and cut the windshield glasre to nothing, letting the driver stand out more.</td>', 'Yes, a dump truck.  a snapshot of a dumptruck. You need to go in closer and low - like th etruck is going to run me, the viewer over.   Technically, the undercarriage is too dark, draws my eye. the excavator in the left should be cropped out - it adds nothing, but does distract.  The sky is dull - a polarizer filter would have helped, and cut the windshield glasre to nothing, letting the driver stand out more.', '2004-12-09 21:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055137, 126674, 23962, '<td valign="top">Freud called. He wants his obsession back.</td>', 'Freud called. He wants his obsession back.', '2004-12-09 21:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055138, 126788, 17877, '<td valign="top">woah. I hope you wrote a description of how you did that because I will definitely be checking back!</td>', 'woah. I hope you wrote a description of how you did that because I will definitely be checking back!', '2004-12-09 21:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055139, 126886, 16648, '<td valign="top">HTe hammer head and handle blend into teh background, losing the impact you had envisioned. Sorry, had to be punny.  A different color backdrop or backlight the hammer a bit (like a hair light) to help distinguish it from the backdrop.</td>', 'HTe hammer head and handle blend into teh background, losing the impact you had envisioned. Sorry, had to be punny.  A different color backdrop or backlight the hammer a bit (like a hair light) to help distinguish it from the backdrop.', '2004-12-09 21:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055140, 126840, 16648, '<td valign="top">Lacks punch/pop. Try USM 35%, 60, 1. Might help.</td>', 'Lacks punch/pop. Try USM 35%, 60, 1. Might help.', '2004-12-09 21:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055141, 126458, 16648, '<td valign="top">This is one time I think being symmetrical would have helped.</td>', 'This is one time I think being symmetrical would have helped.', '2004-12-09 21:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055142, 126565, 16648, '<td valign="top">a  tad small.</td>', 'a  tad small.', '2004-12-09 21:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
