(1055209, 126548, 16648, '<td valign="top">Of course, the Sunset Shot. Add a cat and you get a 10. Sorry, had to say it. An excellent shot, beautiful composition.  Gotta give ya a 1.  <br/> <br/>Oops, typo. Had ya worried, huh? perhaps 9+? Get the couple walking hand in hand,, with a dog and you get a 10. or take one of them away( the girl)...get a 10.<br/> <br/>The horizon is level, nice.  not in  the tradional lower or upper 1/3, but here it works, giving equal prominence to the sky and water. might suggest a tad more crop onthe left  or cloning to lose the one lonely cloud.</td>', 'Of course, the Sunset Shot. Add a cat and you get a 10. Sorry, had to say it. An excellent shot, beautiful composition.  Gotta give ya a 1.   Oops, typo. Had ya worried, huh? perhaps 9+? Get the couple walking hand in hand,, with a dog and you get a 10. or take one of them away( the girl)...get a 10. The horizon is level, nice.  not in  the tradional lower or upper 1/3, but here it works, giving equal prominence to the sky and water. might suggest a tad more crop onthe left  or cloning to lose the one lonely cloud.', '2004-12-09 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
