(1055318, 126752, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of the ducks a lot, but I''m not crazy about the towel as the background and base. I understand the use of it, I just think the ducks on a simpler background would have had stronger impact.</td>', 'I like the composition of the ducks a lot, but I''m not crazy about the towel as the background and base. I understand the use of it, I just think the ducks on a simpler background would have had stronger impact.', '2004-12-09 22:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055320, 126671, 22384, '<td valign="top">The compostion: the flowers angled toward the left, indicating the past and memory, the epitaph in the background fading off the frame are strong composition basics, nicely done. The mums (think that is what they are called) which are grey are a shadow of a weakness in the photo. Their color should work because they pick up the grey of the wood in the background, but the flowers just look too healthy to be grey. The green foliage looks a little wilted. Too bad those mums looks so darn healthy. Nice shot. Well thought out. It also would have been nice if the celophane were a solid color or just clear without the circles. They are distracting. I am being very picky, but this photo is so very close to hitting the mark. Your potential shines through in the basic elements of this photo. The tiny details that I mention are just that, tiny details. Great shot...8</td>', 'The compostion: the flowers angled toward the left, indicating the past and memory, the epitaph in the background fading off the frame are strong composition basics, nicely done. The mums (think that is what they are called) which are grey are a shadow of a weakness in the photo. Their color should work because they pick up the grey of the wood in the background, but the flowers just look too healthy to be grey. The green foliage looks a little wilted. Too bad those mums looks so darn healthy. Nice shot. Well thought out. It also would have been nice if the celophane were a solid color or just clear without the circles. They are distracting. I am being very picky, but this photo is so very close to hitting the mark. Your potential shines through in the basic elements of this photo. The tiny details that I mention are just that, tiny details. Great shot...8', '2004-12-09 22:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055326, 125360, 22384, '<td valign="top">The concept for this shot is brilliant in its simplicity. The noise is actually a good choice, but it is too much and shades of orange on the door lower the quality, but I love the mysterious feeling of this photo, making it a fascinating enigma. A great mind is at work here. Risky and daring...8</td>', 'The concept for this shot is brilliant in its simplicity. The noise is actually a good choice, but it is too much and shades of orange on the door lower the quality, but I love the mysterious feeling of this photo, making it a fascinating enigma. A great mind is at work here. Risky and daring...8', '2004-12-09 22:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055329, 126811, 8624, '<td valign="top">pretty enough blooms, but I think all the leaves and stems in the background are too distracting. simpler is better.</td>', 'pretty enough blooms, but I think all the leaves and stems in the background are too distracting. simpler is better.', '2004-12-09 22:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055330, 126756, 8624, '<td valign="top">nicely lit. good angle. a decent product shot.</td>', 'nicely lit. good angle. a decent product shot.', '2004-12-09 22:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055331, 125930, 29513, '<td valign="top">The banana and the bug are nice and sharp.  I might have experimented with a background that would contrast more with them.</td>', 'The banana and the bug are nice and sharp.  I might have experimented with a background that would contrast more with them.', '2004-12-09 22:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055332, 126790, 8624, '<td valign="top">like it a lot! I wish the lemon was as bright and as saturated as the painted hand, but it is a very nice composition overall. well done.</td>', 'like it a lot! I wish the lemon was as bright and as saturated as the painted hand, but it is a very nice composition overall. well done.', '2004-12-09 22:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055336, 126165, 22384, '<td valign="top">I am relieved that this isn''t just another lemon shot. Nice composition. I want the pie to look either more perfect, or more messed up. It is kinda middle of the road. The lemon meringue pie that I remember (I haven''t seen it in ages) has a filling that looks like glass when you cut it. It is a bias that isn''t fair so I am not going to let it impact my vote. But I want, desperately for some reason, to see that glasslike image...6</td>', 'I am relieved that this isn''t just another lemon shot. Nice composition. I want the pie to look either more perfect, or more messed up. It is kinda middle of the road. The lemon meringue pie that I remember (I haven''t seen it in ages) has a filling that looks like glass when you cut it. It is a bias that isn''t fair so I am not going to let it impact my vote. But I want, desperately for some reason, to see that glasslike image...6', '2004-12-09 22:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055337, 126313, 8624, '<td valign="top">hey - it''s Fabio! this is a pretty cool  image, nicely composed. I like the casual look of the loosened tie and open shirt, without seeing the person''s face.</td>', 'hey - it''s Fabio! this is a pretty cool  image, nicely composed. I like the casual look of the loosened tie and open shirt, without seeing the person''s face.', '2004-12-09 22:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055338, 126141, 8624, '<td valign="top">simple and elegant. good use of negative space</td>', 'simple and elegant. good use of negative space', '2004-12-09 22:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055339, 125438, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. The shadow in the background is distracting, but I really like the fact that we can see through the balloon. The composition works well for me. Good job...7</td>', 'Nice shot. The shadow in the background is distracting, but I really like the fact that we can see through the balloon. The composition works well for me. Good job...7', '2004-12-09 22:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055340, 126598, 29477, '<td valign="top">very creative photo and title...some backlighting to remove the hand shadow would have improved this photo.</td>', 'very creative photo and title...some backlighting to remove the hand shadow would have improved this photo.', '2004-12-09 22:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055342, 126217, 8624, '<td valign="top">many many lemon shots. very few as good as this. great action capture and an interesting angle of presentation. super saturated colors really make the shot pop. well done.</td>', 'many many lemon shots. very few as good as this. great action capture and an interesting angle of presentation. super saturated colors really make the shot pop. well done.', '2004-12-09 22:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055344, 126796, 29477, '<td valign="top">Second cat photo I''ve liked tonight (what is wrong with me).  Great eyes..</td>', 'Second cat photo I''ve liked tonight (what is wrong with me).  Great eyes..', '2004-12-09 23:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055345, 125915, 29513, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little harsh for my taste.  Maybe move the light source to 90 deg. off to eiither side.  Can''t really see enough details on the yellow ones to tell if they are in really sharp or not.</td>', 'The lighting is a little harsh for my taste.  Maybe move the light source to 90 deg. off to eiither side.  Can''t really see enough details on the yellow ones to tell if they are in really sharp or not.', '2004-12-09 23:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055346, 125390, 22384, '<td valign="top">This is picky, picky, but presentation is everything... The title should be-- My Mind''s Uncertain, you need the apostrophe because it is really --My MInd is Uncertain, but it is probably just a typo. (Yes, in fact, I am an English teacher.)  Beautiful line and perspective. I am uncomfortable with the fact that her face is so orange with this contrast level, but it sure works well on her stunning body. Maybe a blur would work here. This is a case where I am not sure how the image meets the challenge, but I am not a stickler for that because I could be missing something, and I concentrate on the image.</td>', 'This is picky, picky, but presentation is everything... The title should be-- My Mind''s Uncertain, you need the apostrophe because it is really --My MInd is Uncertain, but it is probably just a typo. (Yes, in fact, I am an English teacher.)  Beautiful line and perspective. I am uncomfortable with the fact that her face is so orange with this contrast level, but it sure works well on her stunning body. Maybe a blur would work here. This is a case where I am not sure how the image meets the challenge, but I am not a stickler for that because I could be missing something, and I concentrate on the image.', '2004-12-09 23:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055348, 126310, 23458, '<td valign="top">8 - for making me laugh, I really like the grimy feel of this photo. Very effective.</td>', '8 - for making me laugh, I really like the grimy feel of this photo. Very effective.', '2004-12-09 23:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055349, 126839, 29477, '<td valign="top">Nice composition...I would have liked to seen stronger lighting to really bring out the yellow on the paper.  Seems a little dull under the lighting you have chosen.</td>', 'Nice composition...I would have liked to seen stronger lighting to really bring out the yellow on the paper.  Seems a little dull under the lighting you have chosen.', '2004-12-09 23:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055350, 126367, 22384, '<td valign="top">Sweet sunset, or sunrise. It is a challenge to make a sunset unique and interesting. The branch makes the shot, and that is a credit to your creative eye. I like the oranges and yellows in the water. Very nice...8</td>', 'Sweet sunset, or sunrise. It is a challenge to make a sunset unique and interesting. The branch makes the shot, and that is a credit to your creative eye. I like the oranges and yellows in the water. Very nice...8', '2004-12-09 23:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055352, 126599, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well as far as flower macros go this is one of the best; technically brilliant. Unfortunately it doesn''t exactly break the mould, or do anything to excite me. Oh well,  for sheer technical skill it''s an 8.</td>', 'Well as far as flower macros go this is one of the best; technically brilliant. Unfortunately it doesn''t exactly break the mould, or do anything to excite me. Oh well,  for sheer technical skill it''s an 8.', '2004-12-09 23:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055353, 126770, 23458, '<td valign="top">I like the minimalist feel here, I''m surprised, but for some reason I gind this genuinely effective. 8.</td>', 'I like the minimalist feel here, I''m surprised, but for some reason I gind this genuinely effective. 8.', '2004-12-09 23:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055354, 126217, 23458, '<td valign="top">As far as setup shots go, this one is terrific. Think you may have cropped a little too close on the right (would like the lemon not to be cut out) but other than that this is superb... but I''m sure you know that from your (most likely) very high average score. 10.</td>', 'As far as setup shots go, this one is terrific. Think you may have cropped a little too close on the right (would like the lemon not to be cut out) but other than that this is superb... but I''m sure you know that from your (most likely) very high average score. 10.', '2004-12-09 23:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055355, 125657, 23458, '<td valign="top">Title is great, I think this image would look better with something other than a yellow cast - seems like you just did it for the sake of fitting the challenge (obviously) but still, the lighting is great and this is certainly a different take on the challenge. Good work. 8.</td>', 'Title is great, I think this image would look better with something other than a yellow cast - seems like you just did it for the sake of fitting the challenge (obviously) but still, the lighting is great and this is certainly a different take on the challenge. Good work. 8.', '2004-12-09 23:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055356, 126840, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is pretty, like the soft focus. Yet not quite wowing me for some reason. 6.</td>', 'This is pretty, like the soft focus. Yet not quite wowing me for some reason. 6.', '2004-12-09 23:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055358, 126863, 23458, '<td valign="top">the wire adds a funky flavour to this flower shot, I like it. 9.</td>', 'the wire adds a funky flavour to this flower shot, I like it. 9.', '2004-12-09 23:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055359, 126645, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and use of motif. I like that the fourth cord is out of line, adding an interesting asymetrical element.</td>', 'Nice perspective and use of motif. I like that the fourth cord is out of line, adding an interesting asymetrical element.', '2004-12-09 23:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055360, 126703, 22384, '<td valign="top">Fun shot. You sure know how to create a focal point. I like this.</td>', 'Fun shot. You sure know how to create a focal point. I like this.', '2004-12-09 23:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055362, 126612, 23458, '<td valign="top">Now thats refreshing, yes, the impact of this photo is certainly created by the yellow... nice to see someone achieving that without covering the image in yellow. 10. (Wow, did I just catch myself giving a ten to a flower macro...erghhh!!)</td>', 'Now thats refreshing, yes, the impact of this photo is certainly created by the yellow... nice to see someone achieving that without covering the image in yellow. 10. (Wow, did I just catch myself giving a ten to a flower macro...erghhh!!)', '2004-12-09 23:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055364, 125858, 29513, '<td valign="top">I know there is always a trade off in croping/framing but I would like to see how this lools including the base and rim of the glass.  A different background might work well, too.  Nice shot, though.</td>', 'I know there is always a trade off in croping/framing but I would like to see how this lools including the base and rim of the glass.  A different background might work well, too.  Nice shot, though.', '2004-12-09 23:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055365, 125900, 23458, '<td valign="top">Simplistic, well lit, 7.</td>', 'Simplistic, well lit, 7.', '2004-12-09 23:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055368, 125949, 15574, '<td valign="top">LOL!..This picture made me laugh the best laugh of the day!!</td>', 'LOL!..This picture made me laugh the best laugh of the day!!', '2004-12-09 23:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055369, 126706, 23458, '<td valign="top">Next time, please don''t choose semi - rotten lemons... A shot like this really really needs pristine fruit. Also it''s a little dull in the lighting department.</td>', 'Next time, please don''t choose semi - rotten lemons... A shot like this really really needs pristine fruit. Also it''s a little dull in the lighting department.', '2004-12-09 23:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055370, 125733, 15574, '<td valign="top">leaves are real pixely..cool tree though</td>', 'leaves are real pixely..cool tree though', '2004-12-09 23:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055371, 126769, 22384, '<td valign="top">This image is disturbing because it evokes my memory of the horrific beheadings that have been in the news this year. Is that what you intended? I am looking for other hints and parallels. The balloons could be just that. I am curious about your message. The lighting leans that way too. Is this image an enigma, or am I just to cowardly to see it for what it is?</td>', 'This image is disturbing because it evokes my memory of the horrific beheadings that have been in the news this year. Is that what you intended? I am looking for other hints and parallels. The balloons could be just that. I am curious about your message. The lighting leans that way too. Is this image an enigma, or am I just to cowardly to see it for what it is?', '2004-12-09 23:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055374, 126743, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is definately a clever idea...I would have tried a squarer crop around the eyes and fingers (the nose kinda distracts) but still, a clever idea. 7.</td>', 'This is definately a clever idea...I would have tried a squarer crop around the eyes and fingers (the nose kinda distracts) but still, a clever idea. 7.', '2004-12-09 23:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055375, 126529, 23458, '<td valign="top">Clever selective desat here. I feared it would be horribly overdone in this challenge, but this is an effective use of the technique.</td>', 'Clever selective desat here. I feared it would be horribly overdone in this challenge, but this is an effective use of the technique.', '2004-12-09 23:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055377, 125730, 23458, '<td valign="top">Hehehe, Nice lighting. Clever approach. 7.</td>', 'Hehehe, Nice lighting. Clever approach. 7.', '2004-12-09 23:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055380, 126370, 22384, '<td valign="top">Surreal, fun, and, thank heavens, different. I don''t think I could stand another lemon shot. I would like the duck in the foreground to be tipped back, a bit away from me. As it is right now, it feels as if it is falling awkwardly forward and out of the frame. That runs counter to the fun easy feeling of the rest of the shot.  Creative and daring...bravo for that!  7</td>', 'Surreal, fun, and, thank heavens, different. I don''t think I could stand another lemon shot. I would like the duck in the foreground to be tipped back, a bit away from me. As it is right now, it feels as if it is falling awkwardly forward and out of the frame. That runs counter to the fun easy feeling of the rest of the shot.  Creative and daring...bravo for that!  7', '2004-12-09 23:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055386, 125739, 23458, '<td valign="top">THis is an effective shot... an different take on the challenge... its not a daisy, daffodil, lemon, sunflower or even a sunset... and for that as well as the effective shadows and great texture you get a 9 from me.</td>', 'THis is an effective shot... an different take on the challenge... its not a daisy, daffodil, lemon, sunflower or even a sunset... and for that as well as the effective shadows and great texture you get a 9 from me.', '2004-12-09 23:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055395, 126843, 22384, '<td valign="top">Stunning line and pleasant composition. Thank goodness for peppers and not lemons. If I recall, these are expensive little buggers. This shot, unless you took it in the store, was a spendy one. The soft blur works for me in this shot. Just a teeny complaint, petty really. I would turn the pepper in the back left so that its stem faces away, at least some degree, from the front. It is too close to the same positioning as the one in front of it. Other than that, this shot works well for me. 7</td>', 'Stunning line and pleasant composition. Thank goodness for peppers and not lemons. If I recall, these are expensive little buggers. This shot, unless you took it in the store, was a spendy one. The soft blur works for me in this shot. Just a teeny complaint, petty really. I would turn the pepper in the back left so that its stem faces away, at least some degree, from the front. It is too close to the same positioning as the one in front of it. Other than that, this shot works well for me. 7', '2004-12-09 23:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055396, 125922, 22384, '<td valign="top">Simple, elegant and fascinating. The stem is just a little out of focus, but other than that, this is a sweet image...and thank heavens, it is not a lemon!  8</td>', 'Simple, elegant and fascinating. The stem is just a little out of focus, but other than that, this is a sweet image...and thank heavens, it is not a lemon!  8', '2004-12-09 23:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055401, 126389, 22384, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for dog shots. This is an absolutely useless comment, but cute dog. He looks completely bored. I like the buttery yellow. Most shots are so bright that my retinas are burning. I don''t like the hedgehog toy. It distracts from your subject. 6</td>', 'I am a sucker for dog shots. This is an absolutely useless comment, but cute dog. He looks completely bored. I like the buttery yellow. Most shots are so bright that my retinas are burning. I don''t like the hedgehog toy. It distracts from your subject. 6', '2004-12-09 23:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055405, 126116, 22384, '<td valign="top">Okay, another dog photo, for which I am a hopeless sucker. I also have a golden retriever. Beautiful dogs. I think the dog alone would carry the shot. The fire hydrant distracts from your true focal point, the stunning golden. I am a rebel in that I vote dog shots high to counteract the impact of those who just give them a 1 out of some sort of innate, dog-hate. What an unhappy, sorry group of people ;-)<br/>8</td>', 'Okay, another dog photo, for which I am a hopeless sucker. I also have a golden retriever. Beautiful dogs. I think the dog alone would carry the shot. The fire hydrant distracts from your true focal point, the stunning golden. I am a rebel in that I vote dog shots high to counteract the impact of those who just give them a 1 out of some sort of innate, dog-hate. What an unhappy, sorry group of people ;-)8', '2004-12-09 23:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055412, 125895, 16106, '<td valign="top">interestingidea but the fact that the yellow does not arise fron the subject matter, rather is an artifact of taking the shot doimishes the shot''s applicability. Still it made me laugh.</td>', 'interestingidea but the fact that the yellow does not arise fron the subject matter, rather is an artifact of taking the shot doimishes the shot''s applicability. Still it made me laugh.', '2004-12-09 23:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055416, 126868, 6388, '<td valign="top">great use of available light.  so much more interesting than perfect studio light.  i like that they''re not perfectly arranged stems-up or anything.  i would like to see more of the shadow of the bowl though...just because i think shadows add depth to a photo.  for fun i''d try increasing th contrast some, so the shadows are darker and the highlights are lighter (curves or levels).  makes a great study of light.<br/> <br/>well done.<br/> <br/>P</td>', 'great use of available light.  so much more interesting than perfect studio light.  i like that they''re not perfectly arranged stems-up or anything.  i would like to see more of the shadow of the bowl though...just because i think shadows add depth to a photo.  for fun i''d try increasing th contrast some, so the shadows are darker and the highlights are lighter (curves or levels).  makes a great study of light. well done. P', '2004-12-09 23:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055418, 126689, 15574, '<td valign="top">took me a little bit to figure out what he was holding on to, but when i figured it out..wow..great picture. Go lance!  9</td>', 'took me a little bit to figure out what he was holding on to, but when i figured it out..wow..great picture. Go lance!  9', '2004-12-09 23:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055420, 126063, 6388, '<td valign="top">kind of a random image.  not always a bad thing mind you.  in my view, a photographers job is to subtly direct the viewer...to convey a message or share a view of something.  I''m not really getting that from this.  I''m getting the compositional contrast, but not really the point.  (I''m not voting by the way, just commenting so don''t worry about my opinion affecting your score).  I''d be interested to see you work with this theme some more - maybe with different subjects when you''re not worried about a challenge.<br/> <br/>technically it''s pretty solid.  focus is good, sharpness and DOF is good.  could use a little diffusing of the light to tame some of the hotspots on the metal.  even a piece of thin white paperbetween the light source and subject  would do the trick.<br/> <br/>good luck.<br/> <br/>P</td>', 'kind of a random image.  not always a bad thing mind you.  in my view, a photographers job is to subtly direct the viewer...to convey a message or share a view of something.  I''m not really getting that from this.  I''m getting the compositional contrast, but not really the point.  (I''m not voting by the way, just commenting so don''t worry about my opinion affecting your score).  I''d be interested to see you work with this theme some more - maybe with different subjects when you''re not worried about a challenge. technically it''s pretty solid.  focus is good, sharpness and DOF is good.  could use a little diffusing of the light to tame some of the hotspots on the metal.  even a piece of thin white paperbetween the light source and subject  would do the trick. good luck. P', '2004-12-09 23:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055422, 126604, 6388, '<td valign="top">this is probably one of those ones that''s getting the ''orange'' comments.  sadly DPC can be like that.  gotta smack ''em in the face with it sometimes.  this is an interesting take o nthe theme.  VERY difficult to shoot without hotspots if you want any kind of definition in the subject, particularly in basic editing.  it''s simple.  i like simple.  good luck</td>', 'this is probably one of those ones that''s getting the ''orange'' comments.  sadly DPC can be like that.  gotta smack ''em in the face with it sometimes.  this is an interesting take o nthe theme.  VERY difficult to shoot without hotspots if you want any kind of definition in the subject, particularly in basic editing.  it''s simple.  i like simple.  good luck', '2004-12-09 23:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055424, 126673, 15574, '<td valign="top">normally i wouldn''t like the drain in the shot, but i like it in this ..great picture!</td>', 'normally i wouldn''t like the drain in the shot, but i like it in this ..great picture!', '2004-12-09 23:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055425, 125730, 27375, '<td valign="top">not sure exactly what this shot is suppose to mean, but i think its great, lighting, color subject. the way the coffe cup is in the black shadow is awesome</td>', 'not sure exactly what this shot is suppose to mean, but i think its great, lighting, color subject. the way the coffe cup is in the black shadow is awesome', '2004-12-09 23:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055426, 126061, 15574, '<td valign="top">I like how you executed this shot, I would have liked it better w/out the ppl in the background tho. esp. bc the girl in the middles face is noticably yellow.</td>', 'I like how you executed this shot, I would have liked it better w/out the ppl in the background tho. esp. bc the girl in the middles face is noticably yellow.', '2004-12-09 23:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
