(1055545, 126791, 22479, '<td valign="top">At first I brushed past this entry. On closer inspection, I think this is a remarkable photograph. Haven''t a clue what I''m looking at unfortunately. It appears to be taken at a fairly close distance. There are some halos around the rings which appear secondary to post processing. What I find remarkable is the contrast between the yellow and black. I''m assuming you did all modifications under basic rules. Quite impressive. 7</td>', 'At first I brushed past this entry. On closer inspection, I think this is a remarkable photograph. Haven''t a clue what I''m looking at unfortunately. It appears to be taken at a fairly close distance. There are some halos around the rings which appear secondary to post processing. What I find remarkable is the contrast between the yellow and black. I''m assuming you did all modifications under basic rules. Quite impressive. 7', '2004-12-10 02:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
