(1055786, 125561, 23394, '<td valign="top">Composition: 10<br/>Technical: 10<br/>Appeal: 10<br/>Challenge: 10<br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 10, yes, this is yellow, overwhelmingly yellow, but it is a very different take than what i have seen in the other entries.  cheers to uniqueness!  i think this would look really cool in a box frame in a kitchen.</td>', 'Composition: 10Technical: 10Appeal: 10Challenge: 10Overall Calculated Average Score: 10, yes, this is yellow, overwhelmingly yellow, but it is a very different take than what i have seen in the other entries.  cheers to uniqueness!  i think this would look really cool in a box frame in a kitchen.', '2004-12-10 09:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
