(1055793, 126623, 93, '<td valign="top">Composition: 9, A pretty strong composition. The upper "horizon" line in the background would have been nice to see eliminated<br/>Technical: 7, Slightly noisy and over-exposed in areas<br/>Appeal: 10, This has a great appeal for me. Nostalgic, classic, and fun<br/>Challenge: 7, It has yellow in it, but I''m not sure if it''s as strong as it could be if you''d tried to keep the sand a little more colorful.<br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 8</td>', 'Composition: 9, A pretty strong composition. The upper "horizon" line in the background would have been nice to see eliminatedTechnical: 7, Slightly noisy and over-exposed in areasAppeal: 10, This has a great appeal for me. Nostalgic, classic, and funChallenge: 7, It has yellow in it, but I''m not sure if it''s as strong as it could be if you''d tried to keep the sand a little more colorful.Overall Calculated Average Score: 8', '2004-12-10 09:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055796, 126800, 93, '<td valign="top">Composition: 8, A quirky composition, but it works for me.<br/>Technical: 8, A little bit of noise in the darker areas.<br/>Appeal: 6, It''s funny, but there''s not much of an appeal factor other than that, for me.<br/>Challenge: 5, This would definitely fit a *blue* challenge better, as that color seems to be the impact.  The yellow duck, for me, is just an after-thought.<br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 7, It''s a nice photograph, but needed to be stronger on the challenge in my opinion.</td>', 'Composition: 8, A quirky composition, but it works for me.Technical: 8, A little bit of noise in the darker areas.Appeal: 6, It''s funny, but there''s not much of an appeal factor other than that, for me.Challenge: 5, This would definitely fit a *blue* challenge better, as that color seems to be the impact.  The yellow duck, for me, is just an after-thought.Overall Calculated Average Score: 7, It''s a nice photograph, but needed to be stronger on the challenge in my opinion.', '2004-12-10 09:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055799, 125683, 93, '<td valign="top">Composition: 7, I don''t really like the rectangular composition here.<br/>Technical: 10, I can''t find anything wrong with this technically.. It''s sharp, clean, and wonderfully lit.<br/>Appeal: 8, Definitely very artsy, with a nice appeal.<br/>Challenge: 4, I had to dock you on this, as this really is more orangey-red, with the only yellow feel being highlights on the face, and slight ones at that.<br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 7, Were it more "Yellow", a much higher score.</td>', 'Composition: 7, I don''t really like the rectangular composition here.Technical: 10, I can''t find anything wrong with this technically.. It''s sharp, clean, and wonderfully lit.Appeal: 8, Definitely very artsy, with a nice appeal.Challenge: 4, I had to dock you on this, as this really is more orangey-red, with the only yellow feel being highlights on the face, and slight ones at that.Overall Calculated Average Score: 7, Were it more "Yellow", a much higher score.', '2004-12-10 09:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055802, 126610, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is a really neat picture. I really like the pattern of the smoke. I think the impact would have been even greater if you made the backround pitch black and the angle of the camera was more straight on as opposed to coming down at an angle.</td>', 'This is a really neat picture. I really like the pattern of the smoke. I think the impact would have been even greater if you made the backround pitch black and the angle of the camera was more straight on as opposed to coming down at an angle.', '2004-12-10 09:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055803, 126231, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good use of negative space. Try using Neat Image to clean up the grainy appearance of the sky.</td>', 'Good use of negative space. Try using Neat Image to clean up the grainy appearance of the sky.', '2004-12-10 09:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055806, 126621, 24715, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract. Color works well here.</td>', 'Interesting abstract. Color works well here.', '2004-12-10 09:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
