(1055812, 126625, 3306, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet you took several pictures of water dropping before you got one where the drop was exactly 1/2 way between the backround and the cup! Good effort.</td>', 'I''ll bet you took several pictures of water dropping before you got one where the drop was exactly 1/2 way between the backround and the cup! Good effort.', '2004-12-10 09:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
