(1055815, 126762, 24715, '<td valign="top">Nice job! Color combination is great. Shadow is a nice touch, even the light glare is not too distracting, it even ads more interest/detail to the photo.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-12-15 08:42:25.</i></td>', 'Nice job! Color combination is great. Shadow is a nice touch, even the light glare is not too distracting, it even ads more interest/detail to the photo.', '2004-12-10 09:25:36.000000', '2004-12-15 08:42:25.000000', 1),
(1055817, 126746, 24715, '<td valign="top">Great idea and the chosen angle. Good focus and DoF. Maybe just white balance could be improved to make the background more white instead of pinkish color.</td>', 'Great idea and the chosen angle. Good focus and DoF. Maybe just white balance could be improved to make the background more white instead of pinkish color.', '2004-12-10 09:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055818, 126633, 28196, '<td valign="top">Great idea and realisation, I only think that the part above the surface is degrading a photo a bit... While the action in water is perfectly lit, part above it is underexposed with only fraction of splash visible. Also water drops on front glass and reflection of the lemon on surface are distracting... 10 for the underwater part and 7 for the rest =&gt; still a solid 9...</td>', 'Great idea and realisation, I only think that the part above the surface is degrading a photo a bit... While the action in water is perfectly lit, part above it is underexposed with only fraction of splash visible. Also water drops on front glass and reflection of the lemon on surface are distracting... 10 for the underwater part and 7 for the rest => still a solid 9...', '2004-12-10 09:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055842, 126461, 26756, '<td valign="top">Different and very creative.  I like the blue color surrounding the yolk, the stopped action and the lighting.  I wonder how long this took to do.</td>', 'Different and very creative.  I like the blue color surrounding the yolk, the stopped action and the lighting.  I wonder how long this took to do.', '2004-12-10 10:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
