(1055850, 126630, 8759, '<td valign="top">Overexposed. I don''t like the border (the colour of it) Good luck!</td>', 'Overexposed. I don''t like the border (the colour of it) Good luck!', '2004-12-10 10:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055869, 126692, 8759, '<td valign="top">Why the yellow border? Otherwise 8</td>', 'Why the yellow border? Otherwise 8', '2004-12-10 10:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055904, 126285, 4226, '<td valign="top">To be honest, I don''t see much yellow or how yellow leads to the impact.. the part that''s supposed to be yellow looks a little green.. hmm my monitor   looks calibrated, but still i don''t see how its yellow. <br/>As for the shot : good capture.. I would like to see a little more sharpness in the bud..somehow it looks a little smudged...did you crop too much ?  It has some noise on the left/bottom corner which you might like to reduce. the lighting is good. Overall 6</td>', 'To be honest, I don''t see much yellow or how yellow leads to the impact.. the part that''s supposed to be yellow looks a little green.. hmm my monitor   looks calibrated, but still i don''t see how its yellow. As for the shot : good capture.. I would like to see a little more sharpness in the bud..somehow it looks a little smudged...did you crop too much ?  It has some noise on the left/bottom corner which you might like to reduce. the lighting is good. Overall 6', '2004-12-10 10:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055908, 126815, 4226, '<td valign="top">The truth is you need to use the 640 pixels to give impact to the viewer, if you are using less than that, you are just missing some points which the photo deserves. for this photo, I am not very happy with the wood scrap .. only the mud would be better IMO</td>', 'The truth is you need to use the 640 pixels to give impact to the viewer, if you are using less than that, you are just missing some points which the photo deserves. for this photo, I am not very happy with the wood scrap .. only the mud would be better IMO', '2004-12-10 10:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055910, 126763, 4226, '<td valign="top">I am surprised only one shot of yellow pages.. I was thinking of more :D<br/></td>', 'I am surprised only one shot of yellow pages.. I was thinking of more :D', '2004-12-10 10:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055912, 125274, 4226, '<td valign="top">Looking at the shot, I think you need more DOF to keep the petals also in focus. As you background (sky ) is well all plain/simple and far away you can possibly keep the whole foreground in focus</td>', 'Looking at the shot, I think you need more DOF to keep the petals also in focus. As you background (sky ) is well all plain/simple and far away you can possibly keep the whole foreground in focus', '2004-12-10 10:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055914, 126078, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful macro. I especially like the water droplets and the composition with the circular center of the flower quartered.</td>', 'Beautiful macro. I especially like the water droplets and the composition with the circular center of the flower quartered.', '2004-12-10 10:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055916, 126723, 4226, '<td valign="top">the background is not good for a shot like this.. and as you see taking this indoors, forces you to use flash .. and looks likeyou are using on camera flash which doesn''t give required results. You might like to take it outside with some green grass and the sky and you won''t even need flash there and more clarity in the photo in general</td>', 'the background is not good for a shot like this.. and as you see taking this indoors, forces you to use flash .. and looks likeyou are using on camera flash which doesn''t give required results. You might like to take it outside with some green grass and the sky and you won''t even need flash there and more clarity in the photo in general', '2004-12-10 10:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055917, 126664, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting building. Is the building itself this yellow, or is that the color of the illumination? I don''t know if it exists, but I would have liked an angle that eliminated the sign.</td>', 'Interesting building. Is the building itself this yellow, or is that the color of the illumination? I don''t know if it exists, but I would have liked an angle that eliminated the sign.', '2004-12-10 10:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055918, 126815, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of colors - the muted background colors make the small area of yellow leaf the clear subject. I think a crop that eliminated the grayish paddle-shaped leaf on the right would have improved the picture.</td>', 'Nice contrast of colors - the muted background colors make the small area of yellow leaf the clear subject. I think a crop that eliminated the grayish paddle-shaped leaf on the right would have improved the picture.', '2004-12-10 10:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055919, 126656, 4226, '<td valign="top">lighting is good, pose is good, but well the face hasn''t come out sharp for some reason which is not good for a shot like this. the eyes should be more sharper or else the pic looks dull</td>', 'lighting is good, pose is good, but well the face hasn''t come out sharp for some reason which is not good for a shot like this. the eyes should be more sharper or else the pic looks dull', '2004-12-10 10:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055922, 126695, 4226, '<td valign="top">Now I am going to ask you what kind of backdrop you used. this is good, very black...I have tried paper with not much luck...so please let me know, i need to learn using backdrops</td>', 'Now I am going to ask you what kind of backdrop you used. this is good, very black...I have tried paper with not much luck...so please let me know, i need to learn using backdrops', '2004-12-10 10:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055923, 126868, 12733, '<td valign="top">I see the apples, but where are the bees? Fortunately, I don''t rate the title, just the shot. I really like the criss-crossing shadows and the highlights on the glass. Nice, sharp rendition and a pretty composition.</td>', 'I see the apples, but where are the bees? Fortunately, I don''t rate the title, just the shot. I really like the criss-crossing shadows and the highlights on the glass. Nice, sharp rendition and a pretty composition.', '2004-12-10 10:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055925, 126774, 23394, '<td valign="top">Composition: 2, Technical: 2, Appeal: 1, Challenge: 5, Overall Calculated Average Score: 3<br/> <br/>composition?  to me this is a purely abstract image, more of digital art than a photograph.  other than there being bright and dark areas, i don''t see anything that is composed to bring meaning to the image.  there is absolutely no context to draw from.<br/> <br/>is there any technical merit to how it was produced?  none that i can perceive.  hard to tell if anything is in focus, if the lighting is under control, of if there is any depth of field.  <br/> <br/>appeal?  absolutely none for me.  <br/> <br/>does it meet the challenge?  well, it has yellow in it.  lots of it.  does this represent a creative display of talent?  no, not to me.  do i think you could have taken this better?  maybe, but then again, i have no clue what i am looking at.<br/> <br/>so, i''ll stick by my giving you a 3.</td>', 'Composition: 2, Technical: 2, Appeal: 1, Challenge: 5, Overall Calculated Average Score: 3 composition?  to me this is a purely abstract image, more of digital art than a photograph.  other than there being bright and dark areas, i don''t see anything that is composed to bring meaning to the image.  there is absolutely no context to draw from. is there any technical merit to how it was produced?  none that i can perceive.  hard to tell if anything is in focus, if the lighting is under control, of if there is any depth of field.   appeal?  absolutely none for me.   does it meet the challenge?  well, it has yellow in it.  lots of it.  does this represent a creative display of talent?  no, not to me.  do i think you could have taken this better?  maybe, but then again, i have no clue what i am looking at. so, i''ll stick by my giving you a 3.', '2004-12-10 10:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055928, 126377, 12733, '<td valign="top">The bridge, along with that sinuous red line, creates a perfect frame for the lower right-hand corner. Too bad what''s in that frame is an amorphous black object (shadow?). Still, a very nice composition and an unusual view of bridge construction.</td>', 'The bridge, along with that sinuous red line, creates a perfect frame for the lower right-hand corner. Too bad what''s in that frame is an amorphous black object (shadow?). Still, a very nice composition and an unusual view of bridge construction.', '2004-12-10 10:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055932, 125593, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice compostion, pretty yellow candles. I''m turned off by the out-of-focus object on the left and the fact that what''s in the glass looks like milk. Yellow-tinted milk doesn''t work; lemonade might have been better.</td>', 'Nice compostion, pretty yellow candles. I''m turned off by the out-of-focus object on the left and the fact that what''s in the glass looks like milk. Yellow-tinted milk doesn''t work; lemonade might have been better.', '2004-12-10 11:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055934, 126471, 12733, '<td valign="top">A very interesting concept, very well executed. I like the rendition of metallic reflections and the composition within the spoon. I think the background is too close to the color of the walls in the picture inside the spoon as it seems to make the image bleed out into the background.</td>', 'A very interesting concept, very well executed. I like the rendition of metallic reflections and the composition within the spoon. I think the background is too close to the color of the walls in the picture inside the spoon as it seems to make the image bleed out into the background.', '2004-12-10 11:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055940, 126865, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the unusual angle that turns the balloon into a semi-abstract. And you got a great sky for this picture.</td>', 'I like the unusual angle that turns the balloon into a semi-abstract. And you got a great sky for this picture.', '2004-12-10 11:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055941, 126743, 12733, '<td valign="top">Yellow eye shadow - that''s kind of scary. An interesting idea and composition, though, and very sharp rendition.</td>', 'Yellow eye shadow - that''s kind of scary. An interesting idea and composition, though, and very sharp rendition.', '2004-12-10 11:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055943, 126732, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the variation in shades as you go down the candle. What is it? Or is this an "un-candle" with a flammable oil rather than wax as the fuel? Very sharp picture either way.</td>', 'I like the variation in shades as you go down the candle. What is it? Or is this an "un-candle" with a flammable oil rather than wax as the fuel? Very sharp picture either way.', '2004-12-10 11:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055947, 125879, 12733, '<td valign="top">You have a very attractive model and a great pose and compostion. The need to meet a "yellow" challenge gives her skin an odd, disconcerting yellow tint that detracts from its quality as a portrait.</td>', 'You have a very attractive model and a great pose and compostion. The need to meet a "yellow" challenge gives her skin an odd, disconcerting yellow tint that detracts from its quality as a portrait.', '2004-12-10 11:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055951, 126158, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice compostion. I like the way you got just enough of the other letters to indicate what the sign says, but not so much that it competes with the O. Brilliant colors - was the sign linternally lighted?</td>', 'Nice compostion. I like the way you got just enough of the other letters to indicate what the sign says, but not so much that it competes with the O. Brilliant colors - was the sign linternally lighted?', '2004-12-10 11:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055960, 126061, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great composition and use of yellow, but I would have liked to see the cyclist sharp, rather than the people in the background. Possibly a faster shutter, a smaller f/stop or both would have gotten them all in focus, but if I had to compromise I''d choos the cyclist. Often when there''s not enough light, I let the picture underexpose and then repair it in Photoshop using the levels or curves controls. You can get two (or sometimes even three) stops that way.</td>', 'Great composition and use of yellow, but I would have liked to see the cyclist sharp, rather than the people in the background. Possibly a faster shutter, a smaller f/stop or both would have gotten them all in focus, but if I had to compromise I''d choos the cyclist. Often when there''s not enough light, I let the picture underexpose and then repair it in Photoshop using the levels or curves controls. You can get two (or sometimes even three) stops that way.', '2004-12-10 11:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055964, 126610, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very effective shot - well composed, well shot and unusual content.</td>', 'Very effective shot - well composed, well shot and unusual content.', '2004-12-10 11:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055967, 126813, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very interesting lighting, and a good compromise in exposure between bringing out the light and showing too much of the background. Did you use a starburst filter to get those rays of light around the lamps?</td>', 'Very interesting lighting, and a good compromise in exposure between bringing out the light and showing too much of the background. Did you use a starburst filter to get those rays of light around the lamps?', '2004-12-10 11:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055970, 126722, 29739, '<td valign="top">Too much shadows to me, maybe another light from the right? I''d like seing that fingertip Original yellow pic</td>', 'Too much shadows to me, maybe another light from the right? I''d like seing that fingertip Original yellow pic', '2004-12-10 11:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055974, 126581, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very cute! Your dog would qualify to play Toto in a production of the Wizard of Oz, and the shot is nicely composed and very sharp. Where is this road? It can''t be purely a photoshop creation with basic editing rules. Or if it can, I''d sure like to learn how to do it.</td>', 'Very cute! Your dog would qualify to play Toto in a production of the Wizard of Oz, and the shot is nicely composed and very sharp. Where is this road? It can''t be purely a photoshop creation with basic editing rules. Or if it can, I''d sure like to learn how to do it.', '2004-12-10 11:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055976, 126886, 25742, '<td valign="top">well this fits the chalenge description right on:<br/>Details: Photograph your interpretation of the color yellow. The color yellow must lead to the impact of the photo <br/>the only nag I have is that for such a dynamic subject the photo seems to be very static. motion blur on the hammer/nail might be worth looking into</td>', 'well this fits the chalenge description right on:Details: Photograph your interpretation of the color yellow. The color yellow must lead to the impact of the photo the only nag I have is that for such a dynamic subject the photo seems to be very static. motion blur on the hammer/nail might be worth looking into', '2004-12-10 11:25:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1055980, 126694, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great selective DOF and a great expression. Was this a setup, or was this guy really wearing a yellow towel on his head? If so, why?</td>', 'Great selective DOF and a great expression. Was this a setup, or was this guy really wearing a yellow towel on his head? If so, why?', '2004-12-10 11:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055981, 126692, 29739, '<td valign="top">I''d like it lighter, is it that a banana and a...?</td>', 'I''d like it lighter, is it that a banana and a...?', '2004-12-10 11:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055983, 126804, 29739, '<td valign="top">Merry Christmas! warm light</td>', 'Merry Christmas! warm light', '2004-12-10 11:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055984, 125796, 12733, '<td valign="top">The challenge calls for yellow, and lemons are naturally yellow, so why is so much of this picture PINK????</td>', 'The challenge calls for yellow, and lemons are naturally yellow, so why is so much of this picture PINK????', '2004-12-10 11:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055985, 126284, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the selective DOF, the sharpness of the eye and the clear rendition, which doesn''t suffer from distorition from the water.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the selective DOF, the sharpness of the eye and the clear rendition, which doesn''t suffer from distorition from the water.', '2004-12-10 11:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055988, 125851, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract - is it the petal of a flower? I think some element to break up the lines would be an improvement.</td>', 'Interesting abstract - is it the petal of a flower? I think some element to break up the lines would be an improvement.', '2004-12-10 11:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055990, 126785, 12733, '<td valign="top">I guess Sponge Bob was too obviouls an example of yellow not to have him show up in this challenge. Good use of the overhyped character - I think a lot of people would like to see him do this.</td>', 'I guess Sponge Bob was too obviouls an example of yellow not to have him show up in this challenge. Good use of the overhyped character - I think a lot of people would like to see him do this.', '2004-12-10 11:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055993, 125548, 12733, '<td valign="top">A cute dog with amazing blue eyes. But the yellow is background, not the main picture element, and the blurry hand is a loser. If there''s a color subject here, it''s blue.</td>', 'A cute dog with amazing blue eyes. But the yellow is background, not the main picture element, and the blurry hand is a loser. If there''s a color subject here, it''s blue.', '2004-12-10 11:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056000, 126062, 12733, '<td valign="top">Cute concept, nice rendition of the glass. But the lemon slice looks as though it was rather badly cut into the background. I assume it''s rim lighting, not a rules violation, but it does look slightly off in what is otherwise a great shot.</td>', 'Cute concept, nice rendition of the glass. But the lemon slice looks as though it was rather badly cut into the background. I assume it''s rim lighting, not a rules violation, but it does look slightly off in what is otherwise a great shot.', '2004-12-10 11:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056002, 126706, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I really like the way the circles bleed out to the edge and the metallic reflections in the knife.</td>', 'Nice composition. I really like the way the circles bleed out to the edge and the metallic reflections in the knife.', '2004-12-10 11:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056004, 126883, 12733, '<td valign="top">Pretty rendition of texture and shape.</td>', 'Pretty rendition of texture and shape.', '2004-12-10 11:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056010, 126628, 29739, '<td valign="top">Yellow makes me happy too  : )</td>', 'Yellow makes me happy too  : )', '2004-12-10 11:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056011, 126458, 17505, '<td valign="top">Excellent saturation and composition. Beautiful.</td>', 'Excellent saturation and composition. Beautiful.', '2004-12-10 11:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056013, 126707, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice patttern shot. Placing the center of the cross off-center in the photo, and placing the pencils at an angle makes the composition more dyanamic.</td>', 'Nice patttern shot. Placing the center of the cross off-center in the photo, and placing the pencils at an angle makes the composition more dyanamic.', '2004-12-10 11:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056020, 126703, 12733, '<td valign="top">Cute pun, sharp photo. Well planned and executed.</td>', 'Cute pun, sharp photo. Well planned and executed.', '2004-12-10 11:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056026, 126771, 17505, '<td valign="top">Interesting lines and I love the brilliant color on th eflower. Perhaps a little over sharpened, the snow almost doesn''t look real. 9.</td>', 'Interesting lines and I love the brilliant color on th eflower. Perhaps a little over sharpened, the snow almost doesn''t look real. 9.', '2004-12-10 11:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056029, 126832, 12733, '<td valign="top">Less is more. By backing off and including more than just the caboose in the shot, you''ve given it context and icaptured the feeling of a neighborhood. And it sure is yellow.</td>', 'Less is more. By backing off and including more than just the caboose in the shot, you''ve given it context and icaptured the feeling of a neighborhood. And it sure is yellow.', '2004-12-10 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056037, 126447, 29739, '<td valign="top">Where is the yellow? Ilike the shot though</td>', 'Where is the yellow? Ilike the shot though', '2004-12-10 11:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056041, 126183, 12733, '<td valign="top">Another version of this concept is also in the challenge. This is a nicely composed take on the cliche. I like the lemons in the background at the bottom left, but what''s that purplish thing in the top right?</td>', 'Another version of this concept is also in the challenge. This is a nicely composed take on the cliche. I like the lemons in the background at the bottom left, but what''s that purplish thing in the top right?', '2004-12-10 11:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056042, 125274, 17505, '<td valign="top">DoF should be e little wider, but an excellent capture just the same.</td>', 'DoF should be e little wider, but an excellent capture just the same.', '2004-12-10 11:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056045, 125274, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the composition and the colors (yellow and others). Great capture - was the caterpillar moving or did it stop and pose for you?</td>', 'Very nice. I like the composition and the colors (yellow and others). Great capture - was the caterpillar moving or did it stop and pose for you?', '2004-12-10 11:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056051, 125820, 29739, '<td valign="top">Oops! Let the lemon alone. ; )</td>', 'Oops! Let the lemon alone. ; )', '2004-12-10 11:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056056, 125740, 29739, '<td valign="top">Oh! an invisible car! I want it</td>', 'Oh! an invisible car! I want it', '2004-12-10 11:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056060, 125691, 12733, '<td valign="top">If you call a dog''s tail a leg how many legs does the dog have??? Nice concept, nice shot. The way the bottle blends into the background makes the lettering stand out brilliantly. By the way, the dog still has just four legs  - calling a ltail a leg doesn''t make it one.</td>', 'If you call a dog''s tail a leg how many legs does the dog have??? Nice concept, nice shot. The way the bottle blends into the background makes the lettering stand out brilliantly. By the way, the dog still has just four legs  - calling a ltail a leg doesn''t make it one.', '2004-12-10 12:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056061, 125528, 12733, '<td valign="top">A mystery? Nah, just turn the picture upside down. Very clever, but a bit obvious. Nice sharp rendition of the ropes; the background seems kind of noisy.</td>', 'A mystery? Nah, just turn the picture upside down. Very clever, but a bit obvious. Nice sharp rendition of the ropes; the background seems kind of noisy.', '2004-12-10 12:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056064, 125687, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice rendition of the texture of paper and print. Cute pun in the title.</td>', 'Nice rendition of the texture of paper and print. Cute pun in the title.', '2004-12-10 12:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056065, 126683, 12733, '<td valign="top">As might be expected, there were a bunch of takes on McDonald;s. This is not a bad shot, but it lacks the creative use of the golden arch that so many others used. It may seem unfair, but when you choose an obvious subject you get compared to all the others who chose the same subject.</td>', 'As might be expected, there were a bunch of takes on McDonald;s. This is not a bad shot, but it lacks the creative use of the golden arch that so many others used. It may seem unfair, but when you choose an obvious subject you get compared to all the others who chose the same subject.', '2004-12-10 12:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056067, 126387, 472, '<td valign="top">niiice. what''s the setup?</td>', 'niiice. what''s the setup?', '2004-12-10 12:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056071, 126168, 12733, '<td valign="top">It never really registered with me that the golden arches created an M. Nice closeup of the arch - it''s an original take on what is something of a cliche in this challenge.</td>', 'It never really registered with me that the golden arches created an M. Nice closeup of the arch - it''s an original take on what is something of a cliche in this challenge.', '2004-12-10 12:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056072, 126604, 12733, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors, nice composition. I like the black background in contrast to the light.</td>', 'Pretty colors, nice composition. I like the black background in contrast to the light.', '2004-12-10 12:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056077, 126458, 12733, '<td valign="top">The yellow sure stands out against the blue is it sky or a studio paper? The inclusion of part of the center of the flower adds a lot to the composition.</td>', 'The yellow sure stands out against the blue is it sky or a studio paper? The inclusion of part of the center of the flower adds a lot to the composition.', '2004-12-10 12:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056081, 126397, 29739, '<td valign="top">Charlie Brown revisited</td>', 'Charlie Brown revisited', '2004-12-10 12:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056082, 125655, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very cute.</td>', 'Very cute.', '2004-12-10 12:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056085, 126343, 12733, '<td valign="top">The kernels have a nice glow against the black background. Nice use of negative space.</td>', 'The kernels have a nice glow against the black background. Nice use of negative space.', '2004-12-10 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056087, 126190, 12733, '<td valign="top">The yellow leaf really stands out against this background. Pretty shot.</td>', 'The yellow leaf really stands out against this background. Pretty shot.', '2004-12-10 12:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056089, 126649, 12733, '<td valign="top">You''ve produced a great air of mystery.</td>', 'You''ve produced a great air of mystery.', '2004-12-10 12:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056092, 126373, 30507, '<td valign="top">Nice Work President  ;) I''ll give an 8</td>', 'Nice Work President  ;) I''ll give an 8', '2004-12-10 12:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056093, 125953, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the bug and very nicely composed. Very sharp, clean rendition.</td>', 'Nice capture of the bug and very nicely composed. Very sharp, clean rendition.', '2004-12-10 12:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056094, 126341, 23294, '<td valign="top">Congrats, you are the winner.  At least I think you should be! 10, just beautiful.</td>', 'Congrats, you are the winner.  At least I think you should be! 10, just beautiful.', '2004-12-10 12:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056095, 126886, 23962, '<td valign="top">Finally something interesting. Great balance in this shot. Perfect titile to describe to subject and the picture itself.</td>', 'Finally something interesting. Great balance in this shot. Perfect titile to describe to subject and the picture itself.', '2004-12-10 12:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056099, 126696, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a great effect. The lines and shape really draw you into the picture and the range of yellow colors spans the limits of what we call "yellow."</td>', 'This is a great effect. The lines and shape really draw you into the picture and the range of yellow colors spans the limits of what we call "yellow."', '2004-12-10 12:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056100, 126580, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and sense of distance.</td>', 'Nice perspective and sense of distance.', '2004-12-10 12:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056102, 126788, 23294, '<td valign="top">Wow, how did you ever achieve this effect?!  Very cool. 7.</td>', 'Wow, how did you ever achieve this effect?!  Very cool. 7.', '2004-12-10 12:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056104, 126652, 12733, '<td valign="top">Brilliant capture, and I like the slightly out of focus background. Very sharp rendition.</td>', 'Brilliant capture, and I like the slightly out of focus background. Very sharp rendition.', '2004-12-10 12:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056106, 126718, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting question. I like the rendition of dtail, though the cloth seems sharper than the squashes. Interesting composition.</td>', 'Interesting question. I like the rendition of dtail, though the cloth seems sharper than the squashes. Interesting composition.', '2004-12-10 12:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056111, 126875, 21202, '<td valign="top">Excellent point of view, framing 10<br/>Clean Image, Limited dynamic range 9<br/>Like colors and form, but not of high interest 8<br/>Overall a 9</td>', 'Excellent point of view, framing 10Clean Image, Limited dynamic range 9Like colors and form, but not of high interest 8Overall a 9', '2004-12-10 12:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056125, 126031, 21202, '<td valign="top">Hi,  this looked a little flat to me, so I copied it into photoshop and used Focus Magic to reduce the out of focus blur by 50% at 2 pixels.  You can try this for free by downloading Focus Magic.  Not only was the image nicely sharpened, but it also developed some depth.<br/>Nice idea for yellow, especially this late in the fall.  An 8.</td>', 'Hi,  this looked a little flat to me, so I copied it into photoshop and used Focus Magic to reduce the out of focus blur by 50% at 2 pixels.  You can try this for free by downloading Focus Magic.  Not only was the image nicely sharpened, but it also developed some depth.Nice idea for yellow, especially this late in the fall.  An 8.', '2004-12-10 12:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056137, 126197, 12733, '<td valign="top">Not much yellow in relation to the area of the photo, but it stands out enough to make the yellow eye and band the focal point. Well done.</td>', 'Not much yellow in relation to the area of the photo, but it stands out enough to make the yellow eye and band the focal point. Well done.', '2004-12-10 12:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056151, 125870, 21473, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been a better picture without the girl.</td>', 'I think it would have been a better picture without the girl.', '2004-12-10 13:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056153, 125796, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  This is the best rendition of a lemon slice I have come across so far in this contest.  I liked the back lit ones the most so far, but you chose  a good healthy specimen, sliced it cleanly, lit it well, placed it on a nicely contrasting background and it looks good enough to eat.  The red could be desaturated a little to get rid of blackened corners and Focus Magic at 100% at 1 pixel can sharpen the out of focus blur on the rind.  A 10.</td>', 'Very nice.  This is the best rendition of a lemon slice I have come across so far in this contest.  I liked the back lit ones the most so far, but you chose  a good healthy specimen, sliced it cleanly, lit it well, placed it on a nicely contrasting background and it looks good enough to eat.  The red could be desaturated a little to get rid of blackened corners and Focus Magic at 100% at 1 pixel can sharpen the out of focus blur on the rind.  A 10.', '2004-12-10 13:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056155, 125274, 21473, '<td valign="top">That is an absolute beautiful shot!</td>', 'That is an absolute beautiful shot!', '2004-12-10 13:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056157, 126777, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice control of exposure.  The bulb though appears flat. Maybe adding some writing on the surface of the bulb would help with depth.  A 9.</td>', 'Nice control of exposure.  The bulb though appears flat. Maybe adding some writing on the surface of the bulb would help with depth.  A 9.', '2004-12-10 13:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056159, 125859, 30153, '<td valign="top">This picture is gross. Who would want to look at bugs?!!?<br/></td>', 'This picture is gross. Who would want to look at bugs?!!?', '2004-12-10 13:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056160, 126722, 21202, '<td valign="top">This would be vastly improved by another light source on the left front.  The parts that are  lit are well lit and nicely exposed.  A 7.</td>', 'This would be vastly improved by another light source on the left front.  The parts that are  lit are well lit and nicely exposed.  A 7.', '2004-12-10 13:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056161, 126725, 30153, '<td valign="top">What''s with this??</td>', 'What''s with this??', '2004-12-10 13:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056162, 126790, 30153, '<td valign="top">This picture looks cool.</td>', 'This picture looks cool.', '2004-12-10 13:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056163, 125301, 30153, '<td valign="top">Why is it called yelly belly?</td>', 'Why is it called yelly belly?', '2004-12-10 13:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056164, 126852, 24715, '<td valign="top">Looks like an excellent shot, but it''s too hard to judge because of the small size.</td>', 'Looks like an excellent shot, but it''s too hard to judge because of the small size.', '2004-12-10 13:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056166, 126865, 24715, '<td valign="top">Very good unusual angle. Excellent colors and focus.</td>', 'Very good unusual angle. Excellent colors and focus.', '2004-12-10 13:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056167, 126806, 24715, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. The photo looks almost like a pencil drawing. Very nice!</td>', 'Interesting composition. The photo looks almost like a pencil drawing. Very nice!', '2004-12-10 13:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056168, 126796, 17505, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Great angle and pose.</td>', 'Beautiful. Great angle and pose.', '2004-12-10 13:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056173, 125683, 24715, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo! The colors are rich and really compliment each other. The make up is superb, closed eyes make it look even better without making a distraction! Hope to see it as a winner! Good luck!</td>', 'Excellent photo! The colors are rich and really compliment each other. The make up is superb, closed eyes make it look even better without making a distraction! Hope to see it as a winner! Good luck!', '2004-12-10 13:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056175, 126581, 21202, '<td valign="top">This is excellent.  The shoes, socks, Toto, road, and "grass."  Reflecting light from the back  of the models might have helped with the shadows on the road.  A 10.</td>', 'This is excellent.  The shoes, socks, Toto, road, and "grass."  Reflecting light from the back  of the models might have helped with the shadows on the road.  A 10.', '2004-12-10 13:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056177, 126629, 6532, '<td valign="top">Difficult to interpret this.....size is also a problem...too small!</td>', 'Difficult to interpret this.....size is also a problem...too small!', '2004-12-10 13:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056178, 126373, 30153, '<td valign="top">I like this picture. Good job!!<br/></td>', 'I like this picture. Good job!!', '2004-12-10 13:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056179, 126601, 24715, '<td valign="top">Must be nice to have a place to do something like that! Interesting shot since it''s not just 1 drop, but the whole bucket. However, I''d like to see a better focus, and maybe the background could be improved. You''re on the right track though!</td>', 'Must be nice to have a place to do something like that! Interesting shot since it''s not just 1 drop, but the whole bucket. However, I''d like to see a better focus, and maybe the background could be improved. You''re on the right track though!', '2004-12-10 13:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056180, 126357, 23561, '<td valign="top">Oh, I love this. Too cold for roses where I am. I like the lighting and the composition is excellent.</td>', 'Oh, I love this. Too cold for roses where I am. I like the lighting and the composition is excellent.', '2004-12-10 13:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056183, 126267, 24715, '<td valign="top">Great colors! Good to see a different approach of flowers. Well done.</td>', 'Great colors! Good to see a different approach of flowers. Well done.', '2004-12-10 13:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056184, 125657, 23561, '<td valign="top">Kind of dark overall but I like it. The lighting is what makes this shot great.</td>', 'Kind of dark overall but I like it. The lighting is what makes this shot great.', '2004-12-10 13:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056187, 126581, 24715, '<td valign="top">Very cool! Classic photo!</td>', 'Very cool! Classic photo!', '2004-12-10 13:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
