(1056438, 126613, 20779, '<td valign="top">This image just simply appeals to me. I love yellow, and the amount of content and "busy-ness" is just right in my opinion. The composition is well done, and the red accent perfectly placed. There is almost a soft yellow "glow" throughout the image that I think really works.</td>', 'This image just simply appeals to me. I love yellow, and the amount of content and "busy-ness" is just right in my opinion. The composition is well done, and the red accent perfectly placed. There is almost a soft yellow "glow" throughout the image that I think really works.', '2004-12-10 17:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
