(1056551, 125878, 23458, '<td valign="top">I know you were trying something different here.... but the impact of this photo was not created by the colour yellow - the impact is created by the red. <br/> <br/>As for the technical merits of the photo - I like the DOF here, but there are a bunch of distracting splotches on the background that you should look to remove before shooting.</td>', 'I know you were trying something different here.... but the impact of this photo was not created by the colour yellow - the impact is created by the red.  As for the technical merits of the photo - I like the DOF here, but there are a bunch of distracting splotches on the background that you should look to remove before shooting.', '2004-12-10 19:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056553, 125649, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea, and not a bad shot - maybe a slower shutter in future - I would have preferred more motion blur on the train. 5.</td>', 'This is a nice idea, and not a bad shot - maybe a slower shutter in future - I would have preferred more motion blur on the train. 5.', '2004-12-10 19:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056555, 125683, 27842, '<td valign="top">Very creative, visually interesting capture.  I think a color shift more toward yellow (away from orange/red)  would have put thus over the top.  Definitely the most artistic shot that I have seen in this challenge.  Excellent work! 10 (initially 9, but after voting on everything else, this the best and my only 10)</td>', 'Very creative, visually interesting capture.  I think a color shift more toward yellow (away from orange/red)  would have put thus over the top.  Definitely the most artistic shot that I have seen in this challenge.  Excellent work! 10 (initially 9, but after voting on everything else, this the best and my only 10)', '2004-12-10 19:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056560, 126165, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well at least the lemon isn''t the focal point of this shot :). I''m sorry but besides that I can find little about this that interests me, it just looks like a snapshot of dessert. It is yellow though !</td>', 'Well at least the lemon isn''t the focal point of this shot :). I''m sorry but besides that I can find little about this that interests me, it just looks like a snapshot of dessert. It is yellow though !', '2004-12-10 19:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056562, 126165, 20779, '<td valign="top">Perfect focus and DOF; the only problem for me is that it lacks any real interest for me, or seems more like a snapshot. Just an opinion. I think it would have been more effective for my tastes with less in the frame; perhaps just the slice of pie completely the focus of interest. Hope  this is helpful.</td>', 'Perfect focus and DOF; the only problem for me is that it lacks any real interest for me, or seems more like a snapshot. Just an opinion. I think it would have been more effective for my tastes with less in the frame; perhaps just the slice of pie completely the focus of interest. Hope  this is helpful.', '2004-12-10 19:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056566, 126695, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice stopped action and super colors against the black background.  The light glare on the front of the glass is a bit distracting - but not enough to keep you from being way high in the pack.  Great job.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-12-16 20:45:23.</i></td>', 'Nice stopped action and super colors against the black background.  The light glare on the front of the glass is a bit distracting - but not enough to keep you from being way high in the pack.  Great job.', '2004-12-10 19:53:42.000000', '2004-12-16 20:45:23.000000', 1),
(1056569, 126795, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very striking image with cool colors. I think it is being hurt by a somewhat lower image quality overall, and it appears to me to be a tad bit over "processed", but just my opinion.</td>', 'Very striking image with cool colors. I think it is being hurt by a somewhat lower image quality overall, and it appears to me to be a tad bit over "processed", but just my opinion.', '2004-12-10 19:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056571, 125900, 19608, '<td valign="top">Superb placement/composition.  Nice soft lighting really worked well for you - holding the colors very nicely.  Shoud finish way on up there.</td>', 'Superb placement/composition.  Nice soft lighting really worked well for you - holding the colors very nicely.  Shoud finish way on up there.', '2004-12-10 19:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056573, 126614, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wondeful macro - well composed.  The yellow - although a bit subtle - really does look like radiating light.  I expect this to be a top ten...</td>', 'Wondeful macro - well composed.  The yellow - although a bit subtle - really does look like radiating light.  I expect this to be a top ten...', '2004-12-10 19:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056575, 126020, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool macro. Fantastic dof. You have enough of the ant and flower in focus to give meaning to the shot, but the selective focus in combination with the vivd colours gives this a whimsical effect. Almost tells a story. Terrific work. 10.</td>', 'This is a very cool macro. Fantastic dof. You have enough of the ant and flower in focus to give meaning to the shot, but the selective focus in combination with the vivd colours gives this a whimsical effect. Almost tells a story. Terrific work. 10.', '2004-12-10 19:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056576, 125583, 19608, '<td valign="top">Your colors work so well together - it becomes a classic.  The movement of the handle of the left umbrella adds a bit of mystery that some will object to.  Keep up the great work.</td>', 'Your colors work so well together - it becomes a classic.  The movement of the handle of the left umbrella adds a bit of mystery that some will object to.  Keep up the great work.', '2004-12-10 19:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056580, 126696, 19608, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what this is but it matters not.  A great choice for yellow - perfectly composed and exposed.</td>', 'Don''t know what this is but it matters not.  A great choice for yellow - perfectly composed and exposed.', '2004-12-10 20:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056581, 126148, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well you got close.... unfortunately there isn''t much else about this that appeals to me - there is a little too much mess on the corn for this to work I think. But good display of technical skill to get this close and in focus.</td>', 'Well you got close.... unfortunately there isn''t much else about this that appeals to me - there is a little too much mess on the corn for this to work I think. But good display of technical skill to get this close and in focus.', '2004-12-10 20:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056585, 126447, 22479, '<td valign="top">Revisiting...<br/> <br/>First the good. Focused, well exposed. The lighting is tastefully executed. Really highlights what you wanted to convey to the viewer. I think overall the composition is good and the perspective works well. <br/> <br/>Now for the bad. Border does not complement the focus of this image, the legs. It rather draws attention to the shoes. Not good in this particular challenge.<br/> <br/>And the ugly. It''s a stretch to call those legs yellow. This doesn''t really conjure up the image of yellow when I view it. This does not fit very well with the spirit of the challenge. You might as well have desaturated this image (or at least selectively to preserve the shoes), and toned it yellow. Of course, even then, it wouldn''t really fit the theme as it would appear to have been done for the sole purpose of meeting the yellow requirement. Point is, I think this stunning image is better served in a different challenge. Sorry.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Revisiting... First the good. Focused, well exposed. The lighting is tastefully executed. Really highlights what you wanted to convey to the viewer. I think overall the composition is good and the perspective works well.  Now for the bad. Border does not complement the focus of this image, the legs. It rather draws attention to the shoes. Not good in this particular challenge. And the ugly. It''s a stretch to call those legs yellow. This doesn''t really conjure up the image of yellow when I view it. This does not fit very well with the spirit of the challenge. You might as well have desaturated this image (or at least selectively to preserve the shoes), and toned it yellow. Of course, even then, it wouldn''t really fit the theme as it would appear to have been done for the sole purpose of meeting the yellow requirement. Point is, I think this stunning image is better served in a different challenge. Sorry. ', '2004-12-10 20:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056586, 126742, 19608, '<td valign="top">Utterly awesome!  Superb choice for yellow - it works so well against the grayish rocks.</td>', 'Utterly awesome!  Superb choice for yellow - it works so well against the grayish rocks.', '2004-12-10 20:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056588, 126581, 20779, '<td valign="top">This one really made me smile! Great job.</td>', 'This one really made me smile! Great job.', '2004-12-10 20:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056590, 126370, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very engaging effect created. Just a little bit out of focus, but I still love this one.</td>', 'Very engaging effect created. Just a little bit out of focus, but I still love this one.', '2004-12-10 20:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056591, 126788, 19608, '<td valign="top">What an exciting bit of work!  Nice colors well composed.  The mystery of this makes it really stand out.</td>', 'What an exciting bit of work!  Nice colors well composed.  The mystery of this makes it really stand out.', '2004-12-10 20:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056593, 126656, 22479, '<td valign="top">Revisiting for a few comments.<br/> <br/>Photograph was artistically and very tastefully composed. Technical aspects are quite good. The soft focus works well. Lighting and exposure similarly good.<br/> <br/>Model is very attractive and she appears quite comfortable posing. I feel like the yellow top is more of a distraction than the focus in this shot, for surely this image, as the title even alludes to, is about Veronica. I don''t think it fits the spirit of this challenge. Sorry.</td>', 'Revisiting for a few comments. Photograph was artistically and very tastefully composed. Technical aspects are quite good. The soft focus works well. Lighting and exposure similarly good. Model is very attractive and she appears quite comfortable posing. I feel like the yellow top is more of a distraction than the focus in this shot, for surely this image, as the title even alludes to, is about Veronica. I don''t think it fits the spirit of this challenge. Sorry.', '2004-12-10 20:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056594, 126654, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very clean and bold. Perfect detail. My only suggestion, but obviously a personal opinion, is that the crop is just a bit too tight.</td>', 'Very clean and bold. Perfect detail. My only suggestion, but obviously a personal opinion, is that the crop is just a bit too tight.', '2004-12-10 20:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056600, 126690, 22479, '<td valign="top">Revisiting this entry.<br/> <br/>Tattoo is very nice. Lighting appears to be natural, available light. The angle at which you chose to photograph your model created rather strong back/side lighting and the back of the model is quite in the shadows, while the right shoulder is strongly illuminated. Not an ideal situation for what you are trying to convey to your viewers. The yellow towel, I suppose is for some connection to the challenge theme. I feel it is a stretch to call this within the spirit of the challenge theme. Sorry.</td>', 'Revisiting this entry. Tattoo is very nice. Lighting appears to be natural, available light. The angle at which you chose to photograph your model created rather strong back/side lighting and the back of the model is quite in the shadows, while the right shoulder is strongly illuminated. Not an ideal situation for what you are trying to convey to your viewers. The yellow towel, I suppose is for some connection to the challenge theme. I feel it is a stretch to call this within the spirit of the challenge theme. Sorry.', '2004-12-10 20:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056602, 126788, 29477, '<td valign="top">Great shot and effect...I can''t wait to see how you accomplished this.</td>', 'Great shot and effect...I can''t wait to see how you accomplished this.', '2004-12-10 20:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056603, 125341, 29477, '<td valign="top">It seems like there is so much going on it''s confusing.  I think it is the texture of the vase, too distracting.  I do like the lighting and composition with the shadow, but the vase makes it seem a little busy.</td>', 'It seems like there is so much going on it''s confusing.  I think it is the texture of the vase, too distracting.  I do like the lighting and composition with the shadow, but the vase makes it seem a little busy.', '2004-12-10 20:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056605, 126379, 20779, '<td valign="top">On my monitor, I don''t really get any yellow in this, but I think we have to give the benefit of the doubt on this. The important thing for me is that there isn''t any real focal point to draw the eye or a composition within the frame.  The tonal range and lighting appear somewhat flat, leaving it looking like more of a snapshot. I hope that this is useful or helpful information.</td>', 'On my monitor, I don''t really get any yellow in this, but I think we have to give the benefit of the doubt on this. The important thing for me is that there isn''t any real focal point to draw the eye or a composition within the frame.  The tonal range and lighting appear somewhat flat, leaving it looking like more of a snapshot. I hope that this is useful or helpful information.', '2004-12-10 20:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056622, 125818, 15811, '<td valign="top">gotta give you credit, this is a brave entry.  That being said, it does not necessarily appeal to me as being a great photograph or showing great photographic skill -- it shows more of an ''artsy'' representation of the color yellow in a sort of abstract manner -- and this whole website is about digital photography, not artsy images...very brave though.</td>', 'gotta give you credit, this is a brave entry.  That being said, it does not necessarily appeal to me as being a great photograph or showing great photographic skill -- it shows more of an ''artsy'' representation of the color yellow in a sort of abstract manner -- and this whole website is about digital photography, not artsy images...very brave though.', '2004-12-10 20:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056624, 126357, 15811, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot -- the focus seems a bit soft and leaves what I can see as very little actually in focus.  My eyes wander the image quite a bit -- for what it is, however, very nicely done.</td>', 'This is a great shot -- the focus seems a bit soft and leaves what I can see as very little actually in focus.  My eyes wander the image quite a bit -- for what it is, however, very nicely done.', '2004-12-10 20:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056628, 125345, 15811, '<td valign="top">hrmm...my first thoughts, interesting.  My eyes are definately drawn to the yellow lemon and seem to ease into the photo and notice the less-subtle things upon careful examination.  Great composition, good saturation and good lighting as well.  good job</td>', 'hrmm...my first thoughts, interesting.  My eyes are definately drawn to the yellow lemon and seem to ease into the photo and notice the less-subtle things upon careful examination.  Great composition, good saturation and good lighting as well.  good job', '2004-12-10 20:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056630, 126630, 15811, '<td valign="top">hrmm I like the though -- interesting idea although I''m not 100% sure I know exactly what I''m looking at (is the lemon in the water or out of it).  This is a really great idea and obviously relates to the challenge well.  That being said, the white is REALLY white almost blown out and pretty much hurts my eyes lol.</td>', 'hrmm I like the though -- interesting idea although I''m not 100% sure I know exactly what I''m looking at (is the lemon in the water or out of it).  This is a really great idea and obviously relates to the challenge well.  That being said, the white is REALLY white almost blown out and pretty much hurts my eyes lol.', '2004-12-10 20:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056631, 126788, 15811, '<td valign="top">wow interesting.  Not sure how you got the candle to do that.  My eyes seem to wander around not necessarily focusing on the yellow, maybe I''m just slow and I can''t really pick out what the heck is going on...Interesting subject choice, composition is fairly good, and it meets the challenge.</td>', 'wow interesting.  Not sure how you got the candle to do that.  My eyes seem to wander around not necessarily focusing on the yellow, maybe I''m just slow and I can''t really pick out what the heck is going on...Interesting subject choice, composition is fairly good, and it meets the challenge.', '2004-12-10 20:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056632, 126471, 29799, '<td valign="top">This is really creative and a great use of yellow. A+</td>', 'This is really creative and a great use of yellow. A+', '2004-12-10 20:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056633, 125642, 15811, '<td valign="top">Looks like a great shot for a manu or something in a restaurant.  The lighting seems good and gives the image a unique feel.  While it''s not quite yellow, I suppose it is well enough to meet the challenge in my eyes.<br/> <br/>There doesn''t seem to be a unique or center subject for my eyes to come to rest at and seem to continually jump around the image.  Good work.</td>', 'Looks like a great shot for a manu or something in a restaurant.  The lighting seems good and gives the image a unique feel.  While it''s not quite yellow, I suppose it is well enough to meet the challenge in my eyes. There doesn''t seem to be a unique or center subject for my eyes to come to rest at and seem to continually jump around the image.  Good work.', '2004-12-10 20:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056634, 126599, 15811, '<td valign="top">This looks great, and the water droplets make it just that much better.  The flower looks to almost be dripping on my computer screen.  It seems a bit dark though to me for some reason.  The photo definately meets the challenge well, not too sure the border is necessary, but it doesn''t take anything away from this great shot.  good work!</td>', 'This looks great, and the water droplets make it just that much better.  The flower looks to almost be dripping on my computer screen.  It seems a bit dark though to me for some reason.  The photo definately meets the challenge well, not too sure the border is necessary, but it doesn''t take anything away from this great shot.  good work!', '2004-12-10 20:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056635, 126628, 29799, '<td valign="top">This picture is really creative and a great use of color, shape and texture! Great shot!</td>', 'This picture is really creative and a great use of color, shape and texture! Great shot!', '2004-12-10 20:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056637, 126852, 15811, '<td valign="top">hrmm...yeah, it''s definately yellow.  Seems like the focus might be a bit soft although it''s hard to tell beacuse the photo is so small.  I like the composition -- that being said, it''s just really hard to really look deeper into it given its lack of size.</td>', 'hrmm...yeah, it''s definately yellow.  Seems like the focus might be a bit soft although it''s hard to tell beacuse the photo is so small.  I like the composition -- that being said, it''s just really hard to really look deeper into it given its lack of size.', '2004-12-10 20:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056639, 126804, 15811, '<td valign="top">hrmm...This just doesn''t do it for me.  The focus seems soft, not too creative...but it meets the challenge heh.</td>', 'hrmm...This just doesn''t do it for me.  The focus seems soft, not too creative...but it meets the challenge heh.', '2004-12-10 20:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056640, 125683, 29799, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture. It is very creative. I don''t see that it is a picture related to yellow... at least on my monitor it is browns and peaches.</td>', 'I really like this picture. It is very creative. I don''t see that it is a picture related to yellow... at least on my monitor it is browns and peaches.', '2004-12-10 20:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056641, 126381, 15811, '<td valign="top">There have been quite a few of these type of shots in this challenge -- but I definately like the composition in your photo.  I think the bottom of the glass could not be visible as it''s sort of distracting, and the lemon could be more in the shot, but that''s a matter of opinion I suppose.  good work.</td>', 'There have been quite a few of these type of shots in this challenge -- but I definately like the composition in your photo.  I think the bottom of the glass could not be visible as it''s sort of distracting, and the lemon could be more in the shot, but that''s a matter of opinion I suppose.  good work.', '2004-12-10 20:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056642, 126313, 29799, '<td valign="top">This rated highly for me! I thought the picture and lighting were great and the photo was sexy. I liked that it didn''t scream YELLOW also.</td>', 'This rated highly for me! I thought the picture and lighting were great and the photo was sexy. I liked that it didn''t scream YELLOW also.', '2004-12-10 20:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056643, 126824, 29799, '<td valign="top">There were a lot of pictures of peppers in this contest, but you were able to use it in a unique manner and it was very artistic and abstract. Great job!</td>', 'There were a lot of pictures of peppers in this contest, but you were able to use it in a unique manner and it was very artistic and abstract. Great job!', '2004-12-10 20:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056645, 126796, 29799, '<td valign="top">I loved the black and white bringing out the yellow cat eyes! Very cool looking!</td>', 'I loved the black and white bringing out the yellow cat eyes! Very cool looking!', '2004-12-10 20:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056646, 126673, 29799, '<td valign="top">This, for the simplicity of the picture, is very creative and pretty. It reflects the light beautifully.</td>', 'This, for the simplicity of the picture, is very creative and pretty. It reflects the light beautifully.', '2004-12-10 20:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056647, 126387, 29799, '<td valign="top">I really liked this pic. I would have liked it even without the smiley face, but the face was the added touch to make it stand out from the rest. Great job!</td>', 'I really liked this pic. I would have liked it even without the smiley face, but the face was the added touch to make it stand out from the rest. Great job!', '2004-12-10 20:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056648, 126423, 29799, '<td valign="top">very sensual and a beautiful use of the color.</td>', 'very sensual and a beautiful use of the color.', '2004-12-10 20:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056649, 126078, 29799, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting and details on this picture. The water droplets add a lot also. Great shot!</td>', 'I love the lighting and details on this picture. The water droplets add a lot also. Great shot!', '2004-12-10 20:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056650, 126410, 29799, '<td valign="top">I love the abstractness of this picture. The curving lines are and light make this picture stand out!</td>', 'I love the abstractness of this picture. The curving lines are and light make this picture stand out!', '2004-12-10 21:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056651, 126509, 29799, '<td valign="top">very creative. Too bad the toothpicks had to show. Maybe if you would have done it with the point on the top!?!  High marks though!</td>', 'very creative. Too bad the toothpicks had to show. Maybe if you would have done it with the point on the top!?!  High marks though!', '2004-12-10 21:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056666, 126117, 19978, '<td valign="top">A truly excellent image. The frame is full of nothing but car and the angle and composition are wonderful. It''s really too bad about the reflections of other cars in the bumper but I guess you didn''t have the luxury of moving this thing yourself.</td>', 'A truly excellent image. The frame is full of nothing but car and the angle and composition are wonderful. It''s really too bad about the reflections of other cars in the bumper but I guess you didn''t have the luxury of moving this thing yourself.', '2004-12-10 21:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056668, 125360, 19978, '<td valign="top">Oh Wow. A truly artistic composition. I fear that this one won''t get much of the vote beside all the glitzy sharp peppers and flowers, but this is a photographic beauty. Added to my favorites too.</td>', 'Oh Wow. A truly artistic composition. I fear that this one won''t get much of the vote beside all the glitzy sharp peppers and flowers, but this is a photographic beauty. Added to my favorites too.', '2004-12-10 21:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056669, 125657, 19978, '<td valign="top">Superb. Artful and simple. Beautiful interplay of light and shadow. The quintessential jazz player.</td>', 'Superb. Artful and simple. Beautiful interplay of light and shadow. The quintessential jazz player.', '2004-12-10 21:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056673, 126770, 15231, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  I think it would have been more effective if it were rotated so the highlight were vertical</td>', 'Interesting image.  I think it would have been more effective if it were rotated so the highlight were vertical', '2004-12-10 21:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056675, 126141, 29477, '<td valign="top">Simple yet effective...Thanks for some originality.  Nice shot</td>', 'Simple yet effective...Thanks for some originality.  Nice shot', '2004-12-10 21:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056679, 125642, 29477, '<td valign="top">nicely done...very original</td>', 'nicely done...very original', '2004-12-10 22:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056681, 126674, 29477, '<td valign="top">81% voted and best apple shot I''ve seen so far...good shot</td>', '81% voted and best apple shot I''ve seen so far...good shot', '2004-12-10 22:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056685, 126813, 29477, '<td valign="top">Great reflection on the road...Suggestion:  try and crop the image to remove the actual lights and have the viewers focus onto the refleciton on the road...with the same title, I would find that image more powerful...Let me know what you think.</td>', 'Great reflection on the road...Suggestion:  try and crop the image to remove the actual lights and have the viewers focus onto the refleciton on the road...with the same title, I would find that image more powerful...Let me know what you think.', '2004-12-10 22:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056687, 126076, 29477, '<td valign="top">nice variation on the ducky.  The stopped motion adds some life to the picture rather than just having ducky sitting there.</td>', 'nice variation on the ducky.  The stopped motion adds some life to the picture rather than just having ducky sitting there.', '2004-12-10 22:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056689, 126197, 29477, '<td valign="top">Great entry for Yellow...You are automatically pulled into his eyes and as the details of the contest state, "The color yellow must lead to the impact of the photo."  Nicely composed too.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-12-15 00:06:27.</i></td>', 'Great entry for Yellow...You are automatically pulled into his eyes and as the details of the contest state, "The color yellow must lead to the impact of the photo."  Nicely composed too.', '2004-12-10 22:09:32.000000', '2004-12-15 00:06:27.000000', 1),
(1056690, 126835, 29477, '<td valign="top">nice flower shot...in my view, one of the better ones in this challenge.</td>', 'nice flower shot...in my view, one of the better ones in this challenge.', '2004-12-10 22:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056693, 126618, 26756, '<td valign="top">Not primary yellow, but I''ll work with ya.  A different subject, I like your crop and the angle of the shot.  Technically very nice.</td>', 'Not primary yellow, but I''ll work with ya.  A different subject, I like your crop and the angle of the shot.  Technically very nice.', '2004-12-10 22:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056694, 126452, 29477, '<td valign="top">Original idea...  I like the shot but find the DOF a little distracting.</td>', 'Original idea...  I like the shot but find the DOF a little distracting.', '2004-12-10 22:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056698, 126852, 29477, '<td valign="top">Great shot however I feel you''ve negatively impacted your score by such a small image...Take advantage of maximizing your file size (150MB) and be sure to use as much of the 640 pixels.</td>', 'Great shot however I feel you''ve negatively impacted your score by such a small image...Take advantage of maximizing your file size (150MB) and be sure to use as much of the 640 pixels.', '2004-12-10 22:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056699, 125438, 29477, '<td valign="top">It would have been nice to take the shot at an angle so your background was a solid colour (yes, canadian spelling). I find the dard shadows a distraction.  Other than that, nice shot.</td>', 'It would have been nice to take the shot at an angle so your background was a solid colour (yes, canadian spelling). I find the dard shadows a distraction.  Other than that, nice shot.', '2004-12-10 22:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056700, 126835, 26756, '<td valign="top">It might not be the most interesting of all subjects but you did a great job with the framing, everything is nice and sharp and the exposure is great.  Beautiful light.</td>', 'It might not be the most interesting of all subjects but you did a great job with the framing, everything is nice and sharp and the exposure is great.  Beautiful light.', '2004-12-10 22:18:23.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1056701, 125345, 29477, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast by placing the lemon slice on something other than a glass or in a bowl...original.</td>', 'Nice contrast by placing the lemon slice on something other than a glass or in a bowl...original.', '2004-12-10 22:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056702, 126141, 26756, '<td valign="top">Cool idea.  The light looks great on the subject, and the pure dark background works really well.  Could be a tad more in focus but overall a really cool pic.</td>', 'Cool idea.  The light looks great on the subject, and the pure dark background works really well.  Could be a tad more in focus but overall a really cool pic.', '2004-12-10 22:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056704, 126458, 29477, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...the background seems painted...<br/>I like the fact that you took a portion of the flower and have your background accentuate the visible pedals.<br/></td>', 'Nice shot...the background seems painted...I like the fact that you took a portion of the flower and have your background accentuate the visible pedals.', '2004-12-10 22:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056706, 126883, 29477, '<td valign="top">I saw another yellow rose in this challange with a contrasting background.  It brought the flower to life.  Like this shot, but feel the yellow background dulls the flower somewhat.</td>', 'I saw another yellow rose in this challange with a contrasting background.  It brought the flower to life.  Like this shot, but feel the yellow background dulls the flower somewhat.', '2004-12-10 22:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056707, 125593, 29477, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed</td>', 'Nicely composed', '2004-12-10 22:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056709, 125601, 29477, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Would have prefered to see the marble cover the entire image rather than frame it the way you did as then my focus would be on the flower rather than both the flower and the corners...</td>', 'Great idea.  Would have prefered to see the marble cover the entire image rather than frame it the way you did as then my focus would be on the flower rather than both the flower and the corners...', '2004-12-10 22:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056710, 125818, 29477, '<td valign="top">Great interpretation and post shot editing.  Very creative...I like it!</td>', 'Great interpretation and post shot editing.  Very creative...I like it!', '2004-12-10 22:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056711, 125949, 4226, '<td valign="top">funny !!</td>', 'funny !!', '2004-12-10 22:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056712, 126713, 29477, '<td valign="top">My final vote in the challenge and it has given me an idea...be back in a minute!!!<br/>...<br/>...<br/>Back.  Good shot.</td>', 'My final vote in the challenge and it has given me an idea...be back in a minute!!!......Back.  Good shot.', '2004-12-10 22:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056726, 126387, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good composition. I like the yellow light in the egg shells. And Yes, I see the smiley face in the yolk!</td>', 'Good composition. I like the yellow light in the egg shells. And Yes, I see the smiley face in the yolk!', '2004-12-10 22:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056729, 126772, 26313, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the photo, but the car sure could use a set of lowering springs!</td>', 'Nice job on the photo, but the car sure could use a set of lowering springs!', '2004-12-10 22:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056732, 126788, 15920, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite tell what this is, but it is a great effect.  Perfectly offset by the black background.</td>', 'I can''t quite tell what this is, but it is a great effect.  Perfectly offset by the black background.', '2004-12-10 22:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056767, 125949, 15920, '<td valign="top">OK, I''m still laughing.  Nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'OK, I''m still laughing.  Nice take on the challenge.', '2004-12-10 23:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056769, 126863, 27375, '<td valign="top">this is an an awesome concept,  i would just like it better with a larger dof</td>', 'this is an an awesome concept,  i would just like it better with a larger dof', '2004-12-10 23:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056772, 126007, 27375, '<td valign="top">with its square crop it reminds me of cd cover, a different approach to the flower thing everyone else is doing, i like it. simple and effective</td>', 'with its square crop it reminds me of cd cover, a different approach to the flower thing everyone else is doing, i like it. simple and effective', '2004-12-10 23:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
