(1056786, 126714, 15811, '<td valign="top">hrmm...I like the idea here, not sure I dig the pink/orange/reddish background though.  There''s a reflection in the hood too that I''m not sure why it''s like that.  I think this would have done much better had it been on a reflective sort of white background or maybe even black on a piece of glass about 1/2" up from the black bottom.</td>', 'hrmm...I like the idea here, not sure I dig the pink/orange/reddish background though.  There''s a reflection in the hood too that I''m not sure why it''s like that.  I think this would have done much better had it been on a reflective sort of white background or maybe even black on a piece of glass about 1/2" up from the black bottom.', '2004-12-10 23:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
