(1056925, 126026, 19608, '<td valign="top">A classic car shot - and very well done. You have a great eye for composition - the shadows under the car are great and the flag is perfectly placed.  Try to avoid the tree growing up between the headlight and the radiator.   I do believe this would look better if it were under exposed a half stop or more.  Although the exposure of the sky looks about "right" - try it again with less exposure.  Less exposure will saturate the yellows a bit more and make it more dramatic.</td>', 'A classic car shot - and very well done. You have a great eye for composition - the shadows under the car are great and the flag is perfectly placed.  Try to avoid the tree growing up between the headlight and the radiator.   I do believe this would look better if it were under exposed a half stop or more.  Although the exposure of the sky looks about "right" - try it again with less exposure.  Less exposure will saturate the yellows a bit more and make it more dramatic.', '2004-12-11 02:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056926, 126450, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent entry.  The almost silhouette is very interesting, just enough detail to add a bit of mystery.  I don''t think the bottom lemon in the glass is needed - it would be better with just the one.</td>', 'Excellent entry.  The almost silhouette is very interesting, just enough detail to add a bit of mystery.  I don''t think the bottom lemon in the glass is needed - it would be better with just the one.', '2004-12-11 02:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
