(1057095, 126061, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty clever idea, and hammers the challenge piece.  To really get the contrast message of the bike travelling the wrong way, I think you need just a little more motion trail behind the biker.  As is, this is an 8 from me.  Great eye.</td>', 'This is a pretty clever idea, and hammers the challenge piece.  To really get the contrast message of the bike travelling the wrong way, I think you need just a little more motion trail behind the biker.  As is, this is an 8 from me.  Great eye.', '2004-12-11 08:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
