(1057126, 125345, 19978, '<td valign="top">I''ve come back to this one a few times (itself an accomplishment in a field this size). Somehow the purple background with the yellow of the lemon and brown of the fret-board make an intriguing combination. This one has really grown on me and for some reason my eyes love to wander over it. A pleasing entry to this challenge.</td>', 'I''ve come back to this one a few times (itself an accomplishment in a field this size). Somehow the purple background with the yellow of the lemon and brown of the fret-board make an intriguing combination. This one has really grown on me and for some reason my eyes love to wander over it. A pleasing entry to this challenge.', '2004-12-11 09:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057129, 126628, 19978, '<td valign="top">I''m voting this one up just for execution. This is a recent fad on DPC (refracting drops) and you have pulled off a pleaser here. Well done conceptually and technically.</td>', 'I''m voting this one up just for execution. This is a recent fad on DPC (refracting drops) and you have pulled off a pleaser here. Well done conceptually and technically.', '2004-12-11 09:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057131, 125642, 19978, '<td valign="top">This still-life shows such perfect preparation, but it requires some time to appreciate. I confess that I almost passed over it in my "large challenge haze." I''m sure glad I stopped to look. Amazingly beautiful composition. My hat is off to you for creating and sharing this. It''s one of my top picks for the challenge but I fear your wonderful entry will be lost in a stack of glitzy sharp peppers or flowers.</td>', 'This still-life shows such perfect preparation, but it requires some time to appreciate. I confess that I almost passed over it in my "large challenge haze." I''m sure glad I stopped to look. Amazingly beautiful composition. My hat is off to you for creating and sharing this. It''s one of my top picks for the challenge but I fear your wonderful entry will be lost in a stack of glitzy sharp peppers or flowers.', '2004-12-11 09:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057134, 126453, 19978, '<td valign="top">...and very nice result.</td>', '...and very nice result.', '2004-12-11 09:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
