(1057141, 125765, 15920, '<td valign="top">Good use of DOF to make this interesting.  Candles themselves are excellent (interesting choice not to light them?), but the background weave is a little distracting.</td>', 'Good use of DOF to make this interesting.  Candles themselves are excellent (interesting choice not to light them?), but the background weave is a little distracting.', '2004-12-11 09:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
