(1057170, 125341, 15920, '<td valign="top">I had typed a longer comment on this and managed to loose it when I hit the favorites button.  I like everything about this (and I usually hate flower shots), but here, the context of the glass, the shadow, the perfect lighting, and the subdued other colors are all great.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'I had typed a longer comment on this and managed to loose it when I hit the favorites button.  I like everything about this (and I usually hate flower shots), but here, the context of the glass, the shadow, the perfect lighting, and the subdued other colors are all great.  Very nicely done.', '2004-12-11 10:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057179, 126886, 15920, '<td valign="top">A bit of yellow in the hand (on the knuckles) that looks a little off on this monitor, but, this is nicely done overall.</td>', 'A bit of yellow in the hand (on the knuckles) that looks a little off on this monitor, but, this is nicely done overall.', '2004-12-11 10:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057184, 126564, 15920, '<td valign="top">That is pretty interesting.  I love that time of day, and you used it effectively to make a good picture out of what looks a depressing place.  One small suggestion, I would have traded deeper shadows for more detail on the golden bricks.</td>', 'That is pretty interesting.  I love that time of day, and you used it effectively to make a good picture out of what looks a depressing place.  One small suggestion, I would have traded deeper shadows for more detail on the golden bricks.', '2004-12-11 11:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
