(1057452, 126458, 24065, '<td valign="top">The colors are vibrant and the focus is sharp.  The composition is interesting.</td>', 'The colors are vibrant and the focus is sharp.  The composition is interesting.', '2004-12-11 16:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057453, 125859, 24065, '<td valign="top">Very good focus and color.  I like the composition and dof, too.</td>', 'Very good focus and color.  I like the composition and dof, too.', '2004-12-11 16:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057455, 126733, 24065, '<td valign="top">The dof is great and the colors are very realistic.  My personal opinion is that a closer crop would help, but I don''t know that my opinion is worth very much :)  Just trying to be helpful.</td>', 'The dof is great and the colors are very realistic.  My personal opinion is that a closer crop would help, but I don''t know that my opinion is worth very much :)  Just trying to be helpful.', '2004-12-11 16:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057458, 125341, 24065, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting composition.  It certainly made me spend some time looking at your photo, so I guess that''s a good thing.  Your focus is great and the colors are very pleasing.</td>', 'This is an interesting composition.  It certainly made me spend some time looking at your photo, so I guess that''s a good thing.  Your focus is great and the colors are very pleasing.', '2004-12-11 17:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057459, 125270, 24065, '<td valign="top">Great focus, lighting and color.  Strong composition.  BOL</td>', 'Great focus, lighting and color.  Strong composition.  BOL', '2004-12-11 17:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057461, 126796, 24065, '<td valign="top">Oooohhhhh, cute kitty :)  The focus is fantastic and your desaturation has made those eyes pop.  I like the composition, too.  BOL   9</td>', 'Oooohhhhh, cute kitty :)  The focus is fantastic and your desaturation has made those eyes pop.  I like the composition, too.  BOL   9', '2004-12-11 17:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057462, 126310, 24065, '<td valign="top">This is too funny!  Good focus and colors, too.</td>', 'This is too funny!  Good focus and colors, too.', '2004-12-11 17:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057464, 126664, 24065, '<td valign="top">This is just an opinion -- which may not be worth much -- and it is offered in a spirit of wanting to be helpful:  I think it should have been cropped just above the sign.  When I scroll up so I only see the top of the photo, the color and composition are so pleasing.  But when I scroll down to see the whole photo I don''t like it as much.  :)</td>', 'This is just an opinion -- which may not be worth much -- and it is offered in a spirit of wanting to be helpful:  I think it should have been cropped just above the sign.  When I scroll up so I only see the top of the photo, the color and composition are so pleasing.  But when I scroll down to see the whole photo I don''t like it as much.  :)', '2004-12-11 17:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057469, 126368, 24065, '<td valign="top">WoW!  Is this creative!  This is certainly where art meets photography.  I hope it''s not a little too over the top for the average DPCer!  BOL</td>', 'WoW!  Is this creative!  This is certainly where art meets photography.  I hope it''s not a little too over the top for the average DPCer!  BOL', '2004-12-11 17:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057471, 126865, 24065, '<td valign="top">The focus and colors and just wonderful.  I''m a little concerned about the centered composition.  I know it works sometimes, but I''m just not sure it worked here.  I guess the final votes will tell, because that''s the only thing I can see that might hurt your scoring.  BOL on a very nice entry.</td>', 'The focus and colors and just wonderful.  I''m a little concerned about the centered composition.  I know it works sometimes, but I''m just not sure it worked here.  I guess the final votes will tell, because that''s the only thing I can see that might hurt your scoring.  BOL on a very nice entry.', '2004-12-11 17:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057472, 125683, 24065, '<td valign="top">Surely this will ribbon!  It''s just tremendous.</td>', 'Surely this will ribbon!  It''s just tremendous.', '2004-12-11 17:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057474, 125270, 27994, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot superb colors and composition</td>', 'Excellent shot superb colors and composition', '2004-12-11 17:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057475, 126367, 24065, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I love the way the limb brings your eyes down to the yellow.  BOL</td>', 'Beautiful!  I love the way the limb brings your eyes down to the yellow.  BOL', '2004-12-11 17:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057477, 126762, 24065, '<td valign="top">Your colors are so rich and pleasing!  Composition is nice and focus is great.  And there''s certainly not too many of these in the challenge!  BOL</td>', 'Your colors are so rich and pleasing!  Composition is nice and focus is great.  And there''s certainly not too many of these in the challenge!  BOL', '2004-12-11 17:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057479, 125642, 24065, '<td valign="top">This is lovely!  The focus is tremendous and the colors are so rich.  I personally would have preferred a closer crop on the bottom, but that''s just a personal opinion.  BOL :)</td>', 'This is lovely!  The focus is tremendous and the colors are so rich.  I personally would have preferred a closer crop on the bottom, but that''s just a personal opinion.  BOL :)', '2004-12-11 17:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
