(1057535, 125898, 27994, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2004-12-11 18:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057538, 125733, 24065, '<td valign="top">Oh, wow!  Those things really grow on trees?  Just kidding.  But it is a bit unusual.  I think it might be a tad oversharpened.  Otherwise, it makes a nice photo and certainly meets the challenge.</td>', 'Oh, wow!  Those things really grow on trees?  Just kidding.  But it is a bit unusual.  I think it might be a tad oversharpened.  Otherwise, it makes a nice photo and certainly meets the challenge.', '2004-12-11 18:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057540, 126835, 23456, '<td valign="top">visually striking, nicest "flower" on the challenge so far, well done !</td>', 'visually striking, nicest "flower" on the challenge so far, well done !', '2004-12-11 18:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057545, 125902, 23456, '<td valign="top">without the buds, this would''ve look great centered on a black background !</td>', 'without the buds, this would''ve look great centered on a black background !', '2004-12-11 18:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057546, 126532, 24065, '<td valign="top">Sharp focus, good colors.  My husband passed by and saw it and likes the centered composition.</td>', 'Sharp focus, good colors.  My husband passed by and saw it and likes the centered composition.', '2004-12-11 18:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057549, 126694, 23456, '<td valign="top">not bad , I like it. I may have cloned out the tag in the towel ! Great !!</td>', 'not bad , I like it. I may have cloned out the tag in the towel ! Great !!', '2004-12-11 18:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057550, 126654, 24065, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and colors.</td>', 'Nice focus and colors.', '2004-12-11 18:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057551, 125867, 24065, '<td valign="top">This is a cute idea.  The focus seems a little soft, so that may be hurting your scores.</td>', 'This is a cute idea.  The focus seems a little soft, so that may be hurting your scores.', '2004-12-11 18:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057555, 126885, 24065, '<td valign="top">The focus and dof is tremendous!  And I really like the composition.  I haven''t traveled enough to recognize this place, nor to understand your title.  I''ll look forward to coming back after the challenge and seeing where it is.  BOL</td>', 'The focus and dof is tremendous!  And I really like the composition.  I haven''t traveled enough to recognize this place, nor to understand your title.  I''ll look forward to coming back after the challenge and seeing where it is.  BOL', '2004-12-11 18:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057556, 126116, 23456, '<td valign="top">beautiful dog !</td>', 'beautiful dog !', '2004-12-11 18:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057557, 126417, 24065, '<td valign="top">The complimentary colors are nice.  I think the soft focus around the girl''s face may hurt your score some, just from comments I''ve read in other challenges.</td>', 'The complimentary colors are nice.  I think the soft focus around the girl''s face may hurt your score some, just from comments I''ve read in other challenges.', '2004-12-11 18:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057558, 125566, 24065, '<td valign="top">The colors and lighting are fabulous.  I''m not too crazy about your choice of dof or composition, but those are just personal opinions.  :)</td>', 'The colors and lighting are fabulous.  I''m not too crazy about your choice of dof or composition, but those are just personal opinions.  :)', '2004-12-11 18:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057559, 126693, 24065, '<td valign="top">Beautiful focus and I like the soft colors.  This makes me want one!  or two....</td>', 'Beautiful focus and I like the soft colors.  This makes me want one!  or two....', '2004-12-11 18:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057560, 126692, 23456, '<td valign="top">clever concept, well done</td>', 'clever concept, well done', '2004-12-11 18:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057561, 126799, 24065, '<td valign="top">I''m getting bad reviews on my yellow border!  Hope you''re not, too.  Good focus and I like the composition.</td>', 'I''m getting bad reviews on my yellow border!  Hope you''re not, too.  Good focus and I like the composition.', '2004-12-11 18:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057563, 125857, 24065, '<td valign="top">I  like your pov and composition.  The colors are beautiful.  My eyes keep trying to get the flower in focus, though.  I''m not sure a shallow dof was the best choice here.  Hope others will comment so you''ll know for sure.  :)</td>', 'I  like your pov and composition.  The colors are beautiful.  My eyes keep trying to get the flower in focus, though.  I''m not sure a shallow dof was the best choice here.  Hope others will comment so you''ll know for sure.  :)', '2004-12-11 18:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057566, 125618, 24065, '<td valign="top">He''s a cutie.  And he meets the challenge.  I''m afraid the small size is going to cost you some points -- people are always complaining about them.  I think otherwise this is a very nice photo, but probably won''t get the score it deserves.  Hope I''m wrong.</td>', 'He''s a cutie.  And he meets the challenge.  I''m afraid the small size is going to cost you some points -- people are always complaining about them.  I think otherwise this is a very nice photo, but probably won''t get the score it deserves.  Hope I''m wrong.', '2004-12-11 18:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057568, 125891, 23456, '<td valign="top">the yellow is visually striking, nice !</td>', 'the yellow is visually striking, nice !', '2004-12-11 18:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057569, 126790, 24065, '<td valign="top">It''s hard for me to be objective about this photo because of the clash of the unmatching yellows.  The focus and lighting are great, tho, and I do like your composition.  So, I''m trying to get over the unnatural color of the hand  :)</td>', 'It''s hard for me to be objective about this photo because of the clash of the unmatching yellows.  The focus and lighting are great, tho, and I do like your composition.  So, I''m trying to get over the unnatural color of the hand  :)', '2004-12-11 18:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057571, 126773, 24065, '<td valign="top">Max is a cutie.  I think a close up of him -- where his face filled the whole frame -- with the yellow toy would have been great.  But I think there''s too much going on in this photo for it to do well.  I think people also like to see the eyes of animals and other people.  Hope I''m wrong.  :)</td>', 'Max is a cutie.  I think a close up of him -- where his face filled the whole frame -- with the yellow toy would have been great.  But I think there''s too much going on in this photo for it to do well.  I think people also like to see the eyes of animals and other people.  Hope I''m wrong.  :)', '2004-12-11 18:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057572, 126853, 24065, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and focus.  I personally would have liked a closer crop on the right.  :)</td>', 'Nice colors and focus.  I personally would have liked a closer crop on the right.  :)', '2004-12-11 18:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057573, 125438, 23456, '<td valign="top">effective,  nice composition</td>', 'effective,  nice composition', '2004-12-11 18:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057577, 126820, 23456, '<td valign="top">A more perfect leaf would have looked better</td>', 'A more perfect leaf would have looked better', '2004-12-11 18:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057587, 126125, 23456, '<td valign="top">not bad, good lighting. would have cloned out those 3 dark spots</td>', 'not bad, good lighting. would have cloned out those 3 dark spots', '2004-12-11 18:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057588, 125706, 23456, '<td valign="top">too bright on top of the pyramid - toned down would make it a nicer photograph</td>', 'too bright on top of the pyramid - toned down would make it a nicer photograph', '2004-12-11 18:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057611, 126790, 3697, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here, very original. The only two nitpicks I have is the background being a little darker on the right than on the left and the cut surface of the lemon seems a tad blown out. I know both are hard to fix with limited editing allowed. Having said that,  I really do like the shot. Nice work.</td>', 'I like the idea here, very original. The only two nitpicks I have is the background being a little darker on the right than on the left and the cut surface of the lemon seems a tad blown out. I know both are hard to fix with limited editing allowed. Having said that,  I really do like the shot. Nice work.', '2004-12-11 19:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057612, 126885, 3697, '<td valign="top">I love the use of lines and light... good eye.</td>', 'I love the use of lines and light... good eye.', '2004-12-11 19:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057619, 125671, 17033, '<td valign="top">You may laugh, but this is actually how I remember things</td>', 'You may laugh, but this is actually how I remember things', '2004-12-11 19:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057620, 126061, 3697, '<td valign="top">I love the composition, makes the shot a real eye catcher.</td>', 'I love the composition, makes the shot a real eye catcher.', '2004-12-11 19:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057627, 126581, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>So very cute and attractive. The only distraction is the variation of skin tones on the legs. Outside of this minor snag, your image is very well composed and bears the magic of the movie. The bricks look stunning. Bumping way up<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-12-15 00:14:31.</i></td>', 'returning for comments:So very cute and attractive. The only distraction is the variation of skin tones on the legs. Outside of this minor snag, your image is very well composed and bears the magic of the movie. The bricks look stunning. Bumping way up', '2004-12-11 19:20:14.000000', '2004-12-15 00:14:31.000000', 1),
(1057628, 125781, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>A very good capture. Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments:A very good capture. Bumping up.', '2004-12-11 19:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057630, 126813, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>You have enough yellow to pass the challenge. lol Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments:You have enough yellow to pass the challenge. lol Bumping up.', '2004-12-11 19:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057631, 126651, 17033, '<td valign="top">Good capture. check out images 68508 and 68159 for comparison.</td>', 'Good capture. check out images 68508 and 68159 for comparison.', '2004-12-11 19:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057649, 125476, 26151, '<td valign="top">I don''t know, maybe a different color towel would have put the rubber duckie more in the limelight. What stands out here is the red beak. Still a cute picture though</td>', 'I don''t know, maybe a different color towel would have put the rubber duckie more in the limelight. What stands out here is the red beak. Still a cute picture though', '2004-12-11 19:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057655, 125869, 2764, '<td valign="top">Is it all the yellow that makes her skin tone look so pink?</td>', 'Is it all the yellow that makes her skin tone look so pink?', '2004-12-11 20:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057657, 126010, 2764, '<td valign="top">I think the crop is too tight for the action implied here - give her a little more room for the punch.</td>', 'I think the crop is too tight for the action implied here - give her a little more room for the punch.', '2004-12-11 20:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057660, 125647, 2764, '<td valign="top">is anything in focus?</td>', 'is anything in focus?', '2004-12-11 20:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057665, 126629, 2764, '<td valign="top">more pixels please - tiny pistures never score well</td>', 'more pixels please - tiny pistures never score well', '2004-12-11 20:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057666, 126532, 15811, '<td valign="top">Did ya take the sticky colored squares off and move all the yellow ones to one side?  That''s the only way I could ever beat that thing.<br/> <br/>I like this -- nice and simple, great white balance...lighting is perfect.  great job, great idea.</td>', 'Did ya take the sticky colored squares off and move all the yellow ones to one side?  That''s the only way I could ever beat that thing. I like this -- nice and simple, great white balance...lighting is perfect.  great job, great idea.', '2004-12-11 20:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057669, 126738, 15811, '<td valign="top">My monitor is screwed up -- looks orange to me.  I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt though and say it''s yellow.<br/> <br/>Focus seems a little soft, but otherwise, this is very interesting, great angle I like it a lot.</td>', 'My monitor is screwed up -- looks orange to me.  I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt though and say it''s yellow. Focus seems a little soft, but otherwise, this is very interesting, great angle I like it a lot.', '2004-12-11 20:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057672, 126389, 26151, '<td valign="top">Nice, cute picture. But I''m thinking this might have been a better picture without the toy. Is the yellow toy the subject, or the dog? The toy, even though it''s yellow, and that''s what the challenge is, is a distraction for me. It doesn''t lead to the impact, which is the dog.</td>', 'Nice, cute picture. But I''m thinking this might have been a better picture without the toy. Is the yellow toy the subject, or the dog? The toy, even though it''s yellow, and that''s what the challenge is, is a distraction for me. It doesn''t lead to the impact, which is the dog.', '2004-12-11 20:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057689, 125683, 26151, '<td valign="top">Great photo! I admire the lengths people here go to get a great photo just for a weekly website challenge. I can say this about a lot of photos on this site, but now, after seeing this photo, is when I thought to say it. It shows how seriously you, and all the others take their craft. Perfect expressionless face. And sometimes I tell people that they don''t need to use the challenge name in their title, but here I think it works. Can''t stop looking at it (the picture, not the title).</td>', 'Great photo! I admire the lengths people here go to get a great photo just for a weekly website challenge. I can say this about a lot of photos on this site, but now, after seeing this photo, is when I thought to say it. It shows how seriously you, and all the others take their craft. Perfect expressionless face. And sometimes I tell people that they don''t need to use the challenge name in their title, but here I think it works. Can''t stop looking at it (the picture, not the title).', '2004-12-11 20:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057691, 125796, 29309, '<td valign="top">the focus seems pretty soft. maybe this is from the crop.</td>', 'the focus seems pretty soft. maybe this is from the crop.', '2004-12-11 21:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057702, 126762, 15920, '<td valign="top">Perfectly lit.  On my monitor, I see a fair bit of noise in the background, which hurts the overall impact a bit.  But that aside, this is well done.</td>', 'Perfectly lit.  On my monitor, I see a fair bit of noise in the background, which hurts the overall impact a bit.  But that aside, this is well done.', '2004-12-11 21:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057705, 126321, 27293, '<td valign="top">.</td>', '.', '2004-12-11 21:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057708, 126723, 25355, '<td valign="top">an outdoor shot would have been better, or at least make more sense</td>', 'an outdoor shot would have been better, or at least make more sense', '2004-12-11 21:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057709, 125879, 25355, '<td valign="top">This brings to mind the Tahitian paintings of Gauguin...</td>', 'This brings to mind the Tahitian paintings of Gauguin...', '2004-12-11 21:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
