(1057830, 125915, 22384, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. The yellow M&amp;Ms look like they are floating. I am wondering what this would look like with just cool colors (blue and green) in the background, or other warm colors in the background (orange and red). Or the other colors, except brown behind this. Or just brown behind the yellow. You probably tried all of the above. If you did, I would love to see the outtakes. I really like this shot. 8</td>', 'Cool idea. The yellow M&Ms look like they are floating. I am wondering what this would look like with just cool colors (blue and green) in the background, or other warm colors in the background (orange and red). Or the other colors, except brown behind this. Or just brown behind the yellow. You probably tried all of the above. If you did, I would love to see the outtakes. I really like this shot. 8', '2004-12-12 00:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057834, 126313, 22384, '<td valign="top">So beatiful. This shot would be awesome as a piece of art in your room at home. Creative, sexy, adult and absolutely gorgeous. You could do a study with similar shots and different colors and matching ties. The buttery yellow goes well with her tan skin. Very nice. A rare 10.</td>', 'So beatiful. This shot would be awesome as a piece of art in your room at home. Creative, sexy, adult and absolutely gorgeous. You could do a study with similar shots and different colors and matching ties. The buttery yellow goes well with her tan skin. Very nice. A rare 10.', '2004-12-12 00:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057835, 126654, 10768, '<td valign="top">Very clear</td>', 'Very clear', '2004-12-12 00:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057840, 125687, 22384, '<td valign="top">funny. I am looking for a connection in the titles. I don''t see one, the books seem random, which is cool. Maybe you could play around with this idea and specific titles to send a message. Just a thought.  My husband just looked over my shoulder and commented "that''s a neat picture." We are book lovers. I just had the woman in the yellow shirt and tie on the screen and he didn''t notice... Maybe we like our books a little too much...  :-) I like that this is a "thinking" shot!  7</td>', 'funny. I am looking for a connection in the titles. I don''t see one, the books seem random, which is cool. Maybe you could play around with this idea and specific titles to send a message. Just a thought.  My husband just looked over my shoulder and commented "that''s a neat picture." We are book lovers. I just had the woman in the yellow shirt and tie on the screen and he didn''t notice... Maybe we like our books a little too much...  :-) I like that this is a "thinking" shot!  7', '2004-12-12 00:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
