(1058355, 126341, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellently composed and lit - and the extraordinarily beautiful model doesn''t hurt either.  It''s a bit hot in spots, but I actually like that effect for this shot.  If this were advanced editing, it would be a good idea to remove the 2 "extra" earring holes.  This serene image should finish up in the stratosphere.</td>', 'Excellently composed and lit - and the extraordinarily beautiful model doesn''t hurt either.  It''s a bit hot in spots, but I actually like that effect for this shot.  If this were advanced editing, it would be a good idea to remove the 2 "extra" earring holes.  This serene image should finish up in the stratosphere.', '2004-12-12 14:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058357, 126545, 19608, '<td valign="top">What a sky!  The only picky thing that bothers me just a bit is that the main light poke is not quite vertical. Even with that - it is a very magical scene - good luck.</td>', 'What a sky!  The only picky thing that bothers me just a bit is that the main light poke is not quite vertical. Even with that - it is a very magical scene - good luck.', '2004-12-12 14:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
