(1061501, 125417, 6132, '<td valign="top">A beautiful and very original image for this challenge. My only gripe with this image is the pose. The womans pose is perfect, she seems to symbolize passion with no problem. But what about the Males pose? What is he focusing and concentrating on? Her chin? Apart from that the image is perfect and is one of four images that I rated the most highly for this challenge. Composition is good, lighting is also excellent. All the best with the challenge.</td>', 'A beautiful and very original image for this challenge. My only gripe with this image is the pose. The womans pose is perfect, she seems to symbolize passion with no problem. But what about the Males pose? What is he focusing and concentrating on? Her chin? Apart from that the image is perfect and is one of four images that I rated the most highly for this challenge. Composition is good, lighting is also excellent. All the best with the challenge.', '2004-12-14 06:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1061532, 126772, 23251, '<td valign="top">IMHO a crop of about half the sky would have helped the composition and increased the impact of the car.  Nice shot.</td>', 'IMHO a crop of about half the sky would have helped the composition and increased the impact of the car.  Nice shot.', '2004-12-14 06:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
