(1061598, 125733, 26487, '<td valign="top">Beautiful catching the movement of the trunk. But for suiting the title, maybe you can crop the lower part for 1/3 so that you can still keep your main 2 grapefruits and still have that nice curve of the branch. (You will get a king of panoramic picture though.) And I don''t know if you can saturate the yellow. : ) (I don''t know why I can always see the solution for others than for myself.) <br/> <br/></td>', 'Beautiful catching the movement of the trunk. But for suiting the title, maybe you can crop the lower part for 1/3 so that you can still keep your main 2 grapefruits and still have that nice curve of the branch. (You will get a king of panoramic picture though.) And I don''t know if you can saturate the yellow. : ) (I don''t know why I can always see the solution for others than for myself.)  ', '2004-12-14 07:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1061599, 126197, 26487, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful and elegant shot. Simple is great. isn''t it? I think small amount of yellow can make itself dominant, too. if you can make yellow brighter, it would be real dominant. Good job!</td>', 'What a beautiful and elegant shot. Simple is great. isn''t it? I think small amount of yellow can make itself dominant, too. if you can make yellow brighter, it would be real dominant. Good job!', '2004-12-14 07:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1061601, 126680, 27767, '<td valign="top">I really like the creativity in this shot.  The little guy''s face at the end of the word has a huge impact.  Good job :)</td>', 'I really like the creativity in this shot.  The little guy''s face at the end of the word has a huge impact.  Good job :)', '2004-12-14 07:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1061603, 125895, 27767, '<td valign="top">Daang, now that is some lens flare.  It is quite interesting to look at, and I like the strong diagonal line it creates.</td>', 'Daang, now that is some lens flare.  It is quite interesting to look at, and I like the strong diagonal line it creates.', '2004-12-14 07:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1061606, 126467, 27767, '<td valign="top">I really like the abstract feel to this shot.  The highlighted area and then the darkening toward the edges of the circle looks really cool.  Good top center placement.</td>', 'I really like the abstract feel to this shot.  The highlighted area and then the darkening toward the edges of the circle looks really cool.  Good top center placement.', '2004-12-14 07:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1061608, 126674, 27767, '<td valign="top">That is an awesome little pedestal.  That can really make almost any subject look great. I like the change from light to darkness in the pedestal, and all the reflections are quite interesting too. I like to border in this case.</td>', 'That is an awesome little pedestal.  That can really make almost any subject look great. I like the change from light to darkness in the pedestal, and all the reflections are quite interesting too. I like to border in this case.', '2004-12-14 07:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1061609, 126772, 27767, '<td valign="top">Great perspective here, though I might have moved up just a little closer to cut out some of the distracting objects on the horizon. I think the angle of the car on the road and the yellow lines running underneath it look great.</td>', 'Great perspective here, though I might have moved up just a little closer to cut out some of the distracting objects on the horizon. I think the angle of the car on the road and the yellow lines running underneath it look great.', '2004-12-14 07:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1061612, 126677, 27767, '<td valign="top">Supurb details on this flower, and I like the soft blur of the pedals and blue background. Nice use of contrasting colors for this challenge.</td>', 'Supurb details on this flower, and I like the soft blur of the pedals and blue background. Nice use of contrasting colors for this challenge.', '2004-12-14 07:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1061614, 126509, 27767, '<td valign="top">I dig the originality of this entry :)  Great idea.  I might have tried dark lighting to give it a more halloweenish feel, and it might even hide the two props sticking out at the bottom too.</td>', 'I dig the originality of this entry :)  Great idea.  I might have tried dark lighting to give it a more halloweenish feel, and it might even hide the two props sticking out at the bottom too.', '2004-12-14 07:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1061616, 126117, 27767, '<td valign="top">My favorite part of this shot is the composition.  I love the placement of the headlight and the wheel, and leaving the rest of the car completely out of the shot.</td>', 'My favorite part of this shot is the composition.  I love the placement of the headlight and the wheel, and leaving the rest of the car completely out of the shot.', '2004-12-14 08:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1061623, 125683, 26500, '<td valign="top">Seems a tad underexposed.  Still one of my favorites of the challenge.<br/> <br/>Well done!<br/> <br/>Second glance:<br/>Bumping to -9-</td>', 'Seems a tad underexposed.  Still one of my favorites of the challenge. Well done! Second glance:Bumping to -9-', '2004-12-14 08:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
