(1061629, 126098, 27767, '<td valign="top">I really love the composition of this shot.  I love the flow of the arrows in from the top left, down through the center, and out the bottom right. Quite interesting.</td>', 'I really love the composition of this shot.  I love the flow of the arrows in from the top left, down through the center, and out the bottom right. Quite interesting.', '2004-12-14 08:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
