(1061670, 126875, 29282, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast between the backlit yellow and the totally black sky.  Interesting use of angle to.</td>', 'Love the contrast between the backlit yellow and the totally black sky.  Interesting use of angle to.', '2004-12-14 09:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1061681, 125561, 8891, '<td valign="top">Very nice abstract...like the detail in the egg (?) and the colors.</td>', 'Very nice abstract...like the detail in the egg (?) and the colors.', '2004-12-14 09:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1061688, 126863, 26756, '<td valign="top">The wire / cloth mesh is really unusual.  I think it worked effectively to break up the boredom of a solid yellow background, even though it would be strange to find with a flower.  If the flower was supposed to be the main subject though, I actually found my eyes drawn to the different in-focus parts of the mesh because the lighting on the flower is a bit dark and flat compared to that.  Nice job.</td>', 'The wire / cloth mesh is really unusual.  I think it worked effectively to break up the boredom of a solid yellow background, even though it would be strange to find with a flower.  If the flower was supposed to be the main subject though, I actually found my eyes drawn to the different in-focus parts of the mesh because the lighting on the flower is a bit dark and flat compared to that.  Nice job.', '2004-12-14 09:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1061712, 126743, 24841, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Since the shot is so close I would have liked to have seen the lashes without yellow and the nails a little neater with the color, the look for this pic is in the detail.  Good idea and comp.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Since the shot is so close I would have liked to have seen the lashes without yellow and the nails a little neater with the color, the look for this pic is in the detail.  Good idea and comp.', '2004-12-14 10:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1061713, 125786, 24841, '<td valign="top">I like this night shot, somthing is a litle off probably the light coming up from the bottom and the shadow, the top around the light is so crisp, the bottom distracts, but a beautiful shot anyway.</td>', 'I like this night shot, somthing is a litle off probably the light coming up from the bottom and the shadow, the top around the light is so crisp, the bottom distracts, but a beautiful shot anyway.', '2004-12-14 10:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
