(1061828, 125671, 16965, '<td valign="top">Now *THAT* is one patient model!  Great concept, but the lighting is a little flat.  Maybe moving the light source down to the model''s eye level, and a little closer to the camera would have given more dynamic light on this shot.  I like the texture in the background, but some voters might not.</td>', 'Now *THAT* is one patient model!  Great concept, but the lighting is a little flat.  Maybe moving the light source down to the model''s eye level, and a little closer to the camera would have given more dynamic light on this shot.  I like the texture in the background, but some voters might not.', '2004-12-14 12:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
