(1061839, 126603, 16965, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, but there is just too little yellow in the shot.  I''m scoring well, based on the composition and the contrasting colors here, and I hope voters aren''t too closed minded for you!</td>', 'I really like this shot, but there is just too little yellow in the shot.  I''m scoring well, based on the composition and the contrasting colors here, and I hope voters aren''t too closed minded for you!', '2004-12-14 12:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
