(1062022, 126834, 24715, '<td valign="top">I like the effect that grain gives this photo. Makes it look kinda old.</td>', 'I like the effect that grain gives this photo. Makes it look kinda old.', '2004-12-14 14:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062024, 125958, 24715, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and focus. Well done.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and focus. Well done.', '2004-12-14 14:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062026, 126741, 24715, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I really like the focus, the texture of the corn. Light is good as well. Good luck!</td>', 'Nice composition. I really like the focus, the texture of the corn. Light is good as well. Good luck!', '2004-12-14 14:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062027, 126834, 4285, '<td valign="top">In order to make an interesting shot of a simple item such as this you should probably try shooting it from a different angle. Maybe lit from one side so that the stronger shadow you produce has a purpose. Also you may try using a tripod to make your subject as sharp as possible. I''m also seeing some noise which could easily be eliminated using Neat Image or other noise reduction programs. Hope this helps.</td>', 'In order to make an interesting shot of a simple item such as this you should probably try shooting it from a different angle. Maybe lit from one side so that the stronger shadow you produce has a purpose. Also you may try using a tripod to make your subject as sharp as possible. I''m also seeing some noise which could easily be eliminated using Neat Image or other noise reduction programs. Hope this helps.', '2004-12-14 14:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062035, 125730, 24715, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Good lighting, colors. I will have to come bac and read your detailed explanation on this one :-)</td>', 'Interesting composition. Good lighting, colors. I will have to come bac and read your detailed explanation on this one :-)', '2004-12-14 15:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062037, 126656, 17505, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model and composition. I wish there were more backlighting to hightlight her hair, which is also beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful model and composition. I wish there were more backlighting to hightlight her hair, which is also beautiful.', '2004-12-14 15:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062038, 126868, 24715, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, the shadow definitely creates more interests. Good focus.</td>', 'Nice composition, the shadow definitely creates more interests. Good focus.', '2004-12-14 15:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062042, 126447, 24715, '<td valign="top">Intriguing! Makes one use their imagination ;-) Excellent lighting and focus. Very fitting title, too. Good luck!</td>', 'Intriguing! Makes one use their imagination ;-) Excellent lighting and focus. Very fitting title, too. Good luck!', '2004-12-14 15:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062057, 126628, 24715, '<td valign="top">Great idea, well executed photo!</td>', 'Great idea, well executed photo!', '2004-12-14 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062058, 126453, 24715, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! Colors, focus and composition are great!</td>', 'Nicely done! Colors, focus and composition are great!', '2004-12-14 15:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062061, 126256, 24715, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus and DoF. Good subject, great colors.</td>', 'Excellent focus and DoF. Good subject, great colors.', '2004-12-14 15:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062064, 126816, 30594, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure exactly what makes this particular image "yellow" the content is obviously yellow; but with this macro shot i''m not 100% sure what it is exactly. A bus? Something construction related? I could see this exact image in just about any comerically manufacted color; be it red, green, orange, etc. The play between the cracks, scratches, and the water is effective in adding interest to this photograph. I would try to think more conceptually about the photograph in the future. keep up the good work though.</td>', 'I''m not sure exactly what makes this particular image "yellow" the content is obviously yellow; but with this macro shot i''m not 100% sure what it is exactly. A bus? Something construction related? I could see this exact image in just about any comerically manufacted color; be it red, green, orange, etc. The play between the cracks, scratches, and the water is effective in adding interest to this photograph. I would try to think more conceptually about the photograph in the future. keep up the good work though.', '2004-12-14 15:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062066, 126713, 30303, '<td valign="top">Urine samples...<br/> <br/>I''m sorry, I couldn''t resist ^^;</td>', 'Urine samples... I''m sorry, I couldn''t resist ^^;', '2004-12-14 15:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062067, 125878, 25468, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of the flower, but I get a ''dingy'' vibe from the color cast.</td>', 'I like the composition of the flower, but I get a ''dingy'' vibe from the color cast.', '2004-12-14 15:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062068, 125929, 25468, '<td valign="top">Cute cat and a great candid. I doubt you''ll take the voters breath away with this but I like it.</td>', 'Cute cat and a great candid. I doubt you''ll take the voters breath away with this but I like it.', '2004-12-14 15:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
