(1062072, 126308, 25468, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of the shallow DOF but these look like Russian Soldiers to me which reminds me of that Scorpions song "Wind of Change". You didn''t score high IMHO with composition, but for me the memory evocation raises it some. 5</td>', 'I''m not a fan of the shallow DOF but these look like Russian Soldiers to me which reminds me of that Scorpions song "Wind of Change". You didn''t score high IMHO with composition, but for me the memory evocation raises it some. 5', '2004-12-14 15:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
