(1062758, 126225, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, in focus.  I actually think this would have made a wonderful geometric abstract by zooming into one or more letters (probably around the lady) of this pretty sign.  Sort of what the person did with Toys R Us.  I find the current composition less compelling; I am not sure why the car is included, with the headlights, at least in terms of artistic presentation.</td>', 'Nice colors, in focus.  I actually think this would have made a wonderful geometric abstract by zooming into one or more letters (probably around the lady) of this pretty sign.  Sort of what the person did with Toys R Us.  I find the current composition less compelling; I am not sure why the car is included, with the headlights, at least in terms of artistic presentation.', '2004-12-14 23:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
