(1062763, 126759, 23394, '<td valign="top">great image!  desat really pops.  i''m not sure how you went about this, but there may be a way to do this under basic editing that will desat all but the umbrella, leaving the crud on the ground bw.  all the same, i like this image!  good luck!</td>', 'great image!  desat really pops.  i''m not sure how you went about this, but there may be a way to do this under basic editing that will desat all but the umbrella, leaving the crud on the ground bw.  all the same, i like this image!  good luck!', '2004-12-14 23:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062765, 126614, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments:<br/>very impressive and showing creativity in finding a simile of ideas. Bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comments:very impressive and showing creativity in finding a simile of ideas. Bumping up.', '2004-12-14 23:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062766, 125851, 12253, '<td valign="top">I like the concept here, but I think the problem is that it doesn''t go "far" enough.  The lines present some drama, along with the color, yet they are very soft and offer little contrast.  The progression of the yellow is somewhat incomplete as well, being more centered rather than a gradient.  I think if you could have made it sharper, with a bit more contrast and a true gradient look, it would be a strong abstract and strong contender.</td>', 'I like the concept here, but I think the problem is that it doesn''t go "far" enough.  The lines present some drama, along with the color, yet they are very soft and offer little contrast.  The progression of the yellow is somewhat incomplete as well, being more centered rather than a gradient.  I think if you could have made it sharper, with a bit more contrast and a true gradient look, it would be a strong abstract and strong contender.', '2004-12-14 23:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062767, 126883, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments:<br/>A yellow rose in a golden shrine! Bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comments:A yellow rose in a golden shrine! Bumping up.', '2004-12-14 23:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062769, 125740, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is a cool image.  is it what you had in mind? or did you just get lucky?  how long did you have to wait?  and, how many takes did you get before packing it in?  sorry, but this is one of those deals where i can learn more from you than you from me...good job!</td>', 'this is a cool image.  is it what you had in mind? or did you just get lucky?  how long did you have to wait?  and, how many takes did you get before packing it in?  sorry, but this is one of those deals where i can learn more from you than you from me...good job!', '2004-12-14 23:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062771, 126614, 12253, '<td valign="top">This is very striking--I like the composition and the transitions and contrast.  I think it would have been stronger if it were sharper--I am not a sharp nut, but this looks soft to me.  Especially around the edges, particularly upper left and right.  Also, I would like to have seen a tonal trend--light at the bottom "center" of the object, and getting darker towards the edges.  It almost does that, but the pattern is broken upper left (particularly) and upper right.  Maybe a crop would help, or maybe it needs a reshoot, but it''s definitely a nice vision and worth doing.</td>', 'This is very striking--I like the composition and the transitions and contrast.  I think it would have been stronger if it were sharper--I am not a sharp nut, but this looks soft to me.  Especially around the edges, particularly upper left and right.  Also, I would like to have seen a tonal trend--light at the bottom "center" of the object, and getting darker towards the edges.  It almost does that, but the pattern is broken upper left (particularly) and upper right.  Maybe a crop would help, or maybe it needs a reshoot, but it''s definitely a nice vision and worth doing.', '2004-12-14 23:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062772, 125671, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments:<br/>Funny. Showing good sense of humor and very nice presentation. Would have love more detail in the eyes since they are looking at the viewer. However, good comp. Bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comments:Funny. Showing good sense of humor and very nice presentation. Would have love more detail in the eyes since they are looking at the viewer. However, good comp. Bumping up.', '2004-12-14 23:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062773, 126738, 23394, '<td valign="top">what an incredible composition.  did you just get lucky and stumble across it?  i''m not going to mark it down for soft focus, but i would recommend going back and revisiting it.  good luck!</td>', 'what an incredible composition.  did you just get lucky and stumble across it?  i''m not going to mark it down for soft focus, but i would recommend going back and revisiting it.  good luck!', '2004-12-14 23:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
