(1062788, 126061, 23394, '<td valign="top">how cool is this?  how did you come by this shot?  where you attracted to the signage, and then got lucky with the cyclist and the pedestrians?  did you have to wait long?  great composition, love the lines, and how the eye is led around so effortlessly.  whether intended or not, you have a great image here!  good luck!</td>', 'how cool is this?  how did you come by this shot?  where you attracted to the signage, and then got lucky with the cyclist and the pedestrians?  did you have to wait long?  great composition, love the lines, and how the eye is led around so effortlessly.  whether intended or not, you have a great image here!  good luck!', '2004-12-14 23:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
