(1062798, 126461, 23394, '<td valign="top">i''m scoring this a 6.  i like the image, but there is something very distracting about the light reflection on the surface.  i hate to say it, but i probably would have scored this higher had i not stopped to really look at it...all the same, good luck!  it is definitely an interesting image.</td>', 'i''m scoring this a 6.  i like the image, but there is something very distracting about the light reflection on the surface.  i hate to say it, but i probably would have scored this higher had i not stopped to really look at it...all the same, good luck!  it is definitely an interesting image.', '2004-12-14 23:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062805, 125274, 23394, '<td valign="top">that is one weird looking dude.  did you find him there, or did you put him there?  did you think it was your lucky day when you found him?  the lighting and shadows are fine by me, as is the dof.  i''m enjoying the negative space, as well.  good luck!</td>', 'that is one weird looking dude.  did you find him there, or did you put him there?  did you think it was your lucky day when you found him?  the lighting and shadows are fine by me, as is the dof.  i''m enjoying the negative space, as well.  good luck!', '2004-12-14 23:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
