(1063090, 125358, 12253, '<td valign="top">Wow, you made it without any comments (just spoiled that didn''t I)!  I see we had more than our misery in common this time.  I did a yellow pepper too.  But you got fewer 3''s than I did.  I was trailing you until the end--the vote scrubber obviously gave me a bit of a boost that you didn''t get.<br/> <br/>As to your shot: good placement, good light overall.  The tones in the pepper come through very rich, with a texture you wouldn''t get with another technique.  The reflections are a bit strong.  I do like the contrast between the background and the pepper, and the blue area underneath.  I think perhaps you gave this a bit too much with the flashlight.  Those LEDs are pretty strong.  FWIW, I gave this a 6.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow, you made it without any comments (just spoiled that didn''t I)!  I see we had more than our misery in common this time.  I did a yellow pepper too.  But you got fewer 3''s than I did.  I was trailing you until the end--the vote scrubber obviously gave me a bit of a boost that you didn''t get. As to your shot: good placement, good light overall.  The tones in the pepper come through very rich, with a texture you wouldn''t get with another technique.  The reflections are a bit strong.  I do like the contrast between the background and the pepper, and the blue area underneath.  I think perhaps you gave this a bit too much with the flashlight.  Those LEDs are pretty strong.  FWIW, I gave this a 6. ', '2004-12-15 00:48:06.000000', NULL, 0),
