(1063123, 126341, 24970, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get a chance to vote on this challenge, but did breeze through the pictures and this was by far my favorite. It''s too bad people can''t step out of their comfort zones a little and award truly great works of art. Beautiful job, and congrats on your top 20 in any case.</td>', 'I didn''t get a chance to vote on this challenge, but did breeze through the pictures and this was by far my favorite. It''s too bad people can''t step out of their comfort zones a little and award truly great works of art. Beautiful job, and congrats on your top 20 in any case.', '2004-12-15 00:54:42.000000', NULL, 0),
