(1063441, 126759, 18349, '<td valign="top">Yes, it''s oversharpened.  Yes, the stuff on the ground still has some color to it. But absolutely YES, it''s 100% legal.  I desaturated all the colors except yellow.  If it were a member''s challenge, I would have selected the umbrella and done a lot more touch-up work, but as it stands, I am really pleased that it did as well as it did.  39th place out of 395 entries still leaves me in the top 10% and that rocks!  Thanks for your votes and your comments! :o)</td>', 'Yes, it''s oversharpened.  Yes, the stuff on the ground still has some color to it. But absolutely YES, it''s 100% legal.  I desaturated all the colors except yellow.  If it were a member''s challenge, I would have selected the umbrella and done a lot more touch-up work, but as it stands, I am really pleased that it did as well as it did.  39th place out of 395 entries still leaves me in the top 10% and that rocks!  Thanks for your votes and your comments! :o)', '2004-12-15 03:18:23.000000', NULL, 0),
