(1063585, 126061, 23458, '<td valign="top">I gave this a ten, felt it was one of the more interesting and creative approaches to the challenge. That you managed to catch the yellow jacketed bike rider as he passed the bike sign simply boggles my mind. This is clearly one of the best composed and richly nuanced images in this challenge. <br/> <br/></td>', 'I gave this a ten, felt it was one of the more interesting and creative approaches to the challenge. That you managed to catch the yellow jacketed bike rider as he passed the bike sign simply boggles my mind. This is clearly one of the best composed and richly nuanced images in this challenge.  ', '2004-12-15 07:03:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(1063588, 125879, 29132, '<td valign="top">An absolutely stunning photo! I can''t believe all the 1s, 2s and 3s it got... depressing and perhaps one of the best, recent examples of why the DPC voting process is in need of reform.</td>', 'An absolutely stunning photo! I can''t believe all the 1s, 2s and 3s it got... depressing and perhaps one of the best, recent examples of why the DPC voting process is in need of reform.', '2004-12-15 07:13:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(1063591, 125278, 21473, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all of the comments.  I think the main reason that I enter these challenges is so that I can get some input.  I am new at this hole thing.  I just like taking pictures, and you guys really help me to better my photos.</td>', 'Thanks for all of the comments.  I think the main reason that I enter these challenges is so that I can get some input.  I am new at this hole thing.  I just like taking pictures, and you guys really help me to better my photos.', '2004-12-15 07:20:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(1063593, 125278, 21473, '<td valign="top">After all of your input I took this picture and edited it more, with options I haven''t ever used, and it looks great now.</td>', 'After all of your input I took this picture and edited it more, with options I haven''t ever used, and it looks great now.', '2004-12-15 07:22:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1063596, 126397, 7889, '<td valign="top">No it is not Charlie Brown!! Its the back of Homer Jay Simpson''s head.<br/> <br/>I would be interested to know why I had a DQ request on this one, so whoever it was please let me know what you thought I had done outside of the rules.<br/> <br/>All I did was crop, resize, curves, usm<br/> <br/>thanks<br/>Mike<br/> <br/></td>', 'No it is not Charlie Brown!! Its the back of Homer Jay Simpson''s head. I would be interested to know why I had a DQ request on this one, so whoever it was please let me know what you thought I had done outside of the rules. All I did was crop, resize, curves, usm thanksMike ', '2004-12-15 07:26:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1063608, 126823, 24925, '<td valign="top">This is great...I think it''s the epitome of yellowness!<br/> <br/>Beautiful crop. The reflection of the duck is great.  I love the contrast between ducky and water (and great texture on the water, by the way) but I wish that the water was a more uniform shade...<br/> <br/>I didn''t vote, but this likely would have been my top score...</td>', 'This is great...I think it''s the epitome of yellowness! Beautiful crop. The reflection of the duck is great.  I love the contrast between ducky and water (and great texture on the water, by the way) but I wish that the water was a more uniform shade... I didn''t vote, but this likely would have been my top score...', '2004-12-15 07:33:48.000000', NULL, 0),
