(1063801, 126217, 10080, '<td valign="top">How in the world could you have gotoon a 1, 2, or 3 from anyone?? Just beautifully executed, and wonderful colors! Great job!</td>', 'How in the world could you have gotoon a 1, 2, or 3 from anyone?? Just beautifully executed, and wonderful colors! Great job!', '2004-12-15 09:58:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1063802, 126387, 25754, '<td valign="top">I was saying in the forums not too long ago that I''d settle for even a green ribbon for christmas this year so i got my wish! :D<br/>Sooo close I could taste yellow though (no pun intended)...<br/> <br/>Thanks so much everyone for your votes and comments, and I''m really happy with my best ever score and placing among such tough competition.</td>', 'I was saying in the forums not too long ago that I''d settle for even a green ribbon for christmas this year so i got my wish! :DSooo close I could taste yellow though (no pun intended)... Thanks so much everyone for your votes and comments, and I''m really happy with my best ever score and placing among such tough competition.', '2004-12-15 10:00:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1063803, 126368, 24951, '<td valign="top">I had given this a 10. I thought ''how creative'',thought the composition exceptional. Good art is never appreciated by the masses. One of the more thoughtful pieces of work I''ve seen in a while. I think there are quite a few that don''t like to have to think when they are visually challenged.</td>', 'I had given this a 10. I thought ''how creative'',thought the composition exceptional. Good art is never appreciated by the masses. One of the more thoughtful pieces of work I''ve seen in a while. I think there are quite a few that don''t like to have to think when they are visually challenged.', '2004-12-15 10:00:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1063823, 126341, 27574, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it..DPC has me very confused about the voting and what in the world goes on....this one should have been in the top three.  I really thought it should be #1!!!!!  This was the only 10 that I had.<br/> <br/>Manuel,this is an absolutely fantastic portrait.  I noticed one person mentioned the leaves on the rose being distracting.....on that one small detail I think he may be right.  I love your work and this one is a stunner.</td>', 'I don''t get it..DPC has me very confused about the voting and what in the world goes on....this one should have been in the top three.  I really thought it should be #1!!!!!  This was the only 10 that I had. Manuel,this is an absolutely fantastic portrait.  I noticed one person mentioned the leaves on the rose being distracting.....on that one small detail I think he may be right.  I love your work and this one is a stunner.', '2004-12-15 10:16:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1063838, 126703, 26464, '<td valign="top">nice work. and I agree that a few words or a phrase can sum up a whole page... this is coming from someone who is also a writer :-)<br/></td>', 'nice work. and I agree that a few words or a phrase can sum up a whole page... this is coming from someone who is also a writer :-)', '2004-12-15 10:25:11.000000', NULL, 0),
