(1065483, 126628, 5792, '<td valign="top">One of the best water drop images I have ever seen. Your use of the smiling yellow with frowns for the other colors is an inspired and creative idea. Technically very well done.<br/> <br/>It was my choice for top image in this challenge. This image will be better liked above most of the images that placed above it long after this challenge topic is forgotten. Kudos to you.</td>', 'One of the best water drop images I have ever seen. Your use of the smiling yellow with frowns for the other colors is an inspired and creative idea. Technically very well done. It was my choice for top image in this challenge. This image will be better liked above most of the images that placed above it long after this challenge topic is forgotten. Kudos to you.', '2004-12-16 08:48:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1065484, 125930, 5792, '<td valign="top">Outstanding image. Far better than it''s score would indicate.</td>', 'Outstanding image. Far better than it''s score would indicate.', '2004-12-16 08:50:27.000000', NULL, 0),
