(1065639, 126824, 27421, '<td valign="top">To me, the yellow color did not lend to the impact of the photo.... the blur led to the impact... but I am new here, and my opinion does not count for much.... being new, I wasn''t sure how to vote... I stayed away from 1''s, 9''s and 10''s....and I put my empasis on yellow leading to the impact of the photo, not so much the photo quality...your''s is quiet nice there....</td>', 'To me, the yellow color did not lend to the impact of the photo.... the blur led to the impact... but I am new here, and my opinion does not count for much.... being new, I wasn''t sure how to vote... I stayed away from 1''s, 9''s and 10''s....and I put my empasis on yellow leading to the impact of the photo, not so much the photo quality...your''s is quiet nice there....', '2004-12-16 11:34:53.000000', NULL, 0),
