(1065742, 126383, 14189, '<td valign="top">For those who were curious, this is a shot of dried rose petals. <br/> <br/>On a different note, I found this challenge very interesting. It certainly highlighted that many voters bring a strict interpretation of the challenge to the ballot box. It''s a shame that artists (not that I am one, either) can''t accept creativity. It calls to mind 19th century skeptics who said impressionism wasn''t art and would never last.</td>', 'For those who were curious, this is a shot of dried rose petals.  On a different note, I found this challenge very interesting. It certainly highlighted that many voters bring a strict interpretation of the challenge to the ballot box. It''s a shame that artists (not that I am one, either) can''t accept creativity. It calls to mind 19th century skeptics who said impressionism wasn''t art and would never last.', '2004-12-16 12:49:27.000000', NULL, 0),
