(1066596, 126387, 30645, '<td valign="top">wonderfull lighting.</td>', 'wonderfull lighting.', '2004-12-16 23:48:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1066626, 125375, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is a very attractive image and 59 out of 393 is not bad. The image is very well composed and hence your talent is displayed. The lighting is on the money and to a degree you have done all you can do and while it remains a beautiful image do not feel bad with its placing. Often times artistic efforts escape many voters. My suggestion is to stick with your ideas and to look at images. Go to the sites challenge archives and browse. Look at the images and read the comments. This will simply help expand your outlook. <br/> <br/>The image is indeed very nice and the water droplets along with placement spells a lovely to look at image.</td>', 'This is a very attractive image and 59 out of 393 is not bad. The image is very well composed and hence your talent is displayed. The lighting is on the money and to a degree you have done all you can do and while it remains a beautiful image do not feel bad with its placing. Often times artistic efforts escape many voters. My suggestion is to stick with your ideas and to look at images. Go to the sites challenge archives and browse. Look at the images and read the comments. This will simply help expand your outlook.  The image is indeed very nice and the water droplets along with placement spells a lovely to look at image.', '2004-12-17 00:15:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1066637, 126217, 15497, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Zoomdak:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by neehai:</b></div><hr/><i> You win. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I guess that would be correct now =) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Heh. neehai will tell me next weeks lotery numbers.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Zoomdak: Originally posted by neehai: You win.  I guess that would be correct now =)   Heh. neehai will tell me next weeks lotery numbers.', '2004-12-17 00:20:34.000000', NULL, 0),
