(1096873, 126860, 11800, '<td valign="top">Oh. This didn''t get any comments. It''s so bright and happy. Sorta like giving a party where no one comes. Well. The composition is good and the colors look true. The shadow on the bottom right is a little to dark compared to the bright look of the rest of the picture. I like the dof.<br/>I also wanted to say that I love your yellow balloon picture. It is one of the most ambiguous pictures I''ve ever looked at and it was a pleasure to see.</td>', 'Oh. This didn''t get any comments. It''s so bright and happy. Sorta like giving a party where no one comes. Well. The composition is good and the colors look true. The shadow on the bottom right is a little to dark compared to the bright look of the rest of the picture. I like the dof.I also wanted to say that I love your yellow balloon picture. It is one of the most ambiguous pictures I''ve ever looked at and it was a pleasure to see.', '2005-01-08 08:25:54.000000', NULL, 0),
